{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Noms des produits de sant\u00e9 naturels homologu\u00e9s (version francaise)", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "249688da-769c-49dc-b0b9-449b8e0666db", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Licensed Natural Health Product names", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "La Base de donn\u00e9es des produits de sant\u00e9 naturels homologu\u00e9s contient des renseignements sur les produits de sant\u00e9 naturels ayant re\u00e7u une licence de mise en march\u00e9 de Sant\u00e9 Canada.  Ce fichier de donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur les noms des PSN.\nLes produits homologu\u00e9s ont \u00e9t\u00e9 examin\u00e9s par Sant\u00e9 Canada et jug\u00e9s s\u00fbrs, efficaces et de haute qualit\u00e9 dans les conditions d'utilisation recommand\u00e9es. Vous pouvez trouver les produits de sant\u00e9 naturels homologu\u00e9s au moyen du num\u00e9ro de produit naturel (NPN) ou du num\u00e9ro de m\u00e9dicament hom\u00e9opathique (DIN-HM) figurant sur l'\u00e9tiquette du produit.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodnatur/applications/licen-prod/NHP_PRODUCT_NAMES.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www12.statcan.gc.ca/census-recensement/2011/dp-pd/prof/details/download-telecharger/comprehensive/comp_download.cfm?Lang=E&CTLG=98-316-XWE2011001&T=101&FMT=CSV", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www12.statcan.gc.ca/census-recensement/2011/dp-pd/prof/details/download-telecharger/comprehensive/comp_download.cfm?Lang=E&CTLG=98-316-XWE2011001&T=101&FMT=TAB", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2009-12-18", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "The Licensed Natural Health Products Database contains information about natural health products that have been issued a product licence by Health Canada. This data extract contains information on NHP Product names.\n\nProducts with a licence have been assessed by Health Canada and found to be safe, effective and of high quality under their recommended conditions of use. You can identify licensed natural health products by looking for the eight-digit Natural Product Number (NPN) or Homeopathic Medicine Number (DIN-HM) on the label.\n", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
