{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Registre des service pour le registre des brevets (version francaise)", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "0f1f9599-5057-40d5-b003-8761e85bccc1", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Patent Register, Patent Service", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le Registre des brevets est une liste alphab\u00e9tique des ingr\u00e9dients m\u00e9dicinaux et leurs brevets associ\u00e9s, les dates d'expiration des brevets et d'autres renseignements pertinents, conform\u00e9ment au R\u00e8glement sur les m\u00e9dicaments brevet\u00e9s (avis de conformit\u00e9) [DORS/133-93, tel que modifi\u00e9].", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://webprod3.hc-sc.gc.ca/patent/Patent.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://webprod3.hc-sc.gc.ca/patent/Patent.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2011-01-27", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "The Patent Register is an alphabetical listing of medicinal ingredients and their associated patents, the patent expiry dates and other related information established in accordanc