{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Base de donn\u00e9es sur les produits pharmaceutiques - esp\u00e8ce v\u00e9t\u00e9rinaire (version francaise)", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "d1136fe2-f412-43cc-98d4-c90df98ba1bd", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Drug Product Database - Veterinary Species", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "\n        La Base de donn\u00e9es sur les produits pharmaceutiques (BDPP) saisit les donn\u00e9es sur les produits \u00e0 usages humains et v\u00e9t\u00e9rinaires et sur les d\u00e9sinfectants dont l'utilisation est approuv\u00e9e par Sant\u00e9 Canada.\n\n        L'extrait porte sur les produits commercialis\u00e9s (actifs) et discontinu\u00e9s.\n\n        L'extrait des donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur l'esp\u00e8ce v\u00e9t\u00e9rinaire des produits pharmaceutiques.\n      ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodpharma/databasdon/vet_ia.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodpharma/databasdon/ther_ia.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2002-12-09", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "\n        The Drug Product Database (DPD) system captures information on Canadian human, veterinary and disinfectant products approved for use by Health Canada.\n        This extract contains both marketed (active) and discontinued (inactivated) products in separate files.\n        This data extract contains information about Drug Product Veterinary Species.\n      ", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
