{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Base de donn\u00e9es sur les produits pharmaceutiques - produits pharmaceutiques (version francaise)", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "b8df23da-1925-4a9a-99bc-3f99da83b2c2", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Drug Product Database - Drug Product", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "\n        La Base de donn\u00e9es sur les produits pharmaceutiques (BDPP) saisit les donn\u00e9es sur les produits \u00e0 usages humains et v\u00e9t\u00e9rinaires et sur les d\u00e9sinfectants dont l'utilisation est approuv\u00e9e par Sant\u00e9 Canada.\n\n        L'extrait porte sur les produits commercialis\u00e9s (actifs) et discontinu\u00e9s.\n\n        L'extrait des donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur les produits pharmaceutiques.\n      ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodpharma/databasdon/drug_ia.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodpharma/databasdon/comp_ia.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2002-12-09", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "\n        The Drug Product Database (DPD) system captures information on Canadian human, veterinary and disinfectant products approved for use by Health Canada.\n        This extract contains both marketed (active) and discontinued (inactivated) products in separate files.\n        This data extract contains information about Drug Products.\n      ", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Base de donn\u00e9es sur les produits pharmaceutiques - ingr\u00e9dients actifs (version francaise)", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "6bac7d85-195c-4c82-9076-9d3cd00dafee", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Drug Product Database - Active Ingredients", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "\n        La Base de donn\u00e9es sur les produits pharmaceutiques (BDPP) saisit les donn\u00e9es sur les produits \u00e0 usages humains et v\u00e9t\u00e9rinaires et sur les d\u00e9sinfectants dont l'utilisation est approuv\u00e9e par Sant\u00e9 Canada.\n\n        L'extrait porte sur les produits commercialis\u00e9s (actifs) et discontinu\u00e9s.\n\n        L'extrait des donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur les ingr\u00e9dients actifs des produits pharmaceutiques.\n      ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodpharma/databasdon/ingred_ia.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodpharma/databasdon/allfiles_ia.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2002-12-09", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "\n        The Drug Product Database (DPD) system captures information on Canadian human, veterinary and disinfectant products approved for use by Health Canada.\n        This extract contains both marketed (active) and discontinued (inactivated) products in separate files.\n        This data extract contains information about Drug Product Active Ingredients.\n      ", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Listes de retrait de march\u00e9 des instruments m\u00e9dicaux", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "a3988e9b-c302-41a4-8513-3a76e2a0ed42", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Medical Device Recall Listings", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "\n        Cette section pr\u00e9sente des renseignements g\u00e9n\u00e9raux au sujet de m\u00e9dicaments et d'instruments m\u00e9dicaux retir\u00e9s du march\u00e9 canadien par les fabricants, importateurs, distributeurs, entre autres.\n        Le R\u00e8glement sur les instruments m\u00e9dicaux d\u00e9finit comme suit : un \u00ab rappel \u00bb - Mesure prise par le fabricant, l'importateur ou le distributeur, apr\u00e8s la vente de l'instrument m\u00e9dical, visant \u00e0 en faire le rappel, \u00e0 y apporter des correctifs ou \u00e0 aviser le propri\u00e9taire ou l'utilisateur de la d\u00e9fectuosit\u00e9 -- r\u00e9elle ou potentielle --, apr\u00e8s qu'il se soit rendu compte que l'instrument, selon le cas\n        1.\tpeut \u00eatre dangereux pour la sant\u00e9,\n        2.\tpeut ne pas \u00eatre conforme aux affirmations du fabricant ou de l'importateur relativement \u00e0 son efficacit\u00e9, \u00e0 ses avantages, \u00e0 ses caract\u00e9ristiques de rendement ou \u00e0 sa s\u00fbret\u00e9,\n        3.\tpeut ne pas \u00eatre conforme \u00e0 la Loi ou au pr\u00e9sent r\u00e8glement.\n      ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/xls/compli-conform/recall-retrait/list/md-im_recalls-retrait_jan-mar_2012-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/xls/compli-conform/recall-retrait/list/md-im_recalls-retrait_jan-mar_2012-fra.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-01-19", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "\n        This section has been designed to provide general information about drugs and medical devices that have been recalled from the Canadian market by manufacturers, importers, distributors among others.\n        In the Medical Devices Regulations a recall is defined as: any action taken by the manufacturer, importer or distributor of the device that has been sold, to recall or correct the device, or to notify its owners and users of its defectiveness or potential defectiveness, after becoming aware that the device:\n        1.\tmay be hazardous to health;\n        2.\tmay fail to conform to any claim made by the manufacturer or importer relating to its effectiveness, benefits, performance characteristics or safety; or\n        3.\tmay not meet the requirements set in the Act or the Regulations.\n      ", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Listes de retrait de march\u00e9 des m\u00e9dicaments", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "7c69bacf-0276-4aa0-bad7-cb77ef403d2c", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Drug Recall Listings", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "\n        Cette section pr\u00e9sente des renseignements g\u00e9n\u00e9raux au sujet de m\u00e9dicaments et d'instruments m\u00e9dicaux retir\u00e9s du march\u00e9 canadien par les fabricants, importateurs, distributeurs, entre autres.\n\n        En ce qui concerne un produit de sant\u00e9 autre qu'un instrument m\u00e9dical, il s'agit du retrait, par l'entreprise, de la vente ou de l'utilisation, ou encore de la correction d'un produit distribu\u00e9 qui pose un risque pour la sant\u00e9 des consommateurs canadiens ou enfreint la loi administr\u00e9e par la Direction g\u00e9n\u00e9rale des produits de sant\u00e9 et des aliments.\n      ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/xls/compli-conform/recall-retrait/list/drugs-drogues_recall-retrait_jan-mar_2012-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/xls/compli-conform/recall-retrait/list/drugs-drogues_recall-retrait_jan-mar_2012-fra.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2011-12-12", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "\n        This section has been designed to provide general information about drugs and medical devices that have been recalled from the Canadian market by manufacturers, importers, distributors among others.\n\n        With respect to a health product other than a medical device, it means a firm's removal from further sale or use, or correction, of a distributed product that presents a risk to the health of consumers or violates legislation administered by the Health Products and Food Branch.\n      ", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
