{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "AUTORISATIONS DE D\u00c9PENSES POUR l'ANN\u00c9E FISCALE EN COURS 2012-13", "keywords": "Statutory expenditures,statutory authority,available expenditure authorities,expenditure authority,voted authorities,Estimates,Main Estimates,Supplementary Estimates,budgetary expenditures,allocations from Treasury Board Central votes.", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "2eed2fba-1626-4d2e-a511-389cc6b51ddf", "subject": "Government and Politics  Gouvernement et vie politique", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Monthly | Mensuel", "title": "MONTHLY EXPENDITURE AUTHORITY FOR CURRENT FISCAL YEAR 2012-13", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Ce tableau fournit les pr\u00e9visions des autorisations l\u00e9gislatives et les autorisations de d\u00e9penses de l'ann\u00e9e disponibles pour les autorisations vot\u00e9es par le Minist\u00e8re, l'organisme et la soci\u00e9t\u00e9 d'\u00c9tat pour lesquels un besoin financier a \u00e9t\u00e9 d\u00e9termin\u00e9, que ce soit dans le Budget principal des d\u00e9penses ou le Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses. Le tableau pr\u00e9sente aussi une autorisation de d\u00e9penses accord\u00e9e au moyen d'affectations des cr\u00e9dits centraux du Conseil du Tr\u00e9sor (soumise \u00e0 l'approbation du Conseil du Tr\u00e9sor).\nEn temps de projet pilote, ce tableau sera mis \u00e0 jours tous les mois et sera pour la p\u00e9riode du 1er avril 2012 au 31 mars 2013.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/aegc-bdgc/2012/ae-ad05-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/aegc-bdgc/2012/ae-ad05-fra.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-02-28", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/aegc-bdgc/aegc-bdgc-fra.asp", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "2012-07-31", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/aegc-bdgc/aegc-bdgc-eng.asp", "notes": "This table provides forecasts of the in-year available expenditure authorities for voted and statutory authorities by Government of Canada Department, Agency, and Crown Corporation for which a financial requirement has been identified, whether in Main Estimates, or Supplementary Estimates. This table also presents expenditure authority provided through allocations from Treasury Board Central votes (subject to the approval of Treasury Board).\nThe implementation of this table is in the pilot phase and will be updated on a monthly basis, covering the period from April 1, 2012 to March 31, 2013.\n", "owner_org": "tbs-sct", "keywords_fra": "Pr\u00e9visions des autorisations l\u00e9gislatives,les autorisations de d\u00e9penses de l'ann\u00e9e disponibles pour les autorisations vot\u00e9es,Budget principal des d\u00e9penses,Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses,d\u00e9penses budg\u00e9taires,cr\u00e9dits centraux du Conseil du Tr\u00e9sor"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Pr\u00e9visions l\u00e9gislatives Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses (A) 2012-13", "keywords": "Statutory items,Supplementary Estimates,Supplementary Estimates A,Supplementary Estimates A 2012-13,Estimates,employment insurance operating account,Statutory Forecasts - Budgetary Expenditures,Statutory forecasts,budgetary expenditures.", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "d6a662f3-e517-44c7-a1c3-b25c9905a43b", "subject": "Government and Politics  Gouvernement et vie politique", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "Statutory Forecast Supplementary Estimates (A) 2012-13", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Ce tableau fournit au Parlement une mise \u00e0 jour des changements importants apport\u00e9s aux pr\u00e9visions des d\u00e9penses li\u00e9es aux grands postes l\u00e9gislatifs. Les postes l\u00e9gislatifs sont ceux que le Parlement a approuv\u00e9s par l'adoption d'autres textes l\u00e9gislatifs qui pr\u00e9cisent les fins auxquelles peuvent servir les d\u00e9penses et les conditions dans lesquelles elles peuvent \u00eatre effectu\u00e9es. Les d\u00e9penses l\u00e9gislatives sont incluses dans le budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses \u00e0 titre d'information uniquement.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/20122013/sups/a/sfbe-pldb-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/20122013/sups/a/sfbe-pldb-fra.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-05-17", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/20122013/se-bs-fra.asp", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/20122013/se-bs-eng.asp", "notes": "This table provides Parliament with an update on significant changes to expenditure forecasts of major statutory items. Statutory items are those that Parliament has approved through other legislation that sets out both the purpose of the expenditures and the terms and conditions under which they may be made. Statutory spending is displayed in the Supplementary Estimates for information only.", "owner_org": "tbs-sct", "keywords_fra": "Postes l\u00e9gislatifs du pr\u00e9sent budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses,pr\u00e9visions des d\u00e9penses,postes l\u00e9gislatifs,Les d\u00e9penses l\u00e9gislatives,Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses B 2010-2011,Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses B,Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses,La Loi du cr\u00e9dits,les autorisations de d\u00e9penser,compte des op\u00e9rations de l'assurance-emploi"}
