{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "L'inventaire des organisations du gouvernement du Canada - Profils des soci\u00e9t\u00e9s d'\u00c9tat ", "keywords": "Crown corporation,ministerial portfolio,applied title,abbreviation,appropriate Minister,Chairperson,Institutional Head,Consituent Act,year of incorporation,status,mandate,corporate profile,head office,address,telephone,fax,website,fiscal year-end,auditors", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "e9dfd570-fea3-4862-85a2-d69482fffdbe", "subject": "Government and Politics  Gouvernement et vie politique", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "Inventory of the Government of Canada Organizations - Crown corporations profiles", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le profil de chaque soci\u00e9t\u00e9 d'\u00c9tat m\u00e8re comprend le nom des principaux responsables de la soci\u00e9t\u00e9 d'\u00c9tat, l'adresse de ses bureaux, son mandat ainsi que ses principales activit\u00e9s. Le profil pr\u00e9cise aussi le fondement l\u00e9gislatif en vertu duquel la soci\u00e9t\u00e9 d'\u00c9tat a \u00e9t\u00e9 constitu\u00e9e, fait \u00e9tat de la fa\u00e7on dont la Loi sur la gestion des finances publiques (LGFP) s'applique \u00e0 la soci\u00e9t\u00e9 et indique si elle est mandataire ou non de Sa Majest\u00e9. ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "XML", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/reports-rapports/cc-se/data-eng.asp", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "XML", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/reports-rappo