{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Sommaire des modifications apport\u00e9es aux cr\u00e9dits vot\u00e9s - budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses (B) 2012-2013", "keywords": "Summary of Changes to Voted Appropriations,Supplementary Estimates,Supplementary Estimates B,Supplementary Estimates B 2012-13,Estimates,Available Spending Authorities,", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "200c04af-4365-4569-846e-1755cf22cf00", "subject": "Government and Politics  Gouvernement et vie politique", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "Summary of Changes to Voted Appropriations - Supplementary Estimates (B) 2012-13", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Ce tableau fournit l'information concernant les cr\u00e9dits de ce budget suppl\u00e9mentaire par minist\u00e8re. Num\u00e9ro du cr\u00e9dit indique quel cr\u00e9dit est accru dans le cadre du pr\u00e9sent budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses. Montant brut indique le total des fonds demand\u00e9s, Moins : Autorisations de d\u00e9penser disponibles repr\u00e9sente les pouvoirs de d\u00e9penser inutilis\u00e9s qu'invoquent les organisations pour r\u00e9duire le montant demand\u00e9, et Montant net indique le montant net du financement suppl\u00e9mentaire.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/ems-sgd/sups/b/20122013/scvab-smavd-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/ems-sgd/sups/b/20122013/scvab-smavd-eng.asp", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/ems-sgd/sups/b/20122013/scvab-smavd-fra.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/ems-sgd/sups/b/20122013/scvab-smavd-fra.asp", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-11-08", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "The table displays voted information in Supplementary Estimates. Vote Number indicates the Vote to be augmented, the letter accompanying the Vote indicates which Supplementary Estimates was used to augment the Vote, Gross Amount displays the total amount of funding, Less: Available Spending Authorities represents unused spending authority being used by organizations to minimize the amount being requested, and Net Amount displays the net amount of incremental funding reflected.", "owner_org": "tbs-sct", "keywords_fra": "Sommaire des modifications apport\u00e9es aux cr\u00e9dits vot\u00e9s,Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses B 2012-2013,Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses B,Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses,Autorisations de d\u00e9penser disponibles"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Pr\u00e9visions l\u00e9gislatives - Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses (B) 2012-13", "keywords": "Statutory forecasts,Statutory forecasts 2012-13 Main Estimates,Statutory Forecasts - Budgetary Expenditures,Statutory Forecasts - Non-Budgetary Authorities", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "63909a4d-966c-4573-84f1-c01da6721552", "subject": "Government and Politics  Gouvernement et vie politique", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "Statutory Forecasts - Supplementary Estimates (B) 2012-13", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Ce tableau fournit au Parlement une mise \u00e0 jour des changements importants apport\u00e9s aux pr\u00e9visions des d\u00e9penses li\u00e9es aux grands postes l\u00e9gislatifs. Les postes l\u00e9gislatifs sont ceux que le Parlement a approuv\u00e9s par l'adoption d'autres textes l\u00e9gislatifs qui pr\u00e9cisent les fins auxquelles peuvent servir les d\u00e9penses et les conditions dans lesquelles elles peuvent \u00eatre effectu\u00e9es. Les d\u00e9penses l\u00e9gislatives sont incluses dans le budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses \u00e0 titre d'information uniquement. ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/ems-sgd/sups/b/20122013/sfbe-pldb-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/ems-sgd/sups/b/20122013/sfbe-pldb-eng.asp", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/ems-sgd/sups/b/20122013/sfbe-pldb-fra.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/ems-sgd/sups/b/20122013/sfbe-pldb-fra.asp", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-11-08", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "This table provides Parliament with an update on significant changes to expenditure forecasts of major statutory items. Statutory items are those that Parliament has approved through other legislation that sets out both the purpose of the expenditures and the terms and conditions under which they may be made. Statutory spending is displayed in the Supplementary Estimates for information only.", "owner_org": "tbs-sct", "keywords_fra": "Postes l\u00e9gislatifs du pr\u00e9sent budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses,pr\u00e9visions des d\u00e9penses,postes l\u00e9gislatifs,Les d\u00e9penses l\u00e9gislatives,Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses B 2012-2013,Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses B,Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses,La Loi du cr\u00e9dits,les autorisations de d\u00e9penser,compte des op\u00e9rations de l'assurance-emploi"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es historiques sur les projets 2009-2010", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "6f3d9ed0-4235-4ee0-9b02-a3e498735b91", "subject": "Processes  Liens et fonctions", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Historical Project Data Set 2009-2010", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "L'Ensemble de donn\u00e9es historiques sur les projets fait \u00e9tat des d\u00e9penses li\u00e9es \u00e0 la mise en ouvre des projets d'aide de l'ACDI selon le pays o\u00f9 s'ex\u00e9cute le projet, le secteur, le type de projet et l'organisation partenaire, le tout dans une m\u00eame source. L'Ensemble de donn\u00e9es historiques contient aussi les caract\u00e9ristiques sp\u00e9cifiques des projets d'aide de l'ACDI comme l'\u00e9tat de d\u00e9liement, les objectifs g\u00e9n\u00e9raux des politiques et le type de mod\u00e8le d'ex\u00e9cution. ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/INET/IMAGES.NSF/vLUImages/Open%20Data/$file/HPDS-2009-2010-eng.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/INET/IMAGES.NSF/vLUImages/Open%20Data/$file/HPDS-2009-2010-fra.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2011-11-30", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "The Historical Project Data Set is a single source for CIDA's aid project expenditures, detailed by country, sector, type of project, and partner organization. The Historical Project Data Set also contains useful information about the specific characteristics of CIDA's aid projects, such as the tying status, the general policy objectives, and the type of delivery model used to deliver the aid. ", "owner_org": "cida-acdi", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Ensemble des donn\u00e9es de la Banque de projets", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "7ae03c99-e9f2-42f2-aae4-8020871545a9", "subject": "Processes  Liens et fonctions", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Project Browser Data Set", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "La Banque de projets renferme des renseignements de base sur les projets financ\u00e9s par l'ACDI. On peut consulter les profils des projets \u00e0 partir du site Web principal de l'ACDI, c'est-\u00e0-dire chercher dans des listes de projets associ\u00e9es aux pages sur les pays et dans d'autres listes pr\u00e9\u00e9tablies ou encore faire une recherche de base ou une recherche avanc\u00e9e dans la Banque de projets.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/cidaweb/cpo.nsf/vLUOpenDataFile/PBOpenData/$file/Project%20Browser%20English.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/cidaweb/cpo.nsf/vLUOpenDataFile/PBOpenData/$file/Banque%20de%20projets%20francais.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2011-07-14", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "The Project Browser provides basic information on CIDA-funded projects. Project profiles can be accessed through CIDA's main website, through project lists linked to country pages and other pre-established lists, or by using the Project Browser's basic or advanced search functions.\n", "owner_org": "cida-acdi", "keywords_fra": ""}
