{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Demandes trait\u00e9es a l'\u00e9tranger et le temps de traitement pour les r\u00e9sidents temporaires", "keywords": "Temporary residents,Foreign Students,Foreign Workers", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "ce64edb2-6a3d-43e5-bb79-714d43827c3c", "subject": "Persons  Personnes", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Monthly | Mensuel", "title": "Temporary Residents Applications Processed Abroad and Processing Times", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Tableaux. Cet ensemble de donn\u00e9es se compose de trois tableaux interactifs distincts, accessibles par les onglets au bas de la feuille de calcul. Les tableaux peuvent \u00eatre personnalis\u00e9s en utilisant certains ou la totalit\u00e9 des limiteurs suivants, selon l'affichage du tableau principal :\nLangue : anglais ou fran\u00e7ais.\nEmplacement du bureau des visas : points de service \u00e0 l'\u00e9tranger dans les grandes r\u00e9gions suivantes : Afrique et Moyen-Orient; Asie et Pacifique; Europe; et Am\u00e9rique.\nAffichage du tableau : quelques statistiques peuvent \u00eatre consult\u00e9es selon le nombre de cas trait\u00e9s (y compris les cas approuv\u00e9s et refus\u00e9s, le taux d'approbation et le nombre de visas d\u00e9livr\u00e9s), les d\u00e9lais de traitement (en g\u00e9n\u00e9ral le pourcentage de cas trait\u00e9s dans un certain nombre de mois ou jours ), ou le nombre de personnes.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000037-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000037-fra.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-29", "time_period_coverage_start": "2007-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2012-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "2013-04-02", "url": "", "notes": "Tables.  This data set consists of 3 separate, interactive tables accessible by the tabs at the bottom of the spreadsheet.  Tables may be customized using some or all of the following limiters, depending on the primary table view:\nLanguage:  English or French.\nVisa office location:  points of service overseas in the following broad areas:  Africa and Middle East, Asia and Pacific, Europe, and the Americas.\nTable view:  some statistics may be viewed by the number of cases processed (including cases passed, cases refused, approval rate percentage and number of visas issued), by processing times (usually the percentage of cases processed within a certain number of months or days), or by number of persons.", "owner_org": "cic", "keywords_fra": "R\u00e9sidents temporaires,\u00c9tudiants \u00e9trangers,Travailleurs \u00e9trangers"}
