{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Autorisations et d\u00e9penses selon les comptes publics du Canada - Version anglaise", "keywords": "Authority,Expenditures,Budget,Government of Canada,Public Accounts,Voted expenditures,Statutory Expenditures,Ministry Summary,Statutory Authority,Voted Authority,Program,Standard Object", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "51c3b869-9182-4ee3-a7c2-36da0dc2889c", "subject": "Government and Politics  Gouvernement et vie politique", "data_series_name_fra": "Autorisations et d\u00e9penses par cr\u00e9dit - D\u00e9penses par programme - D\u00e9penses par article courant", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "Authorities and Expenditures as per the Public Accounts of Canada", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Une fois qu'un exercice financier donn\u00e9 a pris fin, l'information finale sur l'utilisation faite des autorisations de d\u00e9penses approuv\u00e9es par le Parlement ou le Conseil du Tr\u00e9sor devient disponible. Les tableaux suivants, qui sont fond\u00e9s sur le Volume II des Comptes publics du Canada, offrent un aper\u00e7u de haut niveau des d\u00e9penses r\u00e9elles effectu\u00e9es par les organismes qui re\u00e7oivent des approbations du Parlement. Les donn\u00e9es sont pr\u00e9sent\u00e9es par cr\u00e9dit, par article courant et par programme.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/aegc-bdgc/ae-ad1011-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/aegc-bdgc/ae-ad0910-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/aegc-bdgc/ae-ad0809-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/aegc-bdgc/ae-ad1011-fra.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/aegc-bdgc/ae-ad0910-fra.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/aegc-bdgc/ae-ad0809-fra.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-06-27", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Authorities and Expenditures by vote - Expenditure by Program - Expenditures by Standard Object ", "url_fra": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/aegc-bdgc/aegc-bdgc-fra.asp", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/aegc-bdgc/aegc-bdgc-eng.asp", "notes": "Following the end of a given fiscal year, final information becomes available on the use of expenditure authorities approved by Parliament and/or Treasury Board. The following tables, based on the Volume II of the Public Accounts of Canada, present a high-level overview of the actual expenditures of organizations that receive appropriations from Parliament. Data are presented by vote, by standard object and by program.", "owner_org": "tbs-sct", "keywords_fra": "Autorisation de d\u00e9penses,d\u00e9penses,Budget,Gouvernement du Canada,Comptes publics,D\u00e9penses vot\u00e9es,D\u00e9penses l\u00e9gislatives,Portefeuille minist\u00e9riel,Cr\u00e9dit l\u00e9gislatif,Cr\u00e9dit vot\u00e9,Programme,Article courant"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Rapport statistique sur l'aide internationale - D\u00e9penses par pays 2010-2011", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "219c977a-449e-453e-99be-6b4fc344159d", "subject": "Processes  Liens et fonctions", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "Statistical Report on International Assistance - by Country Spending 2010-2011", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Ces ensembles de donn\u00e9es correspondent aux statistiques sur l'aide que verse le Canada par pays, par ann\u00e9e financi\u00e8re. Ces donn\u00e9es sont \u00e9tablies pour le Rapport statistique sur l'aide internationale que pr\u00e9sente chaque ann\u00e9e l'ACDI; elles correspondent aux donn\u00e9es de la section D du rapport, o\u00f9 les d\u00e9penses d'aide internationale sont ventil\u00e9es selon le m\u00e9canisme de prestation et le b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiaire. Puisque ces donn\u00e9es portent sur l'ensemble des d\u00e9penses d'aide internationale du Canada, elles englobent l'aide au d\u00e9veloppement officielle (ADO) vis\u00e9e par la Loi sur la responsabilit\u00e9 en mati\u00e8re d'aide au d\u00e9veloppement officielle et les autres formes d'aide officielle des divers ordres de gouvernement (gouvernements f\u00e9d\u00e9ral et provinciaux) ainsi que des administrations municipales.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/INET/IMAGES.NSF/vLUImages/Open%20Data/$file/OpenData-Country-Statistics-2010-2011.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/INET/IMAGES.NSF/vLUImages/Open%20Data/$file/Donn%E9es-ouvertes-Statistiques-de-pays-2010-2011.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-03-30", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "These data sets represent statistics on Canada's assistance disbursed by country, by fiscal year. This data is produced as part of CIDA's annual Statistical Report on International Assistance and corresponds to figures presented in Section D of the report, where international assistance expenditures are broken down by channel and recipient. Given that the data covers all Canadian international assistance spending, it includes both official development assistance (ODA) as per the Official Development Assistance Accountability Act and other official assistance from all levels of government (federal, provincial and municipal).", "owner_org": "cida-acdi", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Rapport statistique sur l'aide internationale - D\u00e9penses par pays 2008-2009", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "3057acf5-bb1e-4f68-a3ad-ce12f691f3b7", "subject": "Government and Politics  Gouvernement et vie politique", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "Statistical Report on International Assistance - by Country Spending 2008-2009", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Ces ensembles de donn\u00e9es correspondent aux statistiques sur l'aide que verse le Canada par pays, par ann\u00e9e financi\u00e8re. Ces donn\u00e9es sont \u00e9tablies pour le Rapport statistique sur l'aide internationale que pr\u00e9sente chaque ann\u00e9e l'ACDI; elles correspondent aux donn\u00e9es de la section D du rapport, o\u00f9 les d\u00e9penses d'aide internationale sont ventil\u00e9es selon le m\u00e9canisme de prestation et le b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiaire. Puisque ces donn\u00e9es portent sur l'ensemble des d\u00e9penses d'aide internationale du Canada, elles englobent l'aide au d\u00e9veloppement officielle (ADO) vis\u00e9e par la Loi sur la responsabilit\u00e9 en mati\u00e8re d'aide au d\u00e9veloppement officielle et les autres formes d'aide officielle des divers ordres de gouvernement (gouvernements f\u00e9d\u00e9ral et provinciaux) ainsi que des administrations municipales.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/INET/IMAGES.NSF/vLUImages/Open%20Data/$file/OpenData-Country-Statistics-2008-2009.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/INET/IMAGES.NSF/vLUImages/Open%20Data/$file/Donn%E9es-ouvertes-Statistiques-de-pays-2008-2009.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2011-06-30", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "2011-11-06", "url": "", "notes": "These data sets represent statistics on Canada's assistance disbursed by country, by fiscal year. This data is produced as part of CIDA's annual Statistical Report on International Assistance and corresponds to figures presented in Section D of the report, where international assistance expenditures are broken down by channel and recipient. Given that the data covers all Canadian international assistance spending, it includes both official development assistance (ODA) as per the Official Development Assistance Accountability Act and other official assistance from all levels of government (federal, provincial and municipal).", "owner_org": "cida-acdi", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Rapport statistique sur l'aide internationale - D\u00e9penses par pays 2009-2010", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "0341567f-85a1-48d8-8cbc-638deab70f1e", "subject": "Processes  Liens et fonctions", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "Statistical Report on International Assistance - by Country Spending 2009-2010", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Ces ensembles de donn\u00e9es correspondent aux statistiques sur l'aide que verse le Canada par pays, par ann\u00e9e financi\u00e8re. Ces donn\u00e9es sont \u00e9tablies pour le Rapport statistique sur l'aide internationale que pr\u00e9sente chaque ann\u00e9e l'ACDI; elles correspondent aux donn\u00e9es de la section D du rapport, o\u00f9 les d\u00e9penses d'aide internationale sont ventil\u00e9es selon le m\u00e9canisme de prestation et le b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiaire. Puisque ces donn\u00e9es portent sur l'ensemble des d\u00e9penses d'aide internationale du Canada, elles englobent l'aide au d\u00e9veloppement officielle (ADO) vis\u00e9e par la Loi sur la responsabilit\u00e9 en mati\u00e8re d'aide au d\u00e9veloppement officielle et les autres formes d'aide officielle des divers ordres de gouvernement (gouvernements f\u00e9d\u00e9ral et provinciaux) ainsi que des administrations municipales.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/INET/IMAGES.NSF/vLUImages/Open%20Data/$file/OpenData-Country-Statistics-2009-2010.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/INET/IMAGES.NSF/vLUImages/Open%20Data/$file/Donn%E9es-ouvertes-Statistiques-de-pays-2009-2010.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2011-06-30", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "2011-11-06", "url": "", "notes": "ese data sets represent statistics on Canada's assistance disbursed by country, by fiscal year. This data is produced as part of CIDA's annual Statistical Report on International Assistance and corresponds to figures presented in Section D of the report, where international assistance expenditures are broken down by channel and recipient. Given that the data covers all Canadian international assistance spending, it includes both official development assistance (ODA) as per the Official Development Assistance Accountability Act and other official assistance from all levels of government (federal, provincial and municipal).\n", "owner_org": "cida-acdi", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Rapport statistique sur l'aide internationale - D\u00e9penses par pays 2007-2008", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "89d353f1-00b4-4f1a-b2a6-d05ff1cf439a", "subject": "Processes  Liens et fonctions", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "Statistical Report on International Assistance - by Country Spending 2007-2008", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Ces ensembles de donn\u00e9es correspondent aux statistiques sur l'aide que verse le Canada par pays, par ann\u00e9e financi\u00e8re. Ces donn\u00e9es sont \u00e9tablies pour le Rapport statistique sur l'aide internationale que pr\u00e9sente chaque ann\u00e9e l'ACDI; elles correspondent aux donn\u00e9es de la section D du rapport, o\u00f9 les d\u00e9penses d'aide internationale sont ventil\u00e9es selon le m\u00e9canisme de prestation et le b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiaire. Puisque ces donn\u00e9es portent sur l'ensemble des d\u00e9penses d'aide internationale du Canada, elles englobent l'aide au d\u00e9veloppement officielle (ADO) vis\u00e9e par la Loi sur la responsabilit\u00e9 en mati\u00e8re d'aide au d\u00e9veloppement officielle et les autres formes d'aide officielle des divers ordres de gouvernement (gouvernements f\u00e9d\u00e9ral et provinciaux) ainsi que des administrations municipales.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/INET/IMAGES.NSF/vLUImages/Open%20Data/$file/OpenData-Country-Statistics-2007-2008.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/INET/IMAGES.NSF/vLUImages/Open%20Data/$file/Donn%E9es-ouvertes-Statistiques-de-pays-2007-2008.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2011-06-30", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "2011-11-06", "url": "", "notes": "These data sets represent statistics on Canada's assistance disbursed by country, by fiscal year. This data is produced as part of CIDA's annual Statistical Report on International Assistance and corresponds to figures presented in Section D of the report, where international assistance expenditures are broken down by channel and recipient. Given that the data covers all Canadian international assistance spending, it includes both official development assistance (ODA) as per the Official Development Assistance Accountability Act and other official assistance from all levels of government (federal, provincial and municipal).\n\n", "owner_org": "cida-acdi", "keywords_fra": ""}
