{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Rapport statistique sur l'aide internationale - D\u00e9penses par pays 2001-2002", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "aac21f87-d516-468e-9781-bafc611dabe2", "subject": "Processes  Liens et fonctions", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "Statistical Report on International Assistance - by Country Spending 2001-2002", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Ces ensembles de donn\u00e9es correspondent aux statistiques sur l'aide que verse le Canada par pays, par ann\u00e9e financi\u00e8re. Ces donn\u00e9es sont \u00e9tablies pour le Rapport statistique sur l'aide internationale que pr\u00e9sente chaque ann\u00e9e l'ACDI; elles correspondent aux donn\u00e9es de la section D du rapport, o\u00f9 les d\u00e9penses d'aide internationale sont ventil\u00e9es selon le m\u00e9canisme de prestation et le b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiaire. Puisque ces donn\u00e9es portent sur l'ensemble des d\u00e9penses d'aide internationale du Canada, elles englobent l'aide au d\u00e9veloppement officielle (ADO) vis\u00e9e par la Loi sur la responsabilit\u00e9 en mati\u00e8re d'aide au d\u00e9veloppement officielle et les autres formes d'aide officielle des divers ordres de gouvernement (gouvernements f\u00e9d\u00e9ral et provinciaux) ainsi que des administrations municipales.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/INET/IMAGES.NSF/vLUImages/Open%20Data/$file/OpenData-Country-Statistics-2001-2002.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/INET/IMAGES.NSF/vLUImages/Open%20Data/$file/Donn%E9es-ouvertes-Statistiques-de-pays-2001-2002.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2011-06-30", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "2011-11-06", "url": "", "notes": "These data sets represent statistics on Canada's assistance disbursed by country, by fiscal year. This data is produced as part of CIDA's annual Statistical Report on International Assistance and corresponds to figures presented in Section D of the report, where international assistance expenditures are broken down by channel and recipient. Given that the data covers all Canadian international assistance spending, it includes both official development assistance (ODA) as per the Official Development Assistance Accountability Act and other official assistance from all levels of government (federal, provincial and municipal).\n\n", "owner_org": "cida-acdi", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es historiques sur les projets 2010-2011", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "3d7bea41-c4b1-4e59-8c92-07c2dbcb9074", "subject": "Processes  Liens et fonctions", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Historical Project Data Set 2010-2011", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "L'Ensemble de donn\u00e9es historiques sur les projets fait \u00e9tat des d\u00e9penses li\u00e9es \u00e0 la mise en ouvre des projets d'aide de l'ACDI selon le pays o\u00f9 s'ex\u00e9cute le projet, le secteur, le type de projet et l'organisation partenaire, le tout dans une m\u00eame source. L'Ensemble de donn\u00e9es historiques contient aussi les caract\u00e9ristiques sp\u00e9cifiques des projets d'aide de l'ACDI comme l'\u00e9tat de d\u00e9liement, les objectifs g\u00e9n\u00e9raux des politiques et le type de mod\u00e8le d'ex\u00e9cution.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/INET/IMAGES.NSF/vLUImages/Open%20Data/$file/HPDS-2010-2011-eng.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/INET/IMAGES.NSF/vLUImages/Open%20Data/$file/HPDS-2010-2011-fra.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-03-30", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "The Historical Project Data Set is a single source for CIDA's aid project expenditures, detailed by country, sector, type of project, and partner organization. The Historical Project Data Set also contains useful information about the specific characteristics of CIDA's aid projects, such as the tying status, the general policy objectives, and the type of delivery model used to deliver the aid.", "owner_org": "cida-acdi", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Base de donn\u00e9es sur les produits pharmaceutiques - statut", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "2d055a8a-505b-4ebf-a974-7d3381272aea", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Drug Product Database - Status", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "\n        La Base de donn\u00e9es sur les produits pharmaceutiques (BDPP) saisit les donn\u00e9es sur les produits \u00e0 usages humains et v\u00e9t\u00e9rinaires et sur les d\u00e9sinfectants dont l'utilisation est approuv\u00e9e par Sant\u00e9 Canada.\n\n        L'extrait porte sur les produits commercialis\u00e9s (actifs) et discontinu\u00e9s.\n\n        L'extrait des donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur le statut des produits pharmaceutiques.\n      ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodpharma/databasdon/status_ia.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodpharma/databasdon/status_ia.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2002-12-09", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "\n        The Drug Product Database (DPD) system captures information on Canadian human, veterinary and disinfectant products approved for use by Health Canada.\n        This extract contains both marketed (active) and discontinued (inactivated) products in separate files.\n        This data extract contains information about Drug Product Status.\n      ", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "L'inventaire des organisations du gouvernement du Canada - Profils des autres soci\u00e9t\u00e9s dans lesquelles le Canada d\u00e9tient des int\u00e9r\u00eats ", "keywords": "Other corporate interests of Canada,joint enterprise,international organizations,shared-governance corporations,appropriate minister,institutional head,constituent act,year of incorporation-commencement,fiscal year-end,auditor,federal ownership,board appointees,mandate,head office,address,website,e-mail,telephone,fax", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "c05e8a2b-4e8b-4da7-b6f3-33f4848d3c09", "subject": "Government and Politics  Gouvernement et vie politique", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "Inventory of the Government of Canada Organizations- Other Corporate Interests of Canada profiles", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Les profils des autres soci\u00e9t\u00e9s dans lesquelles le Canada d\u00e9tient des int\u00e9r\u00eats incluent les profils des entreprises en coparticipation, des organisations internationales et des soci\u00e9t\u00e9s \u00e0 r\u00e9gie partag\u00e9e. Entre autre, chaque profil indique le mandat, l'adresse de ses bureaux et pr\u00e9cise le fondement l\u00e9gislatif en vertu duquel la soci\u00e9t\u00e9 a \u00e9t\u00e9 constitu\u00e9e. ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "XML", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/reports-rapports/cc-se/data-eng.asp", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "XML", "url": "http://www.