"notes": "\n        The Drug Product Database (DPD) system captures information on Canadian human, veterinary and disinfectant products approved for use by Health Canada.\n        This extract contains both marketed (active) and discontinued (inactivated) products in separate files.\n        This data extract contains information about Drug Product form.\n      ", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Noms des produits de sant\u00e9 naturels homologu\u00e9s", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "33619b45-e593-41b8-a5c3-db23effb59b1", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Licensed Natural Health Product names", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "La Base de donn\u00e9es des produits de sant\u00e9 naturels homologu\u00e9s contient des renseignements sur les produits de sant\u00e9 naturels ayant re\u00e7u une licence de mise en march\u00e9 de Sant\u00e9 Canada.  Ce fichier de donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur les noms des PSN.\n\nLes produits homologu\u00e9s ont \u00e9t\u00e9 examin\u00e9s par Sant\u00e9 Canada et jug\u00e9s s\u00fbrs, efficaces et de haute qualit\u00e9 dans les conditions d'utilisation recommand\u00e9es. Vous pouvez trouver les produits de sant\u00e9 naturels homologu\u00e9s au moyen du num\u00e9ro de produit naturel (NPN) ou du num\u00e9ro de m\u00e9dicament hom\u00e9opathique (DIN-HM) figurant sur l'\u00e9tiquette du produit.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodnatur/applications/licen-prod/NHP_PRODUCT_NAMES.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodnatur/applications/licen-prod/NHP_PRODUCT_NAMES.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2009-12-18", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "The Licensed Natural Health Products Database contains information about natural health products that have been issued a product licence by Health Canada. This data extract contains information on NHP Product names.\n\nProducts with a licence have been assessed by Health Canada and found to be safe, effective and of high quality under their recommended conditions of use. You can identify licensed natural health products by looking for the eight-digit Natural Product Number (NPN) or Homeopathic Medicine Number (DIN-HM) on the label.\n", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Base de donn\u00e9es sur les produits pharmaceutiques - tout fichiers", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "bf55e42a-63cb-4556-bfd8-44f26e5a36fe", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Drug Product Database - All Files", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "\n        La Base de donn\u00e9es sur les produits pharmaceutiques (BDPP) saisit les donn\u00e9es sur les produits \u00e0 usages humains et v\u00e9t\u00e9rinaires et sur les d\u00e9sinfectants dont l'utilisation est approuv\u00e9e par Sant\u00e9 Canada.\n\n        L'extrait porte sur les produits commercialis\u00e9s (actifs) et discontinu\u00e9s.\n\n        L'extrait des donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur les produits pharmaceutiques - tout fichiers.\n      ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodpharma/databasdon/allfiles_ia.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodpharma/databasdon/allfiles_ia.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2002-12-09", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "\n        The Drug Product Database (DPD) system captures information on Canadian human, veterinary and disinfectant products approved for use by Health Canada.\n        This extract contains both marketed (active) and discontinued (inactivated) products in separate files.\n        This data extract contains information about Drug Product - All Files.\n      ", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Certificats de soumission pour le registre des brevets", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "d66391d6-4e74-4965-9af8-fe5bdd7a89d4", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Patent Register, Submission Certificate", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le Registre des brevets est une liste alphab\u00e9tique des ingr\u00e9dients m\u00e9dicinaux et leurs brevets associ\u00e9s, les dates d'expiration des brevets et d'autres renseignements pertinents, conform\u00e9ment au R\u00e8glement sur les m\u00e9dicaments brevet\u00e9s (avis de conformit\u00e9) [DORS/133-93, tel que modifi\u00e9].", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://webprod3.hc-sc.gc.ca/patent/Patent.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": ": http://webprod3.hc-sc.gc.ca/patent/Patent.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2011-01-27", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "The Patent Register is an alphabetical listing of medicinal ingredients and their associated patents, the patent expiry dates and other related information established in accordance with the Patented Medicines (Notice of Compliance) Regulations [SOR/133-93 as amended].", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Base de donn\u00e9es Canadienne sur les catastrophes-version anglaise", "keywords": "Disaster,emergency,catastrophe,epidemic,infestation,pandemic,biological,natural,man-made,meteorological,avalanche,drought,flood,solar flare,geomagnetic storm,hurricane,typhoon,storm,storm surge,snow,hail,tornado,wildfire,geological,earthquake,landslide,tsunami,volanco,conflict,arson,incident,riot,disturbance,hijacking,bomb,explosive,explosion,derailment,accident,terrorist,terrorism,technological,kidnapping,nuclear,radiological,nuclear,accident,leak,energy,critical infrastructure,power failure", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "1c3d15f9-9cfa-4010-8462-0d67e493d9b9", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Monthly | Mensuel", "title": "Canadian Disaster Database", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "La Base de donn\u00e9es canadienne sur les catastrophes (BDC) est un organe d'archivage Web accessible au public. Elle contient de l'information historique concernant les catastrophes naturelles ou celles dues \u00e0 l'action humaine qui ont eu lieu depuis 1900 au pays ou \u00e0 l'\u00e9tranger et qui ont touch\u00e9 directement des Canadiens. La base de donn\u00e9es contient des informations concernant plus de 1000 \u00e9v\u00e9nements. Elle peut \u00eatre utilis\u00e9e afin de soutenir la recherche, les activit\u00e9s acad\u00e9miques et la prise de d\u00e9cision en lien avec un \u00e9ventail de domaines, dont les sciences de la Terre, l'agriculture, les changements climatiques, la biologie et l'\u00e9pid\u00e9miologie, l'am\u00e9nagement du territoire, les assurances, les investissements et les aspects anthropologiques et sociologiques de la r\u00e9silience des communaut\u00e9s. \n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://cdd.publicsafety.gc.ca/dl-eng.aspx?cultureCode=en-Ca&normalizedCostYear=1", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "kml / kmz", "url": "http://cdd.publicsafety.gc.ca/CDDService/kml/EventMapLayer?cultureCode=en-Ca&normalizedCostYear=1", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "rss", "url": "http://cdd.publicsafety.gc.ca/CDDService/georssatom/EventMapLayer?cultureCode=en-Ca&normalizedCostYear=1", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://cdd.publicsafety.gc.ca/dl-fra.aspx?cultureCode=fr-Ca&normalizedCostYear=1", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "kml / kmz", "url": "http://cdd.publicsafety.gc.ca/CDDService/kml/EventMapLayer?cultureCode=fr-Ca&normalizedCostYear=1", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "rss", "url": "http://cdd.publicsafety.gc.ca/CDDService/georssatom/EventMapLayer?cultureCode=fr-Ca&normalizedCostYear=1", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2001-01-01", "time_period_coverage_start": "1900-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "http://www.securitepublique.gc.ca/prg/em/cdd/index-fra.aspx", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "1900-01-01", "language": "", "date_modified": "2012-10-12", "url": "http://www.publicsafety.gc.ca/prg/em/cdd/index-eng.aspx", "notes": "The Canadian Disaster Database is a publically accessible web-based repository of historical information about natural and made-made disasters that have taken place since 1900 in Canada or abroad that have directly affected Canadians.  The database contains information on over 1000 events and can be used to support research, academic activities and decision-making across a breadth of fields including earth sciences, agriculture, climate change, biology and epidemiology, land use planning, insurance, investment, and the anthropological and sociological aspects of community resilience, among many others.", "owner_org": "ps-sp", "keywords_fra": "catastrophe,d\u00e9sastre,urgence,biologique,pand\u00e9mie,\u00e9pid\u00e9mie,infestation,s\u00e9cheresse,m\u00e9t\u00e9orologique,hydrologique,inondation,orage,orage g\u00e9omagn\u00e9tique,ouragan,typhon,temp\u00eate,neige,tornade,feu de for\u00eat,tremblement de terre,glissement de terrain,g\u00e9ologique,tsunami,volcan,conflit,incendie,\u00e9meute,d\u00e9tournement,terroriste,attaque \u00e0 la bombe,explosive,explosion,chimique,radiologique,nucl\u00e9aire,enl\u00e8vement,fusillade,fuite,d\u00e9versement,d\u00e9traillement,technologique,panne d'infrastructure,panne d'\u00e9lectricit\u00e9,accident,\u00e9v\u00e9nement,incident,spatial,transport"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Base de donn\u00e9es sur les produits pharmaceutiques - STD pharmaceutiques", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "24027f6f-ff13-4096-93d6-fe152781a376", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Drug Product Database - Pharmaceutical STD", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "\n        La Base de donn\u00e9es sur les produits pharmaceutiques (BDPP) saisit les donn\u00e9es sur les produits \u00e0 usages humains et v\u00e9t\u00e9rinaires et sur les d\u00e9sinfectants dont l'utilisation est approuv\u00e9e par Sant\u00e9 Canada.\n\n        L'extrait porte sur les produits commercialis\u00e9s (actifs) et discontinu\u00e9s.\n\n        L'extrait des donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur les STD des produits pharmaceutiques.\n      ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodpharma/databasdon/pharm_ia.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodpharma/databasdon/pharm_ia.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2002-12-09", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "\n        The Drug Product Database (DPD) system captures information on Canadian human, veterinary and disinfectant products approved for use by Health Canada.\n        This extract contains both marketed (active) and discontinued (inactivated) products in separate files.\n        This data extract contains information about Drug Product Pharmaceutical STD.\n      ", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
