{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Base de donn\u00e9es sur les produits pharmaceutiques - ingr\u00e9dients actifs", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "4dc89dfd-6075-416c-a2e9-59f392833cf0", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Drug Product Database - Active Ingredients", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "\n        La Base de donn\u00e9es sur les produits pharmaceutiques (BDPP) saisit les donn\u00e9es sur les produits \u00e0 usages humains et v\u00e9t\u00e9rinaires et sur les d\u00e9sinfectants dont l'utilisation est approuv\u00e9e par Sant\u00e9 Canada.\n\n        L'extrait porte sur les produits commercialis\u00e9s (actifs) et discontinu\u00e9s.\n\n        L'extrait des donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur les ingr\u00e9dients actifs des produits pharmaceutiques.\n      ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodpharma/databasdon/ingred_ia.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodpharma/databasdon/ingred_ia.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2002-12-09", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end":