{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Sommaire des modifications apport\u00e9es aux cr\u00e9dits vot\u00e9s - Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses (A) 2012-13", "keywords": "Summary of Changes to Voted Appropriations,Supplementary Estimates,Supplementary Estimates A,Supplementary Estimates A 2012-13,Estimates,Available Spending Authorities", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "c98eb00f-3d08-40f8-b180-19f03fb3d4ee", "subject": "Government and Politics  Gouvernement et vie politique", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "Summary of Changes to Voted Appropriations - Supplementary Estimates (A) 2012-13", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Ce tableau fournit l'information concernant les cr\u00e9dits de ce budget suppl\u00e9mentaire par minist\u00e8re. Num\u00e9ro du cr\u00e9dit indique quel cr\u00e9dit est accru dans le cadre du pr\u00e9sent budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses. Montant brut indique le total des fonds demand\u00e9s, Moins : Autorisations de d\u00e9penser disponibles repr\u00e9sente les pouvoirs de d\u00e9penser inutilis\u00e9s qu'invoquent les organisations pour r\u00e9duire le montant demand\u00e9, et Montant net indique le montant net du financement suppl\u00e9mentaire.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/20122013/sups/a/scvab-smavd-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/20122013/sups/a/scvab-smavd-fra.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-05-17", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/20122013/se-bs-fra.asp", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/20122013/se-bs-eng.asp", "notes": "The table displays voted information in Supplementary Estimates. Vote Number indicates the Vote to be augmented, the letter accompanying the Vote indicates which Supplementary Estimates was used to augment the Vote, Gross Amount displays the total amount of funding, Less: Available Spending Authorities represents unused spending authority being used by organizations to minimize the amount being requested, and Net Amount displays the net amount of incremental funding reflected.", "owner_org": "tbs-sct", "keywords_fra": "Sommaire des modifications apport\u00e9es aux cr\u00e9dits vot\u00e9s,Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses B 2010-2011,Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses B,Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses,Autorisations de d\u00e9penser disponibles"}
