{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "D\u00e9penses budg\u00e9taires du budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses par article courant de d\u00e9pense - Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses (B) 2012-2013", "keywords": "Budgetary Supplementary Estimates by Standard Object of Expenditure,Supplementary Estimates,Supplementary Estimates B,Supplementary Estimates B 2012-13,Estimates,Standard Object of Expenditure,Personnel,Transportation and communications,Information,Professional and special services,Rentals,Purchased repair and maintenance,Utilities,materials and supplies,Acquisition of land,buildings and works,Acquisition of machinery and equipment,Transfer payments,Public debt charges,Other subsidies and payments", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "ee84c92e-f1e3-4ca1-908b-b9c600bc866f", "subject": "Government and Politics  Gouvernement et vie politique", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "Budgetary Supplementary Estimates by Standard Object of Expenditure - Supplementary Estimates (B) 2012-13", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Afin d'indiquer de fa\u00e7on plus pr\u00e9cise l'incidence des d\u00e9penses du gouvernement f\u00e9d\u00e9ral sur l'\u00e9conomie, il faut \u00e9tablir le montant net des achats de l'\u00c9tat par article courant. \u00c0 cette fin, tous les minist\u00e8res, y compris ceux qui ont recours \u00e0 un fonds renouvelable, doivent inscrire leurs d\u00e9penses li\u00e9es \u00e0 des achats par cat\u00e9gories d'articles courants de d\u00e9pense. Ils sont le niveau le plus \u00e9lev\u00e9 de la classification par article qu'utilisent le Parlement et le pouvoir ex\u00e9cutif.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/ems-sgd/sups/b/20122013/bsso-dbcd-fra.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/ems-sgd/sups/b/20122013/bsso-dbcd-fra.asp", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodpharma/databasdon/schedule_ia.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-11-08", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "Budgetary Expenditures by Standard Object of Expenditure: This table shows the forecast of total expenditures by Standard Object, which includes the types of goods or services to be acquired, or the transfer payments to be made and the revenues to be credited to the vote.", "owner_org": "tbs-sct", "keywords_fra": "il faut \u00e9tablir le montant net des achats de l'\u00c9tat par article courant. \u00c0 cette fin,tous les minist\u00e8res,y compris ceux qui ont recours \u00e0 un fonds renouvelable"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Base de donn\u00e9es sur les produits pharmaceutiques - programme (version francaise)", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "c38247aa-d704-4a2b-bd31-fe8bc7600744", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Drug Product Database - Schedule", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "\n\t\t\t\t\t        La Base de donn\u00e9es sur les produits pharmaceutiques (BDPP) saisit les donn\u00e9es sur les produits \u00e0 usages humains et v\u00e9t\u00e9rinaires et sur les d\u00e9sinfectants dont l'utilisation est approuv\u00e9e par Sant\u00e9 Canada.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t        L'extrait porte sur les produits commercialis\u00e9s (actifs) et discontinu\u00e9s.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t        L'extrait des donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur le programme des produits pharmaceutiques.\n\t\t\t\t\t      ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodpharma/databasdon/schedule_ia.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "SHAPE", "url": "http://geodepot.statcan.gc.ca/2006/2009070518030114/01180309140615/181406-061818/2010/07181406011180801_05-eng.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2002-12-09", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "\n\t\t\t\t\t        The Drug Product Database (DPD) system captures information on Canadian human, veterinary and disinfectant products approved for use by Health Canada.\n\t\t\t\t\t        This extract contains both marketed (active) and discontinued (inactivated) products in separate files.\n\t\t\t\t\t        This data extract contains information about Drug Product Schedule.\n\t\t\t\t\t      ", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
