otes": "The Road Network File is a digital representation of Canada\u00b4s national road network, containing information such as street names, types, directions and address ranges. \n", "owner_org": "statcan", "keywords_fra": "autoroutes,guide g\u00e9ographique,qualit\u00e9 des donn\u00e9es,rues,r\u00e9seaux routiers,transport routier."}
