{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Base de donn\u00e9es en ligne des effets ind\u00e9sirables de Canada Vigilance - Version fran\u00e7aise", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "9cbaef00-b52c-4a70-9fed-d9aa8263ab74", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Canada Vigilance Adverse Reaction Online Database", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "L'extrait des donn\u00e9es est une s\u00e9rie de fichiers ASCII compress\u00e9s des donn\u00e9es compl\u00e8tes contenues dans la Base de donn\u00e9es en ligne des effets ind\u00e9sirables de Canada Vigilance. Il est destin\u00e9 aux utilisateurs qui sont familiaris\u00e9s avec les structures de bases de donn\u00e9es et capables de cr\u00e9er leurs propres requ\u00eates.\n\nUne description d\u00e9taill\u00e9e de la structure de donn\u00e9es requise pour utiliser le fichier de donn\u00e9es se situe \u00e0 la page suivante : Base de donn\u00e9es en ligne des effets ind\u00e9sirables de Canada Vigilance - Structure des donn\u00e9es de la Base de donn\u00e9es des effets ind\u00e9sirables. Pour utiliser les donn\u00e9es, vous devez importer le fichier dans une base de donn\u00e9es ou un syst\u00e8me d'information existant.\n\nLa base de donn\u00e9es en ligne des effets ind\u00e9sirables de Canada Vigilance renferme de l'information au sujet des effets ind\u00e9sirables soup\u00e7onn\u00e9s (ou effets secondaires) associ\u00e9s \u00e0 des produits de sant\u00e9 qui a \u00e9t\u00e9 obtenue \u00e0 partir des d\u00e9clarations d'effets ind\u00e9sirables soumises \u00e0 Sant\u00e9 Canada par les consommateurs et les professionnels de la sant\u00e9, de fa\u00e7on volontaire, ainsi que par les d\u00e9tenteurs d'autorisation de mise en march\u00e9 (les fabricants et les distributeurs ) qui sont tenus de d\u00e9clarer les effets ind\u00e9sirables en vertu du R\u00e8glement sur les aliments et drogues. Les informations concernant les vaccins utilis\u00e9s pour immunisation sont inclus dans la base de donn\u00e9es que depuis le 1 janvier, 2011.\n\nNota : La base de donn\u00e9es ne peut \u00eatre utilis\u00e9e seule pour \u00e9valuer le profil d'innocuit\u00e9 d'un produit de sant\u00e9. Elle ne fournit pas d'information concluante sur l'innocuit\u00e9 des produits de sant\u00e9 et elle n'a pas pour objet de remplacer les avis m\u00e9dicaux. Si vous avez un probl\u00e8me d'ordre m\u00e9dical, veuillez consulter un professionnel de la sant\u00e9 qualifi\u00e9.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/medeff/databasdon/extract_extrait_2011-09-30.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "SHAPE", "url": "http://geodepot.statcan.gc.ca/2006/2009070518030114/01180309140615/040206/1401200915140112/030319-191821/07030319000010601_05-eng.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2009-02-12", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "http://webprod3.hc-sc.gc.ca/arquery-rechercheei/language-langage.do?url=t.search.recherche&lang=fra", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://webprod3.hc-sc.gc.ca/arquery-rechercheei/index-eng.jsp", "notes": "The data extract is a series of compressed ASCII text files of the full data set contained in the Canada Vigilance Adverse Reaction Online Database. It is intended for users who are familiar with database structures and setting up their own queries.\n\nFind details on the data structure required for the data file in the Canada Vigilance Adverse Reaction Online Database - Data Structure. In order to use the data, the file must be loaded into an existing database or information system provided by the user.\n\nThe Canada Vigilance Adverse Reaction Online Database contains information about suspected adverse reactions (also known as side effects) to health products, captured from adverse reaction reports submitted to Health Canada by consumers and health professionals, who submit reports voluntarily, as well as by market authorization holders (manufacturers and distributors), who are required to submit reports according to the Food and Drugs Regulations. Information concerning vaccines used for immunization have only been included in the database since January 1, 2011.\n\nNote: The database cannot be used on its own to evaluate a health product's safety profile. It does not provide conclusive information on the safety of health products, and is not a substitute for medical advice. Should you have an issue of medical concern, consult a qualified health professional.", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Fichiers num\u00e9riques des limites des subdivisions de recensement unifi\u00e9es", "keywords": "census of population,geographic areas,geographic information systems,mapping,reference maps.", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "eb94e6db-3600-46bf-8bbb-24982cd47c73", "subject": "Society and Culture  Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 et culture", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Census Consolidated Subdivision Digital Boundary Files", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le fichier des limites de 2006 d\u00e9peint les limites g\u00e9ographiques utilis\u00e9es \u00e0 la diffusion des donn\u00e9es du Recensement de 2006. Les fichiers des limites des subdivisions de recensement unifi\u00e9es comprennent les limites de l'ensemble des 2 341 subdivisions de recensement unifi\u00e9es.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "SHAPE", "url": "http://geodepot.statcan.gc.ca/2006/2009070518030114/01180309140615/040206/1401200915140112/030319-191821/07191821000010601_06-fra.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/20122013/sups/a/bsso-dbcd-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2006-10-18", "time_period_coverage_start": "2006-05-16", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2006-05-16", "language": "", "date_modified": "2006-10-18", "url": "", "notes": "The 2006 boundary files portray the geographic limits used for census dissemination. The Census Consolidated Subdivision Boundary Files contain the boundaries of all 2,341 census consolidated subdivisions.", "owner_org": "statcan", "keywords_fra": "cartes de r\u00e9f\u00e9rence,cartographie,recensement de la population,r\u00e9gions g\u00e9ographiques,syst\u00e8mes d'information g\u00e9ographique."}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "D\u00e9penses budg\u00e9taires du budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses par article courant de d\u00e9pense - Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses (A) 2012-13 - version Fran\u00e7aise", "keywords": "Budgetary Supplementary Estimates by Standard Object of Expenditure,Supplementary Estimates,Supplementary Estimates A,Supplementary Estimates A 2012-13,Estimates,Standard Object of Expenditure,Personnel,Transportation and communications,Information,Professional and special services,Rentals,Purchased repair and maintenance,Utilities,materials and supplies,Acquisition of land,buildings and works,Acquisition of machinery and equipment,Transfer payments,Public debt charges,Other subsidies and payments.", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "46f4f27e-56db-43c8-bef4-43916e1fd103", "subject": "Government and Politics  Gouvernement et vie politique", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "Budgetary Supplementary Estimates by Standard Objects of Expenditure - Supplementary Estimates (A) 2012-13", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Afin d'indiquer de fa\u00e7on plus pr\u00e9cise l'incidence des d\u00e9penses du gouvernement f\u00e9d\u00e9ral sur l'\u00e9conomie, il faut \u00e9tablir le montant net des achats de l'\u00c9tat par article courant. \u00c0 cette fin, tous les minist\u00e8res, y compris ceux qui ont recours \u00e0 un fonds renouvelable, doivent inscrire leurs d\u00e9penses li\u00e9es \u00e0 des achats par cat\u00e9gories d'articles courants de d\u00e9pense. Ils sont le niveau le plus \u00e9lev\u00e9 de la classification par article qu'utilisent le Parlement et le pouvoir ex\u00e9cutif.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/20122013/sups/a/bsso-dbcd-fra.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/INET/IMAGES.NSF/vLUImages/Open%20Data/$file/Key_Government_of_Canada_Commitments(July_6_2011)_fra.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-05-17", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/20122013/se-bs-fra.asp", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/est-pre/20122013/se-bs-eng.asp", "notes": "To determine and report more accurately the impact of government expenditures on the rest of the economy, the net amount of government purchases by standard object is determined. All organizations, including those using revolving funds, charge their expenditures for purchases to standard object expense categories, which are the highest level of object classification used for parliamentary and executive purposes. They are reported in the Main and Supplementary Estimates and the Public Accounts.", "owner_org": "tbs-sct", "keywords_fra": "Personnel,Transports et communications,Information,Services professionnels et sp\u00e9ciaux,Location,Achat de services de r\u00e9paration et d'entretien,Services publics,fournitures et approvisionnements,Acquisition de terrains,de b\u00e2timents et d'ouvrages 9. Acquisition de machines et de mat\u00e9riel,Paiements de transfert,Service de la dette publique,Autres subventions et paiements,Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses B 2010-2011,Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses B,Budget suppl\u00e9mentaire des d\u00e9penses."}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Principaux engagements du gouvernement du Canada relativement \u00e0 l'affectation des fonds du budget d'aide ", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "3884cd66-6d2b-410a-af64-7e75e89bdf1b", "subject": "Processes  Liens et fonctions", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Key Government of Canada Commitments for the Allocation of the Aid Budget ", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le tableau sommaire intitul\u00e9 Principaux engagements du gouvernement du Canada relativement \u00e0 l'affectation des fonds du budget d'aide illustre la progression par ann\u00e9e financi\u00e8re et renseigne sur les engagements qui ont \u00e9t\u00e9 remplis, qui sont en voie de l'\u00eatre ou qui sont compromis. Bien que certains engagements touchent pr\u00e9cis\u00e9ment l'ACDI, ils peuvent reposer sur des approches pangouvernementales faisant intervenir d'autres minist\u00e8res. Les principaux engagements de l'ACDI ne constituent pas des obligations juridiquement contraignantes et ne sont pas pr\u00e9vus par la loi.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.acdi-cida.gc.ca/INET/IMAGES.NSF/vLUImages/Open%20Data/$file/Key_Government_of_Canada_Commitments(2012-09-04)_eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "SHAPE", "url": "http://geodepot.statcan.gc.ca/2006/2009070518030114/01180309140615/181406-061818/2009/07181406013180801_05-eng.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2011-07-06", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "2012-11-05", "url": "", "notes": "The overview table called Key Government of Canada Commitments for the Allocation of the Aid Budget tracks progress by fiscal year and provides information about which commitments have been completed, are on target or are off target. While some commitments are CIDA-specific, many involve whole-of-government approaches and include other government departments. CIDA's key commitments do not constitute legally binding obligations nor are they legislated.", "owner_org": "cida-acdi", "keywords_fra": ""}
