{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Application de donn\u00e9es hydrom\u00e9triques en temps r\u00e9el", "keywords": "hydrometric data,water levels,inland water resources", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "269bdce9-f598-43c8-8cf3-e0ba15c20f1f", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Continual | Continue", "title": "Real Time Hydrometric Data Tool", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Ce site donne au public un acc\u00e8s \u00e0 des donn\u00e9es hydrom\u00e9triques en temps r\u00e9el (niveau d'eau et d\u00e9bit) recueillies \u00e0 plus de 1\u00a0700\u00a0emplacements au Canada. Ces donn\u00e9es sont obtenues dans le cadre d'un programme national administr\u00e9 conjointement en vertu d'ententes f\u00e9d\u00e9rales-provinciales et f\u00e9d\u00e9rales-territoriales \u00e0 co\u00fbts partag\u00e9s. C'est gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des partenariats que la Division des relev\u00e9s hydrologiques du Canada a pu constituer une base d'information sur l'environnement normalis\u00e9e et cr\u00e9dible pour le Canada. Cet ensemble de donn\u00e9es contient des donn\u00e9es courantes et pass\u00e9es. Il est possible de consulter le mois en cours sous forme de tableau HTML, et les donn\u00e9es historiques peuvent \u00eatre t\u00e9l\u00e9charg\u00e9es en format CSV.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.wateroffice.ec.gc.ca/text_search/search_e.html", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-23", "time_period_coverage_start": "1860-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/rhc-wsc/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=4EED50F1-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2009-01-01", "language": "", "date_modified": "2011-01-19", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/rhc-wsc/default.asp?lang=En&n=4EED50F1-1", "notes": "This site provides public access to real-time hydrometric (water level and streamflow) data collected at over 1700 locations in Canada. These data are collected under a national program jointly administered under federal-provincial and federal-territorial cost-sharing agreements. It is through partnerships that the Water Survey of Canada program has built a standardized and credible environmental information base for Canada. This dataset contains both current and historical datasets. The current month can be viewed in an HTML table, and historical data can be downloaded in CSV format.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "donn\u00e9es hydrom\u00e9triques,niveaux d'eau,ressources hydriques int\u00e9rieures"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Donn\u00e9es Climatiques Canadiennes Ajust\u00e9es et Homog\u00e9n\u00e9is\u00e9es (DCCAH)", "keywords": "surface air temperature,precipitation,surface pressure,surface wind speed", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "70355991-3fa5-4c28-8e72-bbda3e5da36e", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Adjusted and Homogenized Canadian Climate Data (AHCCD)", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Les donn\u00e9es se composent de moyennes mensuelles et donn\u00e9es quotidiennes des temp\u00e9ratures maximales, minimales et moyennes pour plus que 200 emplacements; totaux mensuels de chute de pluie, de neige, et de pr\u00e9cipitation totale quotidienne pour plus que 400 emplacements;pressions horaires et moyennes mensuelles pour plus que 600 emplacements; vitesse du vent horaire et des moyennes mensuelles pour plus que 100 emplacements.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://ec.gc.ca/dccha-ahccd/Default.asp?lang=En&n=B1F8423A-1", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-04-22", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "http://ec.gc.ca/dccha-ahccd/Default.asp?lang=Fr&n=B1F8423A-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "2011-01-31", "url": "http://ec.gc.ca/dccha-ahccd/Default.asp?lang=En&n=B1F8423A-1", "notes": "The data consist of monthly means and daily maximum, minimum and mean temperatures for more than 200 locations; monthly total of the daily rainfall, snowfall and total precipitation for more than 400 locations; hourly and monthly mean station and sea level pressures for more than 600 locations; hourly and monthly mean surface wind speeds for more than 100 locations.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "temp\u00e9rature de l'air de surface,pr\u00e9cipitation,pression de surface,vitesse du vent de surface"}
