 "notes": "The data consist of monthly means and daily maximum, minimum and mean temperatures for more than 200 locations; monthly total of the daily rainfall, snowfall and total precipitation for more than 400 locations; hourly and monthly mean station and sea level pressures for more than 600 locations; hourly and monthly mean surface wind speeds for more than 100 locations.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "temp\u00e9rature de l'air de surface,pr\u00e9cipitation,pression de surface,vitesse du vent de surface"}
