{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Donn\u00e9es climatiques quotidiennes (codes SYNOP)", "keywords": "atmosphere,atmospheric pressure,surface pressure,atmosphere,atmospheric radiation,solar radiation,atmosphere,atmospheric temperature,atmosphere,atmospheric winds,surface winds,atmosphere,precipitation,precipitation amount,oceans,ocean winds,paleoclimate,paleoclimate reconstructions,sea surface temperature reconstruction", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "87009320-6e76-439c-b737-0e9e6a36fa0d", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Daily Climate Data (From SYNOs)", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Offre un acc\u00e8s direct aux donn\u00e9es climatiques historiques par endroit et date. Les donn\u00e9es sont pr\u00e9sent\u00e9es selon des intervalles horaires, quotidiens, mensuels et d'\u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e9rides (moyennes et extr\u00eames quotidiens). Il convient de noter que les quatre intervalles ne sont pas disponibles pour toutes les stations; tout d\u00e9pend de ce qui a \u00e9t\u00e9 observ\u00e9 \u00e0 chacune.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://climate.weatheroffice.gc.ca/climateData/canada_e.html", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-04-22", "time_period_coverage_start": "1850-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "http://climate.weatheroffice.gc.ca/Welcome_f.html?&", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2020-01-01", "language": "", "date_modified": "2011-01-18", "url": "http://climate.weatheroffice.gc.ca/Welcome_e.html ", "notes": "\"Provides direct access to historical climate data for specific locations and dates. Data are available in hourly, daily, monthly, and almanac (daily averages & extremes) intervals. Also note that all four data intervals are not available for all possible stations; it depends on what was observed at each site.\n", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "atmosph\u00e8re,pression atmosph\u00e9rique,pression au sol,atmosph\u00e8re,rayonnement atmosph\u00e9rique,rayonnement solaire,atmosph\u00e8re,temp\u00e9rature atmosph\u00e9rique,atmosph\u00e8re,vents atmosph\u00e9riques,vents de surface,atmosph\u00e8re,pr\u00e9cipitation,quantit\u00e9 de pr\u00e9cipitations,oc\u00e9ans,vents oc\u00e9aniques,pal\u00e9oclimat,reconstructions pal\u00e9oclimatiques,reconstruction des temp\u00e9ratures \u00e0 la surface de la mer"}
