{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "PDGES Gaz a effet de serre - Recherche de donnees en ligne", "keywords": "greenhouse gas,emissions,energy,industrial processes,solvent and other product use,agriculture,land use,land-use change,forestry and waste", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "09b8a2d3-8817-4d74-a42f-ccc4d74ffa7a", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Programme de d\u00e9claration des \u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre (PDGES)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "GHGRP Greenhouse Gas Online Data Search", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le Programme de d\u00e9claration des \u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre (PDGES) est l'inventaire prescrit par la loi canadienne et accessible au public des donn\u00e9es relatives aux gaz \u00e0 effet de serre d\u00e9clar\u00e9es par les installations vis\u00e9es. Cette section pr\u00e9sente les faits saillants de la derni\u00e8re ann\u00e9e de d\u00e9claration -- y compris un bref survol et une analyse des donn\u00e9es d\u00e9clar\u00e9es par les installations, des tableaux de donn\u00e9es et des outils de recherche en ligne. Cet outil de recherche permet de cr\u00e9er des requ\u00eates personnalis\u00e9es portant sur les donn\u00e9es d\u00e9clar\u00e9es par les installations. Les r\u00e9sultats des recherches sont pr\u00e9sent\u00e9s sous forme de tableaux dynamiques.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/ghg/onlineData/dataSearch_e.cfm", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-03-15", "time_period_coverage_start": "2004-01-01", "data_series_name": "Greenhouse Gas Emissions Reporting Program (GHGRP)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/ges-ghg/Default.asp?lang=Fr&n=1357A041-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2008-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/ges-ghg/Default.asp?lang=En&n=1357A041-1", "notes": "This Greenhouse Gas Emissions Reporting Program (GHGRP) is Canada's legislated, publicly-accessible inventory of facility-reported greenhouse gas (GHG) data and information. This section provides highlights from the latest reporting year -- including a brief overview and analysis of the reported facility data, key data tables, and online search tool. This search tool provides the ability to create personalized queries of the reported facility data. The search will return dynamic tables.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "gaz \u00e0 effet de serre,\u00e9missions,\u00e9nergie,proc\u00e9d\u00e9s industriels,utilisation de solvants et d'autres produits,agriculture,affectation des terres,changements d'affectation des terres,foresterie et d\u00e9chets"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "\u00c9missions d'oxydes d'azote (NOX) par installation au Canada - Application de cartographie interactive des ICDE", "keywords": "environmental indicators,emissions,air pollutants,nitrogen oxides,facilities,facility emissions,indicator data,data download,interactive maps,mapping application", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "10594cf0-17a0-49a1-90f2-086dd5210533", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Nitrogen Oxides (NOx) Air Pollutant Emissions by Facility, Canada - CESI Interactive Mapping Application ", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "L'application de cartographie interactive de l'Initiative des indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) vous permet d'explorer rapidement les indicateurs environnementaux locaux et r\u00e9gionaux du Canada \u00e0 l'aide de multiples formats de cartes et de donn\u00e9es accessibles (HTML, CSV, KML/KMZ). Les cartes des indicateurs environnementaux peuvent \u00eatre configur\u00e9es pour n'importe quelle province, ville majeure ou r\u00e9gion de code postal du Canada. L'application de cartographie interactive affiche les donn\u00e9es des \u00e9missions d'oxydes d'azote par installation. ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en&n=DDD75E27-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn