{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "PDGES - Inventaire de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre - \u00c9missions totales de GES par gaz d\u00e9clar\u00e9es par les installations", "keywords": "reenhouse gas,emissions,energy,industrial processes,solvent and other product use,agriculture,land use,land-use change,forestry and waste", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "860ba3c1-b5b1-45ee-bdef-644ffad62a54", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Ensembles de donn\u00e9es de l'Inventaire de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre (IGES)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "GHGRP - Green House Gas Inventory - Total Facility GHG Emissions by Gas", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Tableau principal de donn\u00e9es sur les \u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre (GES) de 2009 d\u00e9clar\u00e9es par les installations. \nLe Programme de d\u00e9claration des \u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre (PDGES) est l'inventaire prescrit par la loi canadienne et accessible au public des donn\u00e9es relatives aux gaz \u00e0 effet de serre d\u00e9clar\u00e9es par les installations vis\u00e9es. Cette section pr\u00e9sente les faits saillants de la derni\u00e8re ann\u00e9e de d\u00e9claration -- y compris un bref survol et une analyse des donn\u00e9es d\u00e9clar\u00e9es par les installations, des tableaux de donn\u00e9es et des outils de recherche en ligne.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/ges-ghg/default.asp?lang=En&n=DF08C7BA-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/ges-ghg/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=DF08C7BA-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/ges-ghg/DF08C7BA-5545-4FEA-ADDE-73C8BE97205D/Tableau%201%20GES%20-%20GHG%20Table%201.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-28", "time_period_coverage_start": "2008-01-01", "data_series_name": "Green House Gas Inventory (GHGI) Datasets", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/ges-ghg/Default.asp?lang=Fr&n=1357A041-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2008-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "2010-03-09", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/ges-ghg/Default.asp?lang=En&n=1357A041-1", "notes": "Key table on 2009 facility reported greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions. \nThis Greenhouse Gas Emissions Reporting Program (GHGRP) is Canada's legislated, publicly-accessible inventory of facility-reported greenhouse gas (GHG) data and information. This section provides highlights from the latest reporting year -- including a brief overview and analysis of the reported facility data, key data tables, and online search tool.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "gaz \u00e0 effet de serre,\u00e9missions,\u00e9nergie,proc\u00e9d\u00e9s industriels,utilisation de solvants et d'autres produits,agriculture,affectation des terres,changements d'affectation des terres,foresterie et d\u00e9chets"}
