{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Ann\u00e9e par trimestre Poulet et produits de poulet ", "keywords": "Chicken,BRP01F,Quaterly,Imports,Permits", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "1e4a2ece-8fb1-4640-aad3-a5b0aec86e93", "subject": "Agriculture  Agriculture", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Quarterly Chicken and Chicken Products", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Niveau d'utilisation les 96 \u00e0 104 de la Liste des marchandises d'importation contr\u00f4l\u00e9e (LMIC), \u00e0 savoir le poulet et les produits \u00e0 base de poulet qui sont class\u00e9s aux positions tarifaires 01.05, 02.07, 02.09, 02.10, 16.01 et 16.02 de la liste des dispositions tarifaires de l'annexe du Tarif des douanes et qui sont \u00e9num\u00e9r\u00e9s \u00e0 l'annexe 12. Il couvre aussi les \u00ab m\u00e9langes d\u00e9finis de sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9 \u00bb de produits \u00e0 base de poulet class\u00e9s aux num\u00e9ros tarifaires 1602.32.11 et 1602.32.92 et les autres produits \u00e0 base de poulet non inscrits sur la LMIC", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "XML", "url": "http://www.international.gc.ca/eicb/reports/BRP01F.xml", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.international.gc.ca/eicb/reports/BRP01F.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-01-01", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "Utilization levels for Items 96 to 104 of the Import Control List (ICL), namely chicken and chicken products falling under heading Nos. 01.05, 02.07, 02.09, 02.10, 16.01 and 16.02 in the list of tariff provisions set out in the Schedule to the Customs Tariff and listed in Appendix 12. It also covers \"specially defined mixtures\" of chicken products falling under tariff item No. 1602.32.11 and 1602.32.92, and other non-ICL chicken products.", "owner_org": "dfait-maeci", "keywords_fra": "Poulet,BRP01F,Trimestre,Importation,Licences"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Ann\u00e9e par trimestre oeufs d'incubation de poulet et poussins \u00e0 chair ", "keywords": "Broiler Hatching,Chicks,Eggs,BRH05,Imports,Permits,Quaterly", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "9ae50873-dddc-40eb-aa14-bba2e947abd5", "subject": "Agriculture  Agriculture", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Quarterly Broiler Hatching Eggs and Chicks", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Niveau d'utilisation les articles 94 et 95 de la Liste des marchandises d'importation contr\u00f4l\u00e9e (LMIC), \u00e0 savoir les poulets de chair pour la production nationale, qui sont des volailles de l'esp\u00e8ce domestique, n'exc\u00e9dant pas 185g, et qui sont class\u00e9s dans les num\u00e9ros tarifaires 0105.11.21 ou 0105.11.22 de la liste des dispositions tarifaires figurant \u00e0 l'annexe du Tarif des douanes, et les oeufs d'incubation pour poulets de chair de l'esp\u00e8ce domestique, qui sont class\u00e9s dans les num\u00e9ros tarifaires 0407.00.11 ou 0407.00.12 de la liste des dispositions tarifaires figurant \u00e0 l'annexe du Tarif des douanes.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "XML", "url": "http://www.international.gc.ca/eicb/reports/BRH05.xml", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.international.gc.ca/eicb/reports/BRH05.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-01-01", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "Utilization levels for Items 94 and 95 of the Import Control List (ICL), namely live broilers for domestic production, being fowls of the species Gallus domesticus, weighing not more than 185 grams, that are classified under tariff item No. 0105.11.21 or 0105.11.22 in the List of Tariff Provisions set out in the schedule to the Customs Tariff; and hatching eggs, for broilers, of fowls of the species Gallus domesticus, that are classified under tariff item No. 0407.00.11 or 0407.00.12 in the List of Tariff Provisions set out in the schedule to the Customs Tariff.", "owner_org": "dfait-maeci", "keywords_fra": "Oeufs d'incubation,Poussins,Oeufs,BRH05,Importation,Licenses,Trimestre"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Les avis de conformit\u00e9 Veterinary Species", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "98ee168e-dcae-47ff-b136-104f7af212e2", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Notice of Compliance Veterinary Species ", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Un avis de conformit\u00e9 (AC) est une notification d\u00e9livr\u00e9e en vertu du paragraphe C.08.004(1)(a), indiquant que le fabricant/promoteur se conforme aux articles C.08.002 ou C.08.003 et C.08.005.1 du R\u00e8glement sur les aliments et drogues. Un avis de conformit\u00e9 est \u00e9mis si la pr\u00e9sentation est jug\u00e9e conforme apr\u00e8s un examen complet.\n\nLes fichiers contenus dans l'extrait des donn\u00e9es d'avis de conformit\u00e9 contiennent les dates d'autorisation pour tous les m\u00e9dicaments pour lesquels un AC a \u00e9t\u00e9 \u00e9mis depuis 1994. Il y a quatre types d'AC : biologique, vente libre, vente sous ordonnance et v\u00e9t\u00e9rinaire. Ce fichier de donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur les avis de conformit\u00e9 Veterinary Species.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/txt/prodpharma/notices-avis/noc-acc/noc_vet_species.txt", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-08-19", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "A Notice of Compliance is a notification, issued pursuant to paragraph C.08.004(1)(a), indicating that a manufacturer has complied with sections C.08.002 or C.08.003 and C.08.005.1 of the Food and Drug Regulations. Notices of Compliance are issued to a manufacturer following the satisfactory review of a submission.\n\nThe NOC extract files contain Health Canada authorization dates for all drugs dating back to 1994 that have received an NOC.  There are four types of NOCs: Biological, Prescription, Nonprescription and Veterinary.  This data extract contains information on Notice of Compliance Veterinary Species.\n", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Les avis de conformit\u00e9 Product Route", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "132b1bc1-ee07-4082-ac6f-476315de1f1b", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Notice of Compliance Product Route", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Un avis de conformit\u00e9 (AC) est une notification d\u00e9livr\u00e9e en vertu du paragraphe C.08.004(1)(a), indiquant que le fabricant/promoteur se conforme aux articles C.08.002 ou C.08.003 et C.08.005.1 du R\u00e8glement sur les aliments et drogues. Un avis de conformit\u00e9 est \u00e9mis si la pr\u00e9sentation est jug\u00e9e conforme apr\u00e8s un examen complet.\n\nLes fichiers contenus dans l'extrait des donn\u00e9es d'avis de conformit\u00e9 contiennent les dates d'autorisation pour tous les m\u00e9dicaments pour lesquels un AC a \u00e9t\u00e9 \u00e9mis depuis 1994. Il y a quatre types d'AC : biologique, vente libre, vente sous ordonnance et v\u00e9t\u00e9rinaire. Ce fichier de donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur les avis de conformit\u00e9 Product Route.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/txt/prodpharma/notices-avis/noc-acc/noc_product_route.txt", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-08-19", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "A Notice of Compliance is a notification, issued pursuant to paragraph C.08.004(1)(a), indicating that a manufacturer has complied with sections C.08.002 or C.08.003 and C.08.005.1 of the Food and Drug Regulations. Notices of Compliance are issued to a manufacturer following the satisfactory review of a submission.\n\nThe NOC extract files contain Health Canada authorization dates for all drugs dating back to 1994 that have received an NOC.  There are four types of NOCs: Biological, Prescription, Nonprescription and Veterinary.  This data extract contains information on Notice of Compliance Product Route.\n", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Les avis de conformit\u00e9 Product Form", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "fa5ad2aa-ab59-4421-8491-4c004d94d0bc", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Notice of Compliance Product Form", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Un avis de conformit\u00e9 (AC) est une notification d\u00e9livr\u00e9e en vertu du paragraphe C.08.004(1)(a), indiquant que le fabricant/promoteur se conforme aux articles C.08.002 ou C.08.003 et C.08.005.1 du R\u00e8glement sur les aliments et drogues. Un avis de conformit\u00e9 est \u00e9mis si la pr\u00e9sentation est jug\u00e9e conforme apr\u00e8s un examen complet.\n\nLes fichiers contenus dans l'extrait des donn\u00e9es d'avis de conformit\u00e9 contiennent les dates d'autorisation pour tous les m\u00e9dicaments pour lesquels un AC a \u00e9t\u00e9 \u00e9mis depuis 1994. Il y a quatre types d'AC : biologique, vente libre, vente sous ordonnance et v\u00e9t\u00e9rinaire. Ce fichier de donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur les avis de conformit\u00e9 Product Form.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/txt/prodpharma/notices-avis/noc-acc/noc_product_form.txt", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-08-19", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "A Notice of Compliance is a notification, issued pursuant to paragraph C.08.004(1)(a), indicating that a manufacturer has complied with sections C.08.002 or C.08.003 and C.08.005.1 of the Food and Drug Regulations. Notices of Compliance are issued to a manufacturer following the satisfactory review of a submission.\n\nThe NOC extract files contain Health Canada authorization dates for all drugs dating back to 1994 that have received an NOC.  There are four types of NOCs: Biological, Prescription, Nonprescription and Veterinary.  This data extract contains information on Notice of Compliance Product Form.\n", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Notice of Compliance Product Ingredient", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "52bb749a-4006-4253-a4a5-63e51d2f880f", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Notice of Compliance Product Ingredient", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Un avis de conformit\u00e9 (AC) est une notification d\u00e9livr\u00e9e en vertu du paragraphe C.08.004(1)(a), indiquant que le fabricant/promoteur se conforme aux articles C.08.002 ou C.08.003 et C.08.005.1 du R\u00e8glement sur les aliments et drogues. Un avis de conformit\u00e9 est \u00e9mis si la pr\u00e9sentation est jug\u00e9e conforme apr\u00e8s un examen complet.\n\nLes fichiers contenus dans l'extrait des donn\u00e9es d'avis de conformit\u00e9 contiennent les dates d'autorisation pour tous les m\u00e9dicaments pour lesquels un AC a \u00e9t\u00e9 \u00e9mis depuis 1994. Il y a quatre types d'AC : biologique, vente libre, vente sous ordonnance et v\u00e9t\u00e9rinaire. Ce fichier de donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur les avis de conformit\u00e9 Product Ingredient.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/txt/prodpharma/notices-avis/noc-acc/noc_product_ingredient.txt", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-08-19", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "A Notice of Compliance is a notification, issued pursuant to paragraph C.08.004(1)(a), indicating that a manufacturer has complied with sections C.08.002 or C.08.003 and C.08.005.1 of the Food and Drug Regulations. Notices of Compliance are issued to a manufacturer following the satisfactory review of a submission.\n\nThe NOC extract files contain Health Canada authorization dates for all drugs dating back to 1994 that have received an NOC.  There are four types of NOCs: Biological, Prescription, Nonprescription and Veterinary.  This data extract contains information on Notice of Compliance Product Ingredient.\n", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
