{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Les avis de conformit\u00e9 principaux", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "e36f617d-f8b1-48a3-a42d-b6378aa4c683", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Notices of Compliance Main", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Un avis de conformit\u00e9 (AC) est une notification d\u00e9livr\u00e9e en vertu du paragraphe C.08.004(1)(a), indiquant que le fabricant/promoteur se conforme aux articles C.08.002 ou C.08.003 et C.08.005.1 du R\u00e8glement sur les aliments et drogues. Un avis de conformit\u00e9 est \u00e9mis si la pr\u00e9sentation est jug\u00e9e conforme apr\u00e8s un examen complet.\nLes fichiers contenus dans l'extrait des donn\u00e9es d'avis de conformit\u00e9 contiennent les dates d'autorisation pour tous les m\u00e9dicaments pour lesquels un AC a \u00e9t\u00e9 \u00e9mis depuis 1994. Il y a quatre types d'AC : biologique, vente libre, vente sous ordonnance et v\u00e9t\u00e9rinaire. Ce fichier de donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur les avis de conformit\u00e9 principaux.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/txt/prodpharma/notices-avis/noc-acc/noc_main.txt", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-08-19", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "A Notice of Compliance is a notification, issued pursuant to paragraph C.08.004(1)(a), indicating that a manufacturer has complied with sections C.08.002 or C.08.003 and C.08.005.1 of the Food and Drug Regulations. Notices of Compliance are issued to a manufacturer following the satisfactory review of a submission.\n\nThe NOC extract files contain Health Canada authorization dates for all drugs dating back to 1994 that have received an NOC.  There are four types of NOCs: Biological, Prescription, Nonprescription and Veterinary.  This data extract contains information on Notice of Compliance Main.\n", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Ingr\u00e9dients non-m\u00e9dicinaux des produits de sant\u00e9 naturels homologu\u00e9s", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "ed421ac5-8fb8-41a1-93cf-32ba6edcb141", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Licensed Natural Health Product Non medicinal ingredients", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "La Base de donn\u00e9es des produits de sant\u00e9 naturels homologu\u00e9s contient des renseignements sur les produits de sant\u00e9 naturels ayant re\u00e7u une licence de mise en march\u00e9 de Sant\u00e9 Canada.  Ce fichier de donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur les ingr\u00e9dients non-m\u00e9dicinaux des PSN.\nLes produits homologu\u00e9s ont \u00e9t\u00e9 examin\u00e9s par Sant\u00e9 Canada et jug\u00e9s s\u00fbrs, efficaces et de haute qualit\u00e9 dans les conditions d'utilisation recommand\u00e9es. Vous pouvez trouver les produits de sant\u00e9 naturels homologu\u00e9s au moyen du num\u00e9ro de produit naturel (NPN) ou du num\u00e9ro de m\u00e9dicament hom\u00e9opathique (DIN-HM) figurant sur l'\u00e9tiquette du produit.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodnatur/applications/licen-prod/NHP_NONMEDICINAL_INGREDIENTS.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2009-12-18", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "The Licensed Natural Health Products Database contains information about natural health products that have been issued a product licence by Health Canada. This data extract contains information on NHP Non medicinal ingredients.\n\nProducts with a licence have been assessed by Health Canada and found to be safe, effective and of high quality under their recommended conditions of use. You can identify licensed natural health products by looking for the eight-digit Natural Product Number (NPN) or Homeopathic Medicine Number (DIN-HM) on the label.\n", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Voie des produits de sant\u00e9 naturels homologu\u00e9s", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "145cbb68-bf2e-4155-a9da-c27fe60bbaea", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Licensed Natural Health Product Route", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "La Base de donn\u00e9es des produits de sant\u00e9 naturels homologu\u00e9s contient des renseignements sur les produits de sant\u00e9 naturels ayant re\u00e7u une licence de mise en march\u00e9 de Sant\u00e9 Canada.  Ce fichier de donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur la voie des PSN.\nLes produits homologu\u00e9s ont \u00e9t\u00e9 examin\u00e9s par Sant\u00e9 Canada et jug\u00e9s s\u00fbrs, efficaces et de haute qualit\u00e9 dans les conditions d'utilisation recommand\u00e9es. Vous pouvez trouver les produits de sant\u00e9 naturels homologu\u00e9s au moyen du num\u00e9ro de produit naturel (NPN) ou du num\u00e9ro de m\u00e9dicament hom\u00e9opathique (DIN-HM) figurant sur l'\u00e9tiquette du produit.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodnatur/applications/licen-prod/NHP_ROUTE.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2009-12-18", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "The Licensed Natural Health Products Database contains information about natural health products that have been issued a product licence by Health Canada. This data extract contains information on NHP Route.\n\nProducts with a licence have been assessed by Health Canada and found to be safe, effective and of high quality under their recommended conditions of use. You can identify licensed natural health products by looking for the eight-digit Natural Product Number (NPN) or Homeopathic Medicine Number (DIN-HM) on the label.\n", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Ingr\u00e9dients m\u00e9dicinaux des produits de sant\u00e9 naturels homologu\u00e9s", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "ca074b22-8790-4f89-9417-b4c9d9fd406f", "subject": "Health and Safety  Sant\u00e9 et s\u00e9curit\u00e9", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Licensed Natural Health Product Medicinal ingredients", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "La Base de donn\u00e9es des produits de sant\u00e9 naturels homologu\u00e9s contient des renseignements sur les produits de sant\u00e9 naturels ayant re\u00e7u une licence de mise en march\u00e9 de Sant\u00e9 Canada.  Ce fichier de donn\u00e9es contient des renseignements sur les ingr\u00e9dients m\u00e9dicinaux des PSN.\nLes produits homologu\u00e9s ont \u00e9t\u00e9 examin\u00e9s par Sant\u00e9 Canada et jug\u00e9s s\u00fbrs, efficaces et de haute qualit\u00e9 dans les conditions d'utilisation recommand\u00e9es. Vous pouvez trouver les produits de sant\u00e9 naturels homologu\u00e9s au moyen du num\u00e9ro de produit naturel (NPN) ou du num\u00e9ro de m\u00e9dicament hom\u00e9opathique (DIN-HM) figurant sur l'\u00e9tiquette du produit.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/alt_formats/zip/prodnatur/applications/licen-prod/NHP_MEDICINAL_INGREDIENTS.zip", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2009-12-18", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "The Licensed Natural Health Products Database contains information about natural health products that have been issued a product licence by Health Canada. This data extract contains information on NHP Medicinal ingredients.\n\nProducts with a licence have been assessed by Health Canada and found to be safe, effective and of high quality under their recommended conditions of use. You can identify licensed natural health products by looking for the eight-digit Natural Product Number (NPN) or Homeopathic Medicine Number (DIN-HM) on the label.\n", "owner_org": "hc-sc", "keywords_fra": ""}
