{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Enqu\u00eate sur l'eau potable et les eaux us\u00e9es des municipalit\u00e9s - Donn\u00e9es sur l'utilisation de l'eau (2001)", "keywords": "dataset,tabular,inland water resources,stream discharge,water supply reservoirs,municipal water treatment,municipal wastewater treatment", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "b850bff8-c6e8-4c46-a270-0232c6a04d5a", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Don\u00e9es de l'Enqu\u00eate sur l'eau potable et les eaux us\u00e9es des municipalit\u00e9s", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Municipal Water and Wastewater Survey - Water Use Data (2001)", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es sommaires, regroup\u00e9es par collectivit\u00e9.\nL'Enqu\u00eate sur l'eau potable et les eaux us\u00e9es des municipalit\u00e9s (EEPEU) fait suite \u00e0 l'Enqu\u00eate sur la tarification et l'utilisation de l'eau par les municipalit\u00e9s, qu'a men\u00e9e Environnement Canada tous les deux ou trois ans depuis le d\u00e9but des ann\u00e9es 1980. Cet ensemble de donn\u00e9es contient les r\u00e9sultats de l'enqu\u00eate concernant l'utilisation de l'eau et de l'eau potable et des eaux us\u00e9es \u00e0 l'\u00e9chelle des municipalit\u00e9s. Ces donn\u00e9es peuvent \u00eatre utilis\u00e9es pour \u00e9valuer les tendances qui permettraient de faire une utilisation plus avis\u00e9e des ressources hydriques.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/Water-apps/MWWS/en/data/Use_DB_2001_MunicipalAggregationsImputed.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/eau-water/ED0E12D7-1C3B-4658-8833-347B527C688A/Use_DB_2001_MunicipalesRegroupeesImputees.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2005-03-10", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Municipal Water and Wastewater Survey Data", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/eau-water/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=ED7C2D33-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/eau-water/default.asp?lang=EN&n=ED7C2D33-1", "notes": "Summary data, reported by community. \nThe Municipal Water and Wastewater Survey (MWWS) is an expansion of the Municipal Water Use and Pricing Survey (MUD), which had been conducted by Environment Canada every two or three years since the early 1980s. This dataset contains the results of the survey regarding water and waste water use at the municipal level. This data can be used to see trends that can lead to wiser use of water resources.\n", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "ensemble de donn\u00e9es,tabulaire,ressources hydriques int\u00e9rieures,d\u00e9bit,r\u00e9servoirs d'alimentation en eau,traitement des eaux municipales,traitement des eaux us\u00e9es municipales"}
