g areas as a measure of the impacts of human activity on marine water quality. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,eau,qualit\u00e9 de l'eau,pressions sur la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau,zones de croissance des mollusques,r\u00e9colte de mollusques,bact\u00e9ries,Programme canadien de contr\u00f4le de la salubrit\u00e9 des mollusques"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Inventaire national des rejets de polluants (INRP) - Donn\u00e9es sur les rejets et transferts de polluants d\u00e9clar\u00e9es par les installations pour 1994-2009", "keywords": "pollutant,pollution,emissions,environment,recycling,disposal,industry,chemical,substance,toxic,air pollution,water pollution,land,chemical spill,waste,underground injection,landfill,energy recovery,ozone,smog,particulate matter,emissions,volatile organic compound,nitrogen oxides,sulphur oxide,ammonia,facilities,environmental performance,business,release,map,sector", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "cb7bc5c7-9259-42a2-8c67-ef1de19de3cc", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Ensembles de donn\u00e9es d\u00e9clar\u00e9es par les installations \u00e0 l'Inventaire national des rejets de polluants (INRP)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) - Pollutant Release and Transfer Data Reported by Facilities for 1994 - 2009", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "L'Inventaire national des rejets de polluants (INRP) est l'inventaire public du Canada sur les polluants rejet\u00e9s (dans l'atmosph\u00e8re, dans l'eau et dans le sol), \u00e9limin\u00e9s et recycl\u00e9s. Les donn\u00e9es sur les rejets et les transferts de polluants d\u00e9clar\u00e9s \u00e0 l'INRP par les installations comprennent\u00a0: des donn\u00e9es et des renseignements au sujet des polluants rejet\u00e9s, \u00e9limin\u00e9s et recycl\u00e9s d\u00e9clar\u00e9s par les installations canadiennes et publi\u00e9s par Environnement Canada pour le programme de d\u00e9claration obligatoire de l'INRP en vertu de la Loi canadienne sur la protection de l'environnement, 1999 [LCPE (1999)]. Ces polluants comprennent des substances toxiques telles que les principaux polluants contribuant au smog, \u00e0 la formation de pluies acides et/ou \u00e0 la pi\u00e8tre qualit\u00e9 de l'air, ainsi qu'un certains nombre de m\u00e9taux lourds s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9s et de polluants organiques persistants. Il y  a plusieurs facteurs \u00e0 consid\u00e9rer lors de l'analyse des donn\u00e9es de l'INRP et d'autres renseignements sont disponibles sur le site web de l'INRP. Les donn\u00e9es de l'INRP sont disponibles pour les ann\u00e9es 1993-2009 dans plusieurs formats : un outil de recherche en ligne, des bases de donn\u00e9es t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables, ainsi que des couches cartographiques. En plus de la base de donn\u00e9es pour toutes les ann\u00e9es (1993-2009), des bases de donn\u00e9es pour les ann\u00e9es individuelles sont aussi publi\u00e9es, ainsi que des tableaux d\u00e9crivant la structure des bases de donn\u00e9es.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=En&n=B5C1EAB8-1,http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/querysite/query_e.cfm", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=B5C1EAB8-1,http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/querysite/query_f.cfm", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/data/All_Years_1994-2009_mdb_2010-09-23.exe", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/data/All_Years_1994-2009_mdb_2010-09-23.exe", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-12-20", "time_period_coverage_start": "1994-01-01", "data_series_name": "National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) Facility Data", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=4A577BB9-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2009-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=En&n=4A577BB9-1", "notes": "The National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) is Canada's public inventory of pollutant releases (to air, water and land), disposals and transfers for recycling. The NPRI facility pollutant release and transfer data includes:  data and information on pollutant releases, disposals and transfers for recycling that was reported by facilities in Canada and published by Environment Canada for the NPRI mandatory reporting program, under the authority of the Canadian Environmental Protection Act, 1999 (CEPA 1999).  (These pollutants include toxic substances such as the main pollutants contributing to smog, acid rain and/or poor air quality, a number of heavy metals and persistent organic pollutants.   There are important factors that should be considered prior to the use and interpretation of NPRI data and additional information is available on the NPRI web site.  NPRI data is available for the years 1993 - 2009 in a number of formats:  online query tools, downloadable databases, map layers.  In addition to the multi-year datasets, single year datasets are posted, along with corresponding database structure tables.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "polluant,pollution  \u00e9missions,environnement,recyclage,l'\u00e9limination,industrie,chimique,substance toxique,pollution de l'air,pollution de l'eau,la terre,d\u00e9versement de produits chimiques,des d\u00e9chets,injection souterraine,enfouissement,r\u00e9cup\u00e9ration d'\u00e9nergie,ozone,smog,particules,les \u00e9missions,compos\u00e9s organiques volatils,oxydes d'azote,oxydes de soufre,l'ammoniac,installations,performance environnementale,entreprises,rejets,carte,secteur"}
