ment, 1999 [LCPE (1999)]. Ces polluants comprennent des substances toxiques telles que les principaux polluants contribuant au smog, \u00e0 la formation de pluies acides et/ou \u00e0 la pi\u00e8tre qualit\u00e9 de l'air, ainsi qu'un certains nombre de m\u00e9taux lourds s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9s et de polluants organiques persistants. Il y  a plusieurs facteurs \u00e0 consid\u00e9rer lors de l'analyse des donn\u00e9es de l'INRP et d'autres renseignements sont disponibles sur le site web de l'INRP. Les donn\u00e9es de l'INRP sont disponibles pour les ann\u00e9es 1993-2009 dans plusieurs formats : un outil de recherche en ligne, des bases de donn\u00e9es t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables, ainsi que des couches cartographiques. En plus de la base de donn\u00e9es pour toutes les ann\u00e9es (1993-2009), des bases de donn\u00e9es pour les ann\u00e9es individuelles sont aussi publi\u00e9es, ainsi qu'un tableaux d\u00e9crivant la structure de la base de donn\u00e9es.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=En&n=B5C1EAB8-1, http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/querysite/query_e.cfm", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=B5C1EAB8-1, http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/querysite/query_f.cfm", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/WebSol/data/Canada_2007_mdb_2010-09-23.exe", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/WebSol/data/Canada_2007_mdb_2010-09-23.exe", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-12-20", "time_period_coverage_start": "2007-01-01", "data_series_name": "National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) Facility Data", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=4A577BB9-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2007-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=En&n=4A577BB9-1", "notes": "The National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) is Canada's public inventory of pollutant releases (to air, water and land), disposals and transfers for recycling. The NPRI facility pollutant release and transfer data includes:  data and information on pollutant releases, disposals and transfers for recycling that was reported by facilities in Canada and published by Environment Canada for the NPRI mandatory reporting program, under the authority of the Canadian Environmental Protection Act, 1999 (CEPA 1999).  (These pollutants include toxic substances such as the main pollutants contributing to smog, acid rain and/or poor air quality, a number of heavy metals and persistent organic pollutants.   There are important factors that should be considered prior to the use and interpretation of NPRI data and additional information is available on the NPRI web site.  NPRI data is available for the years 1993 - 2009 in a number of formats:  online query tools, downloadable databases, map layers.  In addition to the multi-year datasets, single year datasets are posted, along with corresponding database structure tables.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "polluant,pollution  \u00e9missions,environnement,recyclage,l'\u00e9limination,industrie,chimique,substance toxique,pollution de l'air,pollution de l'eau,la terre,d\u00e9versement de produits chimiques,des d\u00e9chets,injection souterraine,enfouissement,r\u00e9cup\u00e9ration d'\u00e9nergie,ozone,smog,particules,les \u00e9missions,compos\u00e9s organiques volatils,oxydes d'azote,oxydes de soufre,l'ammoniac,installations,performance environnementale,entreprises,rejets,carte,secteur"}
