{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Inventaire national des rejets de polluants (INRP) - Donn\u00e9es sur les rejets et transferts de polluants d\u00e9clar\u00e9es par les installations - couche cartographiques 1994-2009 ", "keywords": "pollutant,pollution,emissions,environment,recycling,disposal,industry,chemical substances,toxic,air pollution,water pollution,land,chemical spill,waste,underground injection,landfill,energy recovery,ozone,smog,particulate matter,emissions,volatile organic compound,nitrogen oxides,sulphur oxide,ammonia,facilities,environmental performance,business,release,map,sector", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "d3bbaf29-98da-4403-9e0e-8794def9e176", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Ensembles de donn\u00e9es d\u00e9clar\u00e9es par les installations \u00e0 l'Inventaire national des rejets de polluants (INRP)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) - Facility Pollutant Release and Transfer Data - 1994 - 2009 Map Layers", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "L'Inventaire national des rejets de polluants (INRP) est l'inventaire public du Canada sur les polluants rejet\u00e9s (dans l'atmosph\u00e8re, dans l'eau et dans le sol), \u00e9limin\u00e9s et recycl\u00e9s. Les couches cartographiques des donn\u00e9es sur les installations d\u00e9montrent la localisation des installations qui ont d\u00e9clar\u00e9s \u00e0 l'INRP. La couche cartographique pour 1994-2009 consiste en une base de donn\u00e9es pluriannuelle int\u00e9gr\u00e9e qui peut \u00eatre visualis\u00e9e \u00e0 l'aide de logiciels de \u00ab\u00a0terre virtuelle\u00a0\u00bb, et qui incluent des liens vers les rapports individuels des installations. Il y  a plusieurs facteurs \u00e0 consid\u00e9rer avant de proc\u00e9der \u00e0 l'analyse et \u00e0 l'interpr\u00e9tation des donn\u00e9es de l'INRP et d'autres renseignements sont disponibles sur le site web de l'INRP.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=en&n=F8D54254-1, http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/20DE1DC2-B2CB-4EFE-AAAB-3F24B836A460/NPRI_GEO_2010-09-23.xls", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=F8D54254-1, http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/20DE1DC2-B2CB-4EFE-AAAB-3F24B836A460/NPRI_GEO_2010-09-23.xls", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "kml / kmz", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/data/NPRI_E.kmz", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "kml / kmz", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/data/NPRI_F.kmz", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-12-20", "time_period_coverage_start": "1994-01-01", "data_series_name": "National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) Facility Data", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=4A577BB9-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2009-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=En&n=4A577BB9-1", "notes": "The National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) is Canada's public inventory of pollutant releases (to air, water and land), disposals and transfers for recycling. The NPRI facility data map layers display locations of facilities that reported to the NPRI.  The 1994-2009 map layers consist of an integrated, multi-year dataset that viewable in virtual globe software, with built-in inks to individual facility reports.  There are important factors that should be considered prior to the use and interpretation of NPRI data and additional information is available on the NPRI web site.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "polluant,pollution  \u00e9missions,environnement,recyclage,l'\u00e9limination,industrie,substance toxique,pollution de l'air,pollution de l'eau,la terre,d\u00e9versement de produits chimiques,des d\u00e9chets,injection souterraine,enfouissement,r\u00e9cup\u00e9ration d'\u00e9nergie,ozone,smog,particules,les \u00e9missions,compos\u00e9s organiques volatils,oxydes d'azote,oxydes de soufre,l'ammoniac,installations,performance environnementale,entreprises,rejets,carte,secteur"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Inventaire national des rejets de polluants (INRP) - Donn\u00e9es sur les rejets et transferts de polluants d\u00e9clar\u00e9es par les installations - couche cartographiques 2009 ", "keywords": "pollutant,pollution,emissions,environment,recycling,disposal,industry,chemical,substance,toxic,air pollution,water pollution,land,chemical spill,waste,underground injection,landfill,energy recovery,ozone,smog,particulate matter,emissions,volatile organic compound,nitrogen oxides,sulphur oxide,ammonia,facilities,environmental performance,business,release,sector,map", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "7bee287e-ffeb-42ab-8905-648a77bfa705", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Ensembles de donn\u00e9es d\u00e9clar\u00e9es par les installations \u00e0 l'Inventaire national des rejets de polluants (INRP)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) - Facility Pollutant Release and Transfer Data - 2009 Map Layers", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "L'Inventaire national des rejets de polluants (INRP) est l'inventaire public du Canada sur les polluants rejet\u00e9s (dans l'atmosph\u00e8re, dans l'eau et dans le sol), \u00e9limin\u00e9s et recycl\u00e9s. Les couches cartographiques des donn\u00e9es sur les installations d\u00e9montrent la localisation des installations qui ont d\u00e9clar\u00e9s \u00e0 l'INRP. La couche cartographique pour 2009 se base sur les donn\u00e9es et renseignements qui ont \u00e9t\u00e9 d\u00e9clar\u00e9s \u00e0 l'INRP pour 2009. Les couches cartographiques peuvent \u00eatre visualis\u00e9es \u00e0 l'aide de logiciels de \u00ab\u00a0terre virtuelle\u00a0\u00bb, et incluent des liens vers les rapports individuels des installations. Il y  a plusieurs facteurs \u00e0 consid\u00e9rer avant de proc\u00e9der \u00e0 l'analyse et \u00e0 l'interpr\u00e9tation des donn\u00e9es de l'INRP et d'autres renseignements sont disponibles sur le site web de l'INRP, ainsi qu'une couche cartographique pluriannuelle int\u00e9gr\u00e9e pour 1994-2009.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=en&n=F8D54254-1, http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/20DE1DC2-B2CB-4EFE-AAAB-3F24B836A460/NPRI_GEO_2010-09-23.xls", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=F8D54254-1, http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/20DE1DC2-B2CB-4EFE-AAAB-3F24B836A460/NPRI_GEO_2010-09-23.xls", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "kml / kmz", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/data/NPRI_E_2009.kmz", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "kml / kmz", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/data/NPRI_F_2009.kmz", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-12-20", "time_period_coverage_start": "2009-01-01", "data_series_name": "National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) Facility Data", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=4A577BB9-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2009-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=En&n=4A577BB9-1", "notes": "The National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) is Canada's public inventory of pollutant releases (to air, water and land), disposals and transfers for recycling. The NPRI facility data map layers display locations of facilities that reported to the NPRI.  The 2009 map layers are based on the data and information that was reported to the NPRI for 2009.  The map layers are viewable in virtual globe software, with built-in inks to individual facility reports.  There are important factors that should be considered prior to the use and interpretation of NPRI data and additional information is available on the NPRI web site, along with an integrated, multi-year map layer data set for 1994 - 2009.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "polluant,pollution  \u00e9missions,environnement,recyclage,l'\u00e9limination,industrie,chimique,substance,toxique,pollution de l'air,pollution de l'eau,la terre,d\u00e9versement de produits chimiques,des d\u00e9chets,injection souterraine,enfouissement,r\u00e9cup\u00e9ration d'\u00e9nergie,ozone,smog,particules,les \u00e9missions,compos\u00e9s organiques volatils,oxydes d'azote,oxydes de soufre,l'ammoniac,installations,performance environnementale,entreprises,rejets,carte,secteur"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Tendances sur les \u00e9missions canadiennes de polluants atmosph\u00e9riques, 1985-2010 (Polluants atmosph\u00e9riques cl\u00e9s contribuant au smog, aux pluies acides et \u00e0 la mauvaise qualit\u00e9 de l'air)", "keywords": "air pollution,air quality,acid rain,smog,ozone,particulate matter,emissions,pollutants,volatile organic compounds,nitrogen oxide,sulphur dioxide,ammonia,carbon monoxide,vehicle emissions,area sources,diffuse sources,emission trends,air contaminants,toxic", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "6b78ce3d-b599-4175-9c12-d2b1068faa96", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Sommaires complets  sur les \u00e9missions de polluants atmoph\u00e9rique de l'Inventaire national des rejets de polluants (INRP)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "Canada's National Air Pollutant Emission Trends, 1985-2010 (key air pollutants contributing to smog, acid rain, poor air quality)", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Des sommaires et ces tendances nationaux complets sur les \u00e9missions de polluants atmosph\u00e9riques au canada sont bas\u00e9s sur des renseignements d\u00e9clar\u00e9s de fa\u00e7on obligatoire \u00e0 Environnement Canada  par les installations dans le cadre de  l'Inventaire national des rejets de polluants (INRP), ainsi que sur les estimations d'\u00e9missions compil\u00e9s par environnement Canada pour d'autres sources telles que les v\u00e9hicules \u00e0 moteur, le chauffage r\u00e9sidentiel, les activit\u00e9s agricoles et les incendies de for\u00eat. Les sommaires et tendances nationaux sur les \u00e9missions des principaux  polluants atmosph\u00e9riques, principaux contaminants atmosph\u00e9riques contribuant au smog, aux pluies acides et \u00e0 la mauvaise qualit\u00e9 de l'air (oxydes d'azote, oxydes de soufre, compos\u00e9s organiques volatils, ammoniac, monoxyde de carbone et mati\u00e8res particulaires), sont publi\u00e9s pour les ann\u00e9es 1985-2010. Ces donn\u00e9es sont disponibles dans une vari\u00e9t\u00e9 de formats\u00a0: un outil de recherche en ligne, tableurs Excel t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables, ainsi que des cartes de densit\u00e9 d'\u00e9missions de polluants atmosph\u00e9riques (pour les ann\u00e9es 2006 et 2007) .Il y  a plusieurs facteurs \u00e0 consid\u00e9rer avant de proc\u00e9der \u00e0 l'analyse et \u00e0 l'interpr\u00e9tation des donn\u00e9es de l'INRP et d'autres renseignements sont disponibles sur le site web de l'INRP.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/emissions/ap/ap_query_e.cfm, http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=En&n=B5C1EAB8-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/emissions/ap/ap_query_f.cfm, http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=B5C1EAB8-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/0EC58C98-7D33-43BD-B7BA-3E9F1BBFB0AB/1985-2010_CAC_Trends_Feb2012_En.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/0EC58C98-7D33-43BD-B7BA-3E9F1BBFB0AB/1985-2010_PCA_emissions_historiques_Fev2012_Fr.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-02-14", "time_period_coverage_start": "1985-01-01", "data_series_name": "National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) Comprehensive Air Pollutant Emissions Data Summaries", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=4A577BB9-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2010-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=En&n=4A577BB9-1", "notes": "National, comprehensive data summaries and trends for air pollutant emissions in Canada are based on data reported by facilities on a mandatory basis to Environment Canada as part of the National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) and estimates that were compiled by Environment Canada for other sources such as motor vehicles, residential heating, forest fires and agricultural activities.  National data summaries and trends on emissions of criteria air contaminants, the main pollutants contributing to smog, acid rain and poor air quality (nitrogen oxides, sulphur oxides, volatile organic compounds, ammonia, carbon monoxide, and particulate matter), is posted for the years 1985 - 2010.  The data are available in a number of formats:  online query tools, downloadable spreadsheets as well as images of air pollutant emission density (for the years 2006 and 2007).   There are a number of important factors that should be considered prior to the use and interpretation of NPRI data and additional information is available on the NPRI web site.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "pollution de l'air,qualit\u00e9 de l'air,pluies acides,smog,ozone,particules,\u00e9missions,polluants,compos\u00e9s organiques volatils,oxydes d'azote,dioxyde de soufre,ammoniac,monoxyde de carbone,\u00e9missions des v\u00e9hicules,sources diffuses,sources \u00e0 ciel ouvert,tendances des \u00e9missions,contaminants atmosph\u00e9riques,toxique"}
