{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Base de donn\u00e9es des op\u00e9rations des Forces canadiennes", "keywords": "Canadian Forces Operations Domestic International Overseas", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "c3893f29-43c7-4f34-ac7e-3ee8aefc2af1", "subject": "Military  Histoire et science militaire", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Canadian Forces Operations Database", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": " La pr\u00e9sente base de donn\u00e9es vise \u00e0 consigner toutes les op\u00e9rations des Forces canadiennes depuis 1945.  Jusqu'\u00e0 maintenant, nous avons d\u00e9nombr\u00e9 plus de 400 op\u00e9rations internationales, mais la recherche historique requise pour chacune n'est pas encore termin\u00e9e.  Les renseignements fournis ici sont exacts au moment de leur publication; les entr\u00e9es seront mises \u00e0 jour au besoin.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "XML", "url": "http://www.cmp-cpm.forces.gc.ca/dhh-dhp/data/CF_Operations_20120320.xml", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-03-20", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "www.cmp-cpm.forces.gc.ca/dhh-dhp/index-fra.asp", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "2012-03-20", "url": "www.cmp-cpm.forces.gc.ca/dhh-dhp/index-eng.asp", "notes": "\n        The aim of this database is to record all Canadian Forces operations since 1945.  Over 400 international operations have been identified so far, but the historical research required for each has not yet been completed.  Substantive entries have been prepared for on-going operations; new operations will be added to the list as required.\n\n      ", "owner_org": "dnd-mdn", "keywords_fra": "op\u00e9rations forces canadiennes outre-mer internationale nationale"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "L'inventaire national des monuments comm\u00e9moratifs militaires canadiens", "keywords": "National Inventory Canadian Military cenotaphs plaques landmarks Memorials heritage", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "8c9de07b-9ae0-41df-9895-6bb6d2f804ed", "subject": "Military  Histoire et science militaire", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "National Inventory of Canadian Military Memorials", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "\n        Les Canadiens et les Canadiennes ont depuis longtemps servi leur pays en participant \u00e0 plusieurs guerres et conflits. Au fil des ann\u00e9es, des citoyens, des organisations d'anciens combattants et des clubs philanthropiques ont \u00e9rig\u00e9 des milliers de m\u00e9moriaux d'un bout \u00e0 l'autre du pays pour rendre hommage aux soldats, aux marins et aux aviateurs, ainsi qu'aux femmes, qui ont fait d'\u00e9normes sacrifices pour r\u00e9tablir la paix dans le monde et ont ainsi fait honneur \u00e0 leur pays.\n\n        Fid\u00e8les \u00e0 leur fier h\u00e9ritage, les Canadiens et les Canadiennes ont \u00e9rig\u00e9 des c\u00e9notaphes dans les centres municipaux, ainsi que des monuments dans les parcs, dans les cimeti\u00e8res et dans d'autres lieux publics. Des paroissiens ont mont\u00e9 des plaques comm\u00e9moratives et des vitraux dans leurs \u00e9glises et on a construit des tumulus et fontaines pour rappeler une vari\u00e9t\u00e9 d'\u00e9v\u00e9nements militaires importants. Tout cela dans le but de souligner le service de parents, d'ami(e)s et de camarades et d'assurer que ces batailles et ces \u00e9v\u00e9nements importants, souvent mal connus, restent grav\u00e9s dans notre m\u00e9moire collective.\n      ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "XML", "url": "http://www.cmp-cpm.forces.gc.ca/dhh-dhp/data/National_Inventory_of_Canadian_Military_Memorials_20120320.xml", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-03-20", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "www.cmp-cpm.forces.gc.ca/dhh-dhp/index-fra.asp", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "2012-03-20", "url": "www.cmp-cpm.forces.gc.ca/dhh-dhp/index-eng.asp", "notes": "\n        Canadians have long served their country by participating in numerous wars and conflicts. Over the years, individual citizens, veterans organizations and service clubs have raised thousands of memorials across the country to honour those sailors, soldiers, airmen and women who made great sacrifices towards the restoration of world peace and served their country so well.\n\n        In keeping with our proud military heritage, Canadians erected cenotaphs in municipal centres, raised monuments in parks, cemeteries and public areas. Church members have mounted plaques and stained glass windows as memorials, and cairns and fountains have been constructed as important landmarks marking various military involvement. All of this is done to mark the service of family, friends and comrades, and to ensure that these important and not so well known battles and events form part of our communal memory.\n      ", "owner_org": "dnd-mdn", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "T1 Statistiques finales", "keywords": "The T1 Final Statistics", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "e9f79912-8fb5-4e71-8503-b41c8ce1b4fe", "subject": "Economics and Industry  \u00c9conomie et industrie", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "T1 Final Statistics", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Les Statistiques finales pr\u00e9sentent des donn\u00e9es de d\u00e9clarations de revenu des particuliers qui ont \u00e9t\u00e9 trait\u00e9es pour l'ann\u00e9e d'imposition deux ann\u00e9es avant l'ann\u00e9e de publication. Par exemple, l'\u00e9dition de 2011 des tableaux analyse les d\u00e9clarations de l'ann\u00e9e d'imposition 2009, qui, en r\u00e8gle g\u00e9n\u00e9rale, devaient \u00eatre produites au plus tard \u00e0 la fin d'avril 2010. L'\u00e9dition de 2011 des statistiques finales est fond\u00e9e sur 100 % de toutes les d\u00e9clarations jusqu'\u00e0 la date limite du 30 juin 2011. Ces donn\u00e9es contiennent les cotisations ou les nouvelles cotisations les plus r\u00e9centes de l'ann\u00e9e d'imposition 2009 jusqu'\u00e0 la date limite.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.cra-arc.gc.ca/gncy/stts/gb09/pst/fnl/csv/t01ca.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2011-11-15", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "\n        The T1 Final Statistics presents data from personal income returns that were processed for the tax year two years prior to year of publication. For example, the 2011 edition of the tables analyze returns from the 2009 tax year, which generally had to be filed by the end of April 2010. The 2011 edition of final statistics are based on 100% of all returns up to the cut-off date of June 30, 2011. These data contain the most recent 2009 tax year assessment or reassessment up to the cut-off date\n      ", "owner_org": "cra-arc", "keywords_fra": "T1 Statistiques finales"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Remboursements f\u00e9d\u00e9raux additionnels de la TPS/TVH aux municipalit\u00e9s", "keywords": "GST,HST,rebate,municipalities", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "3978b46c-09a9-41cd-a6fe-8e3373629b1a", "subject": "Economics and Industry  \u00c9conomie et industrie", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "GST/HST Incremental Federal Rebate for Municipalities Report", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Rapport sur les remboursements f\u00e9d\u00e9raux additionnels de la taxe sur les produits et services (TPS) et de la taxe de vente harmonis\u00e9e (TVH) aux municipalit\u00e9s ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.cra-arc.gc.ca/gncy/gsthstrbmn/2011/mncp2011.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-03-12", "time_period_coverage_start": "2011-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2011-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "Goods and Services Tax (GST) and Harmonized Sales Tax (HST) Incremental Federal Rebate for Municipalities Report ", "owner_org": "cra-arc", "keywords_fra": "TPS,TVH,remboursement,municipalit\u00e9s"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "T2 Statistiques sur le revenu des soci\u00e9t\u00e9s", "keywords": "corporation income tax returns", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "d369e0df-1538-4e81-aa4c-1e95d8594ca3", "subject": "Economics and Industry  \u00c9conomie et industrie", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "T2 Corporate Statistics", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Cette publication intitul\u00e9e Statistiques de l'imp\u00f4t sur le revenu des soci\u00e9t\u00e9s est publi\u00e9e par l'Agence du revenu du Canada. Celle-ci pr\u00e9sente les renseignements sur l'imp\u00f4t et la comptabilit\u00e9 pour toutes les d\u00e9clarations de revenus T2 des soci\u00e9t\u00e9s qui ont fait l'objet d'une cotisation ou d'une nouvelle cotisation.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.cra-arc.gc.ca/gncy/stts/gb06/pst/t2/csv/tbl1.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2011-07-14", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "", "notes": "\n        This is the Canada Revenue Agency's publication of Corporation Income Tax Statistics. This publication provides key taxation and select accounting information for all corporation income tax returns that have been assessed or re-assessed.\n\n      ", "owner_org": "cra-arc", "keywords_fra": "d\u00e9claration de revenus des soci\u00e9t\u00e9s"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Tendances sur les \u00e9missions canadiennes de polluants atmosph\u00e9riques, 1990-2010 (m\u00e9taux lourds et polluants organiques persistants)", "keywords": "air pollution,emissions,pollutants,lead,cadmium,mercury,heavy metals,persistent organic pollutants,dioxins,furans,hexachlorobenzene,polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbons,PAHs,area sources,diffuse sources,emission trends,toxic", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "8c06ca90-1f0e-4bf4-9849-610ea38aed67", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Sommaires complets  sur les \u00e9missions de polluants atmoph\u00e9rique de l'Inventaire national des rejets de polluants (INRP)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "Canada's National Air Pollutant Emission Trends, 1990-2010 (heavy metals and persistent organic pollutants)", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Des sommaires et ces tendances nationaux complets sur les \u00e9missions de polluants atmosph\u00e9riques au canada sont bas\u00e9s sur des renseignements d\u00e9clar\u00e9s de fa\u00e7on obligatoire \u00e0 Environnement Canada  par les installations dans le cadre de  l'Inventaire national des rejets de polluants (INRP), ainsi que sur les estimations d'\u00e9missions compil\u00e9s par environnement Canada pour d'autres sources telles que les v\u00e9hicules \u00e0 moteur, le chauffage r\u00e9sidentiel, les activit\u00e9s agricoles et les incendies de for\u00eat. Les sommaires et tendances nationaux sur les \u00e9missions de m\u00e9taux lourds et de polluants organiques persistants (plomb, cadmium, mercure, hydrocarbones aromatiques polycycliques, hexachlorobenz\u00e8ne, dioxines et furannes), sont publi\u00e9s pour les ann\u00e9es 1990-2010. Ces donn\u00e9es sont disponibles dans un tableurs Excel t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables et un outil de recherche en ligne. Il y  a plusieurs facteurs \u00e0 consid\u00e9rer avant de proc\u00e9der \u00e0 l'analyse et \u00e0 l'interpr\u00e9tation des donn\u00e9es de l'INRP et d'autres renseignements sont disponibles sur le site web de l'INRP.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/querysite/query_e.cfm, http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=En&n=B5C1EAB8-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/querysite/query_f.cfm, http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=B5C1EAB8-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/0EC58C98-7D33-43BD-B7BA-3E9F1BBFB0AB/1990-2010_HeavyMetals_POPs_Trends_Feb2012_En.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/0EC58C98-7D33-43BD-B7BA-3E9F1BBFB0AB/1990-2010_MetauxLourds_POPs_tendance_historique_Fev2012_Fr.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-02-14", "time_period_coverage_start": "1990-01-01", "data_series_name": "National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) Comprehensive Air Pollutant Emissions Data Summaries", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=4A577BB9-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2010-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=En&n=4A577BB9-1", "notes": "National, comprehensive data summaries and trends for air pollutant emissions in Canada are based on data reported by facilities on a mandatory basis to Environment Canada as part of the National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) and estimates that were compiled by Environment Canada for other sources such as motor vehicles, residential heating, forest fires and agricultural activities.  National data summaries and trends on emissions of heavy metals and persistent organic pollutants (lead, cadmium, mercury, polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbons, hexachlorobenzene, dioxins and furans), is posted for the years 1990 - 2010.  The data are available as downloadable spreadsheets and an online query tool on the NPRI web site.   There are a number of important factors that should be considered prior to the use and interpretation of NPRI data and additional information is available on the NPRI web site.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "pollution de l'air,\u00e9missions,polluants,plomb,cadmium,mercure,m\u00e9taux lourds,polluants organiques persistants,dioxines,furanes,hexachlorobenz\u00e8ne,hydrocarbures aromatiques polycycliques,HAP,sources \u00e0 ciel ouvert,les sources diffuses,tendances des \u00e9missions,toxiques"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateurs de la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau - Indicateur national de la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau douce de 2007 \u00e0 2009, au Canada", "keywords": "environmental indicators,water,national,Canadian Rivers,water quality,freshwater quality,water pollution,aquatic life,drainage region,monitoring stations", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "bebe4a02-bd88-4e19-b9bb-a0917de52245", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Water Quality Indicators - National freshwater quality indicator for 2007 to 2009, Canada", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. L'indicateur de la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau douce permet d'obtenir, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des stations de suivi choisies au Canada, une mesure globale de la capacit\u00e9 des plans d'eau douce de soutenir la vie aquatique. Cet outil, ax\u00e9 sur des recommandations pour la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau, est utilis\u00e9 pour synth\u00e9tiser de grandes quantit\u00e9s de donn\u00e9es sur la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau \u00e0 une station de suivi en un seul indice. La qualit\u00e9 de l'eau dans une station de suivi est consid\u00e9r\u00e9e comme excellente lorsque la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau ambiante ne d\u00e9passe en aucun temps les recommandations, et ce, pour tous les param\u00e8tres choisis. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en&n=68DE8F72-1#wq1, http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=5D193531-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=fr&n=68DE8F72-1#wq1, http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=fr&n=5D193531-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/1462CE5B-181F-4F9B-BE98-0C06715F5013/wq_chart1_nat_en.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/1462CE5B-181F-4F9B-BE98-0C06715F5013/wq_chart1_nat_fr.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-04-05", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-1", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Freshwater Quality Indicator provides an overall measure of the ability of freshwater bodies to support aquatic life at selected monitoring stations across Canada. It is a water quality guideline-driven tool used to distill large amounts of water quality data at a monitoring station into a single index. Water quality at a monitoring station is considered excellent when ambient water quality does not exceed guidelines at any time for any of all selected parameters. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,eau,\u00e0 l'\u00e9chelle nationale,rivi\u00e8res canadiennes,qualit\u00e9 de l'eau,l'eau douce,pollution de l'eau,\u00a0vie aquatique,r\u00e9gion de drainage,stations de suivi"}
