{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateurs des \u00e9missions de polluants atmosph\u00e9riques - \u00c9missions de polluants atmosph\u00e9riques, Canada, 1990 \u00e0\u00a02010 ", "keywords": "environmental indicators,air and climate,air pollution,national,emissions,air pollutants,volatile organic compounds,nitrogen oxides,sulphur oxides,fine particulate matter,particulate matter,respirable particulate matter,ammonia,total particulate matter,carbon monoxide,sources,province,territory", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "b4366c66-0251-4037-8c97-45ec1d7ae35e", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Air Pollutant Emissions Indicators - Air pollutant emissions, Canada, 1990 to 2010 ", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. Les indicateurs des \u00e9missions de polluants atmosph\u00e9riques effectuent le suivi des \u00e9missions des principaux polluants atmosph\u00e9riques qui contribuent au smog et \u00e0 la pluie acide au Canada. Ces indicateurs renseignent les Canadiens sur les niveaux de polluants atmosph\u00e9riques qui sont \u00e9mis au Canada, des polluants qui peuvent avoir une incidence sur la qualit\u00e9 de l'air que nous respirons. Ils aident \u00e9galement le gouvernement \u00e0 d\u00e9terminer les priorit\u00e9s, \u00e0 effectuer un suivi des progr\u00e8s ainsi qu'\u00e0 \u00e9laborer des strat\u00e9gies et des politiques pour r\u00e9duire ou contr\u00f4ler la pollution atmosph\u00e9rique. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en&n=E79F4C12-1#nat, http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en&n=9BCF9DCB-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=fr&n=E79F4C12-1#nat, http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=fr&n=9BCF9DCB-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "Indicateurs des \u00e9missions de polluants atmosph\u00e9riques - \u00c9missions de polluants atmosph\u00e9riques, Canada, 1990 \u00e0\u00a02010\thttp://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/58DE4720-D026-439A-8ECC-6129CD12B83D/ae_chart1_national_en.csv ", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "1.90 KB\tCSV\thttp://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/58DE4720-D026-439A-8ECC-6129CD12B83D/ae_chart1_national_fr.csv ", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) ", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-1", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Air Pollutant Emissions indicators track the emissions of key air pollutants contributing to smog and acid rain in Canada. These indicators inform Canadians on the levels of air pollutants that are emitted in Canada; these pollutants can affect the air that we breathe. The air pollutant emissions indicators also help the government to identify priorities, track progress, and develop strategies and policies for reducing or controlling air pollution. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,air et climat,pollution de l'air,\u00e0 l'\u00e9chelle nationale,\u00e9missions,atmosph\u00e9riques polluantes,compos\u00e9s organiques volatils,oxydes d'azote,oxydes de soufre,ammoniac,particules fines,particules inhalables,totales de particules,monoxdye de carbone,source,province,territoire"}
