ation is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,eau,disponibilit\u00e9 de l'eau,quantit\u00e9 d'eau,consommation d'eau,compteurs d'eau,conservation de l'eau,tarification influe"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateurs des \u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre - \u00c9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre par province et territoire, Canada, 1990, 2009 et 2010", "keywords": "environmental indicators,air and climate,greenhouse gas emissions,climate,greenhouse gases,carbon dioxide,carbon dioxide equivalent,National Inventory Report,NIR,province,territory", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "a3a32817-bd4a-474b-8255-702bd043257d", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Greenhouse Gas Emissions Indicators - Greenhouse gas emissions by province and territory, Canada, 1990, 2009 and 2010", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. Les indicateurs d'\u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre (GES) font \u00e9tat des tendances des \u00e9missions anthropiques (d'origine humaine) de GES \u00e0 l'\u00e9chelle nationale (total des \u00e9missions, \u00e9missions par habitant et \u00e9missions par unit\u00e9 de PIB), ainsi qu'au niveau provincial/territorial et du secteur \u00e9conomique pour les six principaux GES au Canada, soit le dioxyde de carbone, le m\u00e9thane, l'oxyde nitreux, l'hexafluorure de soufre, les perfluorocarbures et les hydrofluorocarbures. Les indicateurs des \u00e9missions de GES sont utilis\u00e9s pour suivre les progr\u00e8s quant aux efforts d\u00e9ploy\u00e9s par le Canada en vue de r\u00e9duire les \u00e9missions et d'atteindre les objectifs en mati\u00e8re de rendement environnemental. L'utilisation des indicateurs de GES parall\u00e8lement \u00e0 celle des indicateurs de rendement \u00e9conomique, tels que le produit int\u00e9rieur brut (PIB), contribuera \u00e0 appuyer la prise de d\u00e9cision \u00e0 l'\u00e9chelle nationale en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en&n=18F3BB9C-1#ghg4, http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en&n=391052E4-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=fr&n=18F3BB9C-1#ghg4, http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=fr&n=391052E4-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/BFB1B398-A668-4C17-B0AF-5316799177CD/ghg_provincial_en.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/BFB1B398-A668-4C17-B0AF-5316799177CD/ghg_provincial_fr.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-04-11", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-1", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Greenhouse Gas Emissions indicators report trends in anthropogenic (human-made) greenhouse gas emissions at the national level (total emissions, emissions per person and emissions per unit of gross domestic product), and at the provincial/territorial and economic sector level for the six main GHGs in Canada: carbon dioxide, methane, nitrous oxide, sulphur hexafluoride, perfluorocarbons and hydrofluorocarbons. The indicators are used to track the progress of Canada's efforts to lower emissions and reach environmental performance objectives. Use of the GHG indicators in conjunction with economic performance indicators such as the gross domestic product (GDP) will help to support national-level decision making on sustainable development. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,air et climat,\u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre,climat,gaz \u00e0 effet de serre,dioxyde de carbone,en \u00e9quivalent de dioxyde de carbone,Rapport d'inventaire national,RIN,province,territoire"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateurs des \u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre - R\u00e9partition des \u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre par secteur \u00e9conomique, Canada, 2010", "keywords": "environmental indicators,air and climate,greenhouse gas emissions,climate,greenhouse gases,carbon dioxide,carbon dioxide equivalent,National Inventory Report,NIR,economic sector", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "fe256088-5f03-48aa-b20b-3b01917685c0", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Greenhouse Gas Emissions Indicators - Distribution of greenhouse gas emissions by economic sector, Canada, 2010", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. Les indicateurs d'\u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre (GES) font \u00e9tat des tendances des \u00e9missions anthropiques (d'origine humaine) de GES \u00e0 l'\u00e9chelle nationale (total des \u00e9missions, \u00e9missions par habitant et \u00e9missions par unit\u00e9 de PIB), ainsi qu'au niveau provincial/territorial et du secteur \u00e9conomique pour les six principaux GES au Canada, soit le dioxyde de carbone, le m\u00e9thane, l'oxyde nitreux, l'hexafluorure de soufre, les perfluorocarbures et les hydrofluorocarbures. Les indicateurs des \u00e9missions de GES sont utilis\u00e9s pour suivre les progr\u00e8s quant aux efforts d\u00e9ploy\u00e9s par le Canada en vue de r\u00e9duire les \u00e9missions et d'atteindre les objectifs en mati\u00e8re de rendement environnemental. L'utilisation des indicateurs de GES parall\u00e8lement \u00e0 celle des indicateurs de rendement \u00e9conomique, tels que le produit int\u00e9rieur brut (PIB), contribuera \u00e0 appuyer la prise de d\u00e9cision \u00e0 l'\u00e9chelle nationale en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9. ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en&n=F60DB708-1#ghg3, http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en&n=391052E4-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=fr&n=F60DB708-1#ghg3, http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=fr&n=391052E4-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/BFB1B398-A668-4C17-B0AF-5316799177CD/ghg_sector_en.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/BFB1B398-A668-4C17-B0AF-5316799177CD/ghg_sector_fr.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-04-11", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-1", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Greenhouse Gas Emissions indicators report trends in anthropogenic (human-made) greenhouse gas emissions at the national level (total emissions, emissions per person and emissions per unit of gross domestic product), and at the provincial/territorial and economic sector level for the six main GHGs in Canada: carbon dioxide, methane, nitrous oxide, sulphur hexafluoride, perfluorocarbons and hydrofluorocarbons. The indicators are used to track the progress of Canada's efforts to lower emissions and reach environmental performance objectives. Use of the GHG indicators in conjunction with economic performance indicators such as the gross domestic product (GDP) will help to support national-level decision making on sustainable development. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,air et climat,\u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre,climat,gaz \u00e0 effet de serre,dioxyde de carbone,en \u00e9quivalent de dioxyde de carbone,Rapport d'inventaire national,RIN,secteur \u00e9conomique"}
