{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Vagues - T\u00e9l\u00e9chargement des donn\u00e9es", "keywords": "waves,GOES,ARGOS,wave spectra", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "e1091800-6f21-45e4-8bff-fb12bbc42ae2", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Weekly | Hebdomadaire", "title": "Waves - Download Data", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "\"Le Gestion des donn\u00e9es scientifiques int\u00e9gr\u00e9es (GDSI) acquiert, traite, contr\u00f4le la qualit\u00e9 et distribue des donn\u00e9es sur les vagues de surface. Des donn\u00e9es spectrales sur les vagues sont diffus\u00e9es sur les r\u00e9seaux GOES et ARGOS et sont trait\u00e9es chaque jour.\n*** La totalit\u00e9 des 6 millions de spectres de vagues que nous avons observ\u00e9s ainsi que certains produits sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9s sont maintenant disponibles en ligne. S'il vous pla\u00eet noter que les donn\u00e9es sont mises \u00e0 jour sur une base hebdomadaire seulement.  \n\n\"\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/waves-vagues/overview-apercu-eng.htm", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/waves-vagues/overview-apercu-fra.htm", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/waves-vagues/search-recherche/index-fra.asp", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "", "time_period_coverage_start": "1970-04-27", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/waves-vagues/index-fra.htm", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2010-09-29", "language": "", "date_modified": "2010-04-30", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/waves-vagues/index-eng.htm", "notes": "\"Integrated Science Data Management (ISDM) has been collecting, archiving and providing spectral wave data on behalf of Canadians since 1970. On a daily basis we process data reported on the GOES and ARGOS networks within the Canadian area of interest. Please see the overview page for more programme detail.\n\n*** All of our observed wave spectra and some specialized products are now available on-line. Please note that the data are only updated on a weekly basis. \n\"\n", "owner_org": "dfo-mpo", "keywords_fra": "vagues,GOES,ARGOS,spectres de vagues"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Archives canadiennes des donn\u00e9es sur les mar\u00e9es et niveaux d'eau", "keywords": "tide,water level data,archive,CHS", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "fd5cc793-d00c-47b0-93e1-7c9974b4883f", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Daily | Quotidien", "title": "Canadian Tides and Water Levels Data Archive", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le Centre national des donn\u00e9es du Canada contient plus de 500 millions de saisies dans ses archives des donn\u00e9es historiques sur les mar\u00e9es et niveaux d'eau; les plus anciennes datent de la p\u00e9riode pr\u00e9c\u00e9dant l'av\u00e8nement du si\u00e8cle. Plus de deux millions d'observations recueillies au moyen du r\u00e9seau permanent d'observations du SHC sont rajout\u00e9es quotidiennement et mensuellement. Les donn\u00e9es sont \u00e9galement \u00e9chang\u00e9es sur une base annuelle avec Environnement Canada.\n\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/twl-mne/index-fra.htm", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/twl-mne/index-fra.htm", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/twl-mne/index-eng.htm", "notes": "As Canada's national data center, the historical tide and water level data archive presently holds over 500 million records with the earliest dating back before the turn of the century. Over 2 million new observations, reported from the CHS permanent gauging network, are added on a daily and monthly basis. Data are also exchanged annually with Environment Canada.\n\n", "owner_org": "dfo-mpo", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Argo: Rapport sur la gestion des donn\u00e9es des profileurs canadiens suivis", "keywords": "Argo,profiling float,float,temperature,salinity,oceans", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "caf8efad-1174-42f6-baa9-c4b753275ce5", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Rapport statistique sur la performance des profileurs d\u00e9rivants", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Monthly | Mensuel", "title": "Argo: Canadian Tracked Float Data Management Report", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Environ 3000 profileurs d\u00e9rivants sont d\u00e9ploy\u00e9s \u00e0 l'\u00e9chelle du globe. Une fois en mer, le profileur descend \u00e0 une profondeur cible pr\u00e9d\u00e9termin\u00e9e de 2000 m\u00e8tres pour une p\u00e9riode pr\u00e9d\u00e9termin\u00e9e. Ensuite le profileur refait surface, enregistrant, durant son ascension, les valeurs de temp\u00e9rature et de salinit\u00e9 \u00e0 des niveaux pr\u00e9-\u00e9tablis . Une fois \u00e0 la surface, le profileur d\u00e9rive durant un ou deux jours et transmet les donn\u00e9es recueillies \u00e0 un satellite g\u00e9r\u00e9.-- Le rapport fournit des informations sur la performance des profileurs d\u00e9rivants et graphiques des dur\u00e9e de vie, de volume et type de donn\u00e9es et de la distribution GTS en 24 h des profileurs d\u00e9rivants\n\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/alphapro/argo/perf_report.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "", "time_period_coverage_start": "1995-01-01", "data_series_name": "Statistics report on Float performance", "url_fra": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/argo/index-fra.html", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2010-01-01", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/argo/index-eng.html", "notes": "Approximately 3000 profiling floats are deployed around the world. Once at sea, the float sinks to a preprogrammed target depth of 2000 meters for a preprogrammed period of time. It then floats to the surface, taking temperature and salinity values during its ascent at set depths. At the surface, the float drifts along for a day or two and transmits the data to a satellite which then determines the position of the float. -- The report gives Float performance, graphs of float lifetimes, data volume and types and 24-hr GTS distribution.\n\n", "owner_org": "dfo-mpo", "keywords_fra": "Argro,profileur d\u00e9rivant,profileur,temp\u00e9rature,salinit\u00e9,oc\u00e9ans"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Vagues: Trac\u00e9s archiv\u00e9s", "keywords": "waves,GOES,ARGOS,wave spectra,Atlantic", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "86a0937a-a1c5-48ee-82f0-5444984c440c", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Trac\u00e9s chronologiques mensuels des donn\u00e9es individulles des stations", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Weekly | Hebdomadaire", "title": "Waves: Archive Plots", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "Nova Scotia  Nouvelle-\u00c9cosse", "notes_fra": "\"Le Gestion des donn\u00e9es scientifiques int\u00e9gr\u00e9es (GDSI) acquiert, traite, contr\u00f4le la qualit\u00e9 et distribue des donn\u00e9es sur les vagues de surface. Des donn\u00e9es spectrales sur les vagues sont diffus\u00e9es sur les r\u00e9seaux GOES et ARGOS et sont trait\u00e9es chaque jour.\n*** La totalit\u00e9 des 6 millions de spectres de vagues que nous avons observ\u00e9s ainsi que certains produits sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9s sont maintenant disponibles en ligne. S'il vous pla\u00eet noter que les donn\u00e9es sont mises \u00e0 jour sur une base hebdomadaire seulement. - Trac\u00e9s chronologiques mensuels contenant les donn\u00e9es de diff\u00e9rentes stations.\n\n\"\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/waves-vagues/search-recherche/list-liste/data-donnees-eng.asp?medsid=C44137&s1=6/9/2003&s2=9/29/2010", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/waves-vagues/search-recherche/list-liste/data-donnees-fra.asp?medsid=C44137&s1=6/9/2003&s2=9/29/2010", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/waves-vagues/plot-trace/index-fra.asp", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "One month timeseries plots of individual station data.", "url_fra": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/waves-vagues/index-fra.htm", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "2010-09-29", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/waves-vagues/index-eng.htm", "notes": "\"Integrated Science Data Management (ISDM) has been collecting, archiving and providing spectral wave data on behalf of Canadians since 1970. On a daily basis we process data reported on the GOES and ARGOS networks within the Canadian area of interest. Please see the overview page for more programme detail.\n\n*** All of our observed wave spectra and some specialized products are now available on-line. Please note that the data are only updated on a weekly basis.  - One month timeseries plots of individual station data.\n\n\"\n", "owner_org": "dfo-mpo", "keywords_fra": "vagues,GOES,ARGOS,spectres de vagues,Atlantique"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Syst\u00e8me de gestion des donn\u00e9es oc\u00e9anographiques (SGDO)", "keywords": "Oceans,St. Lawrence,physics,chemistry,pressure,conductivity,salinity,biology,density,dissolved oxygen,dumping,depth,turbidity,fluorescence,variable,temperatue,current,speed,thermal imaging,chlorophyll,nutrient salts", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "f3a07c8d-59d0-4b12-8043-62b36223b49f", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Daily | Quotidien", "title": "Oceanographic Data Management System (ODMS)", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "Quebec  Qu\u00e9bec", "notes_fra": "Le SGDO est essentiellement une application informatique qui permet aux utilisateurs d'obtenir des donn\u00e9es oc\u00e9anographiques recueillies par les scientifiques du minist\u00e8re des P\u00eaches et des Oc\u00e9ans Canada dans les eaux du Saint-Laurent.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://ogsl.ca/app-sgdo/fr/demarrage.html", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://ogsl.ca/app-sgdo/en/demarrage.html", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-30", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "http://ogsl.ca/app-sgdo/fr/accueil.html", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://ogsl.ca/app-sgdo/en/accueil.html", "notes": "The ODMS is a computer application that allows users to obtain oceanographic data collected by Department of Fisheries and Oceans scientists from waters of the St. Lawrence system.\n", "owner_org": "dfo-mpo", "keywords_fra": "Oc\u00e9ans,Saint-Laurent,physique,chimie,pression,conductivit\u00e9,salinit\u00e9,biologie,densit\u00e9,oxyg\u00e8ne dissous,immersion,profondeur,turbidit\u00e9,fluorescence,variable,temp\u00e9ratue,courant,vitesse,thermographie,chlorophylle,sels nutritifs"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Donn\u00e9es des phares de la Colombie-Britannique; phare de Bonilla Island", "keywords": "surface temperature,salinity,lighthouses,sampling locations,surface water,Bonilla Island", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "87935228-db4a-4f0f-80de-55f29bc5783a", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Daily | Quotidien", "title": "Data from BC Lighthouses; Bonilla Island lighthouse", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "British Columbia Vancouver Island and Coast  Colombie-Britannique \u00cele de Vancouver et la c\u00f4te", "notes_fra": "Des valeurs quotidiennes de la temp\u00e9rature et de la salinit\u00e9 de la surface de la mer sont enregistr\u00e9es au phare de Bonilla Island le long de la c\u00f4te de la Colombie-Britannique. Une carte est disponible affichant l'emplacement des stations d'\u00e9chantillonnage, et une liste suivante permet d'acc\u00e9der les donn\u00e9es archiv\u00e9es des moyennes mensuelles de la temp\u00e9rature et de la salinit\u00e9 ainsi que des photographies de cet emplacement.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.pac.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/science/oceans/data-donnees/lighthouses-phares/index-eng.htm", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.pac.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/science/oceans/data-donnees/lighthouses-phares/index-fra.htm", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.pac.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/science/oceans/data-donnees/lighthouses-phares/index-eng.htm", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "", "time_period_coverage_start": "1960-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "http://www.pac.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/science/oceans/data-donnees/lighthouses-phares/index-fra.htm", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "2010-04-30", "url": "http://www.pac.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/science/oceans/data-donnees/lighthouses-phares/index-eng.htm", "notes": "Daily values of sea surface temperature and salinity are observed at the Bonilla Island lighthouse around the coast of British Columbia. A map is available that shows the location of all of the sampling locations, and the following list allows access to the archived values of monthly mean temperatures and salinities and photographs of the site. \n", "owner_org": "dfo-mpo", "keywords_fra": "temp\u00e9rature,salinit\u00e9,eau de surface,oc\u00e9ans,phares,stations d'\u00e9chantillonnage,Bonilla Island"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Observatoire global du Saint-Laurent (OGSL)", "keywords": "\"St. Lawrence,river,gulf,Biodiversity,Sentinel Fisheries,Marine Species,Toxic Phytoplankton,American Lobster,Ecosystem Modelling,Climate,Observation Network,Scientific Buoys,Remote Sensing,Ocean Forecasts,St. Lawrence Monitored,Mingan Atlas of Currents,St. Lawrence Tides,Freshwater Runoffs,Carbon Cycle,Thermograph Network,Georeferenced Images,Sampling Protocols,Information Systems\"", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "7b39138e-c34c-47ad-8da6-efa46ab5be96", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Daily | Quotidien", "title": "St.Lawrence Global Observatory (SLGO)", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "Quebec  Qu\u00e9bec", "notes_fra": "\"L'Observatoire global du Saint-Laurent est une initiative visant \u00e0 offrir un acc\u00e8s int\u00e9gr\u00e9 aux donn\u00e9es et aux informations issues d'un r\u00e9seau d'organismes gouvernementaux, universitaires et communautaires pour une gestion durable de l'\u00e9cosyst\u00e8me global du Saint-Laurent par:\nla mise en place et la gestion d'un portail Internet d'acc\u00e8s et de diffusion d'information la plus juste et la plus compl\u00e8te possible (scientifique et autre); \nl'utilisation des technologies de l'information les plus r\u00e9centes et de normes reconnues dans une architecture visant l'interop\u00e9rabilit\u00e9; \nla fourniture de produits et de services d'information de qualit\u00e9 r\u00e9pondant aux besoins des diverses client\u00e8les. \n\"\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://ogsl.ca/fr/accueil.html", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2007-01-01", "time_period_coverage_start": "2007-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "http://ogsl.ca/fr.html", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2007-01-01", "language": "", "date_modified": "2010-09-30", "url": "http://ogsl.ca/en.html", "notes": "\"The St. Lawrence Global Observatory is an initiative to provide integrated access to data and information from a network of governmental, academic and community organizations for the sustainable management of the St. Lawrence global ecosystem by:\nimplementing and managing an Internet portal for the access and dissemination of the most accurate and comprehensive information possible (scientific and other); \nusing state-of-the-art information technologies and recognized standards in an architecture based on interoperability; \nproviding quality information products and services suiting the needs of various client groups. \n\"\n", "owner_org": "dfo-mpo", "keywords_fra": "Saint-Laurent,fleuve,golfe,estuaire,Biodiversit\u00e9,P\u00eaches sentinelles,Esp\u00e8ces marines,Phytoplancton toxique,Homard d'Am\u00e9rique,Mod\u00e9lisation des \u00e9cosyst\u00e8mes,Climat,R\u00e9seau d'observation,Bou\u00e9es scientifiques,T\u00e9l\u00e9d\u00e9tection,Pr\u00e9visions oc\u00e9aniques,Saint-Laurent monitor\u00e9,Atlas des courants de Mingan,Mar\u00e9es du Saint-Laurent,D\u00e9bits d'eau douce,Cycle du carbone,R\u00e9seau de thermographes,Images g\u00e9or\u00e9f\u00e9renc\u00e9es,Protocoles d'\u00e9chantillonnage,Syst\u00e8mes d'information"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateurs des \u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre - \u00c9missions historiques de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre du Canada et pr\u00e9visions jusqu'en 2020", "keywords": "environmental indicators,air and climate,greenhouse gas emissions,climate,greenhouse gases,carbon dioxide,carbon dioxide equivalent,GHG,emissions trends,projected emissions,projections,target", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "361689f8-396f-48b5-8874-1a1f0cd83fa3", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Greenhouse Gas Emissions Indicators - Canada's historical greenhouse gas emissions and projections to 2020", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. L'indicateur sur les progr\u00e8s vers la cible de r\u00e9duction des \u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre du Canada donne un aper\u00e7u de la pr\u00e9vision des \u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre au Canada jusqu'en 2020. Cet indicateur est fond\u00e9 sur trois sc\u00e9narios de pr\u00e9vision produits par la Direction de l'analyse \u00e9conomique d'Environnement Canada. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=CCED3397-1,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=19A68757-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=CCED3397-1,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=19A68757-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/22835C1B-3642-4550-9732-6602801E99C3/ghg_emissions_trends_en.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/22835C1B-3642-4550-9732-6602801E99C3/ghg_emissions_trends_fr.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-08-08", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-2", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-2", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Progress Toward Canada's Greenhouse Gas Emissions Reduction Target Indicator provides an overview of the projected greenhouse gas emissions in Canada until the year 2020. This indicator is based on three forecast scenarios produced by the Economic Analysis Directorate of Environment Canada. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated. \n", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,air et climat,\u00e9missions de gaz \u00e0 effet de serre,climat,gaz \u00e0 effet de serre,dioxyde de carbone,en \u00e9quivalent de dioxyde de carbone,GES,Tendances en mati\u00e8re d'\u00e9missions,pr\u00e9visions,\u00e9missions projet\u00e9es,cible des \u00e9missions"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateur sur les concentrations de phosphore dans le fleuve Saint-Laurent - Concentrations de phosphore dans le fleuve Saint-Laurent, 2008 \u00e0 2011 (r\u00e9sum\u00e9)", "keywords": "environmental indicators,water,water quality,St. Lawrence River,regional ecosystems,phosphorus,monitoring stations,water quality guidelines,wastewater,agriculture", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "366842fd-8ce0-4696-b365-7838e3a36e41", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Phosphorus Levels in the St. Lawrence River Indicator - Phosphorus levels in the St. Lawrence River for 2008-2011 (summary)", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. L'indicateur de concentrations de phosphore dans le fleuve Saint-Laurent permet de mesurer \u00e0 quelle fr\u00e9quence les concentrations de phosphore exc\u00e8dent les lignes directrices de teneur en phosphore pour la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau du Qu\u00e9bec, et ce, en vue de prot\u00e9ger la vie aquatique dans le fleuve Saint-Laurent. Il compare les donn\u00e9es de surveillance de la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau aux lignes directrices pour la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau afin d'\u00e9valuer le risque propre \u00e0 chaque station de surveillance. Plus les lignes directrices pour la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau sont souvent d\u00e9pass\u00e9es, plus le phosphore pose un risque \u00e0 la sant\u00e9 de l'\u00e9cosyst\u00e8me du fleuve Saint-Laurent. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=F7F5426B-1,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=BA164A1F-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=F7F5426B-1,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=BA164A1F-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/1489D508-3160-4991-B66A-0F26FC5B931F/stlawrence_tp_summary_en.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/1489D508-3160-4991-B66A-0F26FC5B931F/stlawrence_tp_summary_fr.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-07-26", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-1", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Phosphorus Levels in the St. Lawrence River Indicator provides a measure of how frequently phosphorus concentrations exceed Quebec's water quality phosphorus guideline for the protection of aquatic life in the St. Lawrence River. It compares water quality monitoring data to water quality guidelines to create a risk rating for each monitoring station. The more times the water quality guideline is exceeded, the more risk phosphorus poses to the health of the St. Lawrence River ecosystem. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.\n", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,eau,qualit\u00e9 de l'eau,fleuve Saint-Laurent,\u00e9cosyst\u00e8mes r\u00e9gionaux,phosphore,stations de surveillance,lignes directrices pour la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau,agricoles,eaux us\u00e9es"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateurs d'esp\u00e8ces sauvages - \u00c9tat des populations d'oiseaux migrateurs du Canada au sein de chaque principale aire d'hivernage, 1970-2010", "keywords": "environmental indicators,nature,wildlife,bird populations,migratory bird,wintering area,trends,status,bird species", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "0e1fcff6-a5b2-4901-a2fa-a2905381285b", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Wildlife Indicators - Status of Canada's migratory bird populations within each primary wintering area, 1970-2010", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. L'indicateur de tendances des populations d'oiseaux migrateurs du Canada offre des tendances d\u00e9mographiques observ\u00e9es pour la p\u00e9riode de 1970 \u00e0 2010 relatives \u00e0 des groupes d'esp\u00e8ces d'oiseaux indig\u00e8nes passant principalement l'hiver dans l'une des quatre r\u00e9gions ci-apr\u00e8s : le Canada (y compris les esp\u00e8ces d'oiseaux migrateurs et r\u00e9sidents), les \u00c9tats-Unis, le Mexique, l'Am\u00e9rique centrale et les Cara\u00efbes, et l'Am\u00e9rique du Sud. Une tendance d\u00e9mographique globale pour \u00ab l'ensemble des oiseaux \u00bb est \u00e9galement pr\u00e9sent\u00e9e. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=F2BDAA4C-1#table,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=F1279312-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=F2BDAA4C-1#table,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=F1279312-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/F3CFE32F-9EB2-42A1-A22C-288ED6C63DCF/migratory_birds_wintering_en.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/F3CFE32F-9EB2-42A1-A22C-288ED6C63DCF/migratory_birds_wintering_fr.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-07-26", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-2", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-2", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues.  The Trends in Canada's Migratory Bird Populations indicator provides population trends for the period 1970 to 2010 for groups of native bird species that winter primarily in  one of four  areas: Canada (including migratory and resident bird species); United States; Mexico, Central America and the Caribbean; and South America. An overall population trend for \"all birds\" is also provided. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.\n", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,nature,esp\u00e8ces sauvages,populations d'oiseaux,oiseaux migrateurs,aire d'hivernage,tendances,\u00e9tat,esp\u00e8ces d'oiseaux"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateurs d'esp\u00e8ces sauvages - Tendances li\u00e9es aux populations d'oiseaux migrateurs du Canada par principale aire d'hivernage, 1970-2010", "keywords": "environmental indicators,nature,wildlife,bird populations,migratory bird,wintering area,trends,status,bird species", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "2d1d6074-e3eb-4596-b3a8-7ee994ea0d24", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Wildlife Indicators - Trends in Canada's migratory bird populations by primary wintering area, 1970-2010", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. L'indicateur de tendances des populations d'oiseaux migrateurs du Canada offre des tendances d\u00e9mographiques observ\u00e9es pour la p\u00e9riode de 1970 \u00e0 2010 relatives \u00e0 des groupes d'esp\u00e8ces d'oiseaux indig\u00e8nes passant principalement l'hiver dans l'une des quatre r\u00e9gions ci-apr\u00e8s : le Canada (y compris les esp\u00e8ces d'oiseaux migrateurs et r\u00e9sidents), les \u00c9tats-Unis, le Mexique, l'Am\u00e9rique centrale et les Cara\u00efbes, et l'Am\u00e9rique du Sud. Une tendance d\u00e9mographique globale pour \u00ab l'ensemble des oiseaux \u00bb est \u00e9galement pr\u00e9sent\u00e9e. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=F2BDAA4C-1#graph,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=F1279312-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=F2BDAA4C-1#graph,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=F1279312-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/F3CFE32F-9EB2-42A1-A22C-288ED6C63DCF/migratory_birds_trends_en.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/F3CFE32F-9EB2-42A1-A22C-288ED6C63DCF/migratory_birds_trends_fr.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-07-26", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-2", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-2", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues.  The Trends in Canada's Migratory Bird Populations indicator provides population trends for the period 1970 to 2010 for groups of native bird species that winter primarily in  one of four  areas: Canada (including migratory and resident bird species); United States; Mexico, Central America and the Caribbean; and South America. An overall population trend for \"all birds\" is also provided. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.\n", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,nature,esp\u00e8ces sauvages,populations d'oiseaux,oiseaux migrateurs,aire d'hivernage,tendances,\u00e9tat,esp\u00e8ces d'oiseaux"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateur sur les concentrations de phosphore dans le fleuve Saint-Laurent - Concentrations de phosphore dans le fleuve Saint-Laurent, 2008 \u00e0 2011", "keywords": "environmental indicators,water,water quality,St. Lawrence River,regional ecosystems,phosphorus,monitoring stations,water quality guidelines,wastewater,agriculture", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "f551a128-e3c5-471e-adee-31b3a2ec86aa", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Phosphorus Levels in the St. Lawrence River Indicator - Phosphorus levels in the St. Lawrence River for 2008-2011", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. L'indicateur de concentrations de phosphore dans le fleuve Saint-Laurent permet de mesurer \u00e0 quelle fr\u00e9quence les concentrations de phosphore exc\u00e8dent les lignes directrices de teneur en phosphore pour la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau du Qu\u00e9bec, et ce, en vue de prot\u00e9ger la vie aquatique dans le fleuve Saint-Laurent. Il compare les donn\u00e9es de surveillance de la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau aux lignes directrices pour la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau afin d'\u00e9valuer le risque propre \u00e0 chaque station de surveillance. Plus les lignes directrices pour la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau sont souvent d\u00e9pass\u00e9es, plus le phosphore pose un risque \u00e0 la sant\u00e9 de l'\u00e9cosyst\u00e8me du fleuve Saint-Laurent. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=F7F5426B-1,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=BA164A1F-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=F7F5426B-1,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=BA164A1F-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/1489D508-3160-4991-B66A-0F26FC5B931F/stlawrence_tp_en.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/1489D508-3160-4991-B66A-0F26FC5B931F/stlawrence_tp_fr.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-07-26", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-1", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Phosphorus Levels in the St. Lawrence River Indicator provides a measure of how frequently phosphorus concentrations exceed Quebec's water quality phosphorus guideline for the protection of aquatic life in the St. Lawrence River. It compares water quality monitoring data to water quality guidelines to create a risk rating for each monitoring station. The more times the water quality guideline is exceeded, the more risk phosphorus poses to the health of the St. Lawrence River ecosystem. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.\n", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,eau,qualit\u00e9 de l'eau,fleuve Saint-Laurent,\u00e9cosyst\u00e8mes r\u00e9gionaux,phosphore,stations de surveillance,lignes directrices pour la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau,agricoles,eaux us\u00e9es"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateur sur les concentrations de phosphore dans les Grands Lacs - \u00c9tat et tendances des concentrations de phosphore dans les eaux libres des Grands Lacs du Canada, 1970 \u00e0 2010", "keywords": "environmental indicators,water,water quality,Great Lakes,regional ecosystems,phosphorus,open waters,water quality objectives,status,trends,algae,invasive species", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "3bc02bad-ff00-47b9-b1d1-dbc8cf397608", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Phosphorus Levels in the Great Lakes Indicator - Status and trends of phosphorus levels in the open waters of the Canadian Great Lakes, 1970 to 2010", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. L'indicateur sur les concentrations de phosphore dans les Grands Lacs compare les moyennes de concentrations totales de phosphore relev\u00e9es au printemps dans les quatre Grands Lacs canadiens \u00e0 leurs objectifs de qualit\u00e9 de l'eau pour d\u00e9terminer l'\u00e9tat des concentrations de phosphore dans les eaux du large de chaque lac. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont 