The Phosphorus Levels in the Great Lakes Indicator compares average spring total phosphorus concentrations in the four Canadian Great Lakes to their water quality objectives to determine the status of phosphorus concentrations in offshore waters in each lake. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.\n", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,eau,qualit\u00e9 de l'eau,Grands Lacs,\u00e9cosyst\u00e8mes r\u00e9gionaux,phosphore,eaux libres,objectifs de qualit\u00e9 de l'eau,\u00e9tat,tendances,algues,esp\u00e8ces exotiques"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Th\u00e9saurus des sujets de base du gouvernement du Canada - Version anglaise", "keywords": "Core Subject Thesaurus,Subject Thesaurus,CST", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "d4a0e406-eea9-41a7-bcae-28c31f3b9c65", "subject": "Information and Communications  Information et communication", "data_series_name_fra": "Th\u00e9saurus des sujets de base du gouvernement du Canada - Version anglaise", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Government of Canada Core Subject Thesaurus", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le Th\u00e9saurus des sujets de base du gouvernement du Canada est un th\u00e9saurus bilingue dont la terminologie repr\u00e9sente l'ensemble des domaines trait\u00e9s dans les ressources d'information du gouvernement du Canada. Il comprend au total 4859 termes en fran\u00e7ais et 4792 en anglais, dont 2173 descripteurs dans chacune des langues. Tous les domaines du savoir sont repr\u00e9sent\u00e9s dans le th\u00e9saurus, \u00e0 divers degr\u00e9s. \u00c9tant donn\u00e9 la grande vari\u00e9t\u00e9 des sujets couverts par le th\u00e9saurus, les termes qu'on y trouve sont de niveau plut\u00f4t g\u00e9n\u00e9ral. Lors de son \u00e9laboration, on a d\u00e9lib\u00e9r\u00e9ment laiss\u00e9 tomber la terminologie sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9e propre \u00e0 des disciplines pr\u00e9cises et restreintes.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "RDF", "url": "http://www.thesaurus.gc.ca/EAEAD1E6-7DD2-4997-BE7F-40BFB1CBE8A2/CST20120920.rdf", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "XML", "url": "http://www.thesaurus.gc.ca/EAEAD1E6-7DD2-4997-BE7F-40BFB1CBE8A2/CST20120920.xml", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "XML", "url": "http://www.thesaurus.gc.ca/EAEAD1E6-7DD2-4997-BE7F-40BFB1CBE8A2/CST20120920.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2006-06-01", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Government of Canada Core Subject Thesaurus - English Version", "url_fra": "http://fr.thesaurus.gc.ca/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=E5807AB0-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "2011-05-11", "url": "http://en.thesaurus.gc.ca/default.asp?lang=En&n=E5807AB0-1", "notes": "The Government of Canada Core Subject Thesaurus is a bilingual thesaurus consisting of terminology which represents all the fields treated in information resources of the Government of Canada. It contains 4792 terms in English and 4859 in French, including 2173 preferred terms in each language. All fields of knowledge are represented in the thesaurus, to varying degrees. Because of the great variety of subjects covered by the thesaurus, its terminology is rather general. By design, it does not include specialized terminology used in specific and limited disciplines.", "owner_org": "lac-bac", "keywords_fra": "Th\u00e9saurus des sujets de base,Th\u00e9saurus des sujets,TSB"}
