{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateurs des \u00e9missions de substances toxiques atmosph\u00e9riques - \u00c9missions atmosph\u00e9riques de mercure par province et territoire*, Canada, 2010", "keywords": "environmental indicators,air and climate,air pollution,emissions,toxic substances,mercury,province,territory,regional,Hg", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "8616af33-43ff-4376-98d7-744d65800777", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Emission of Toxic Substances to Air Indicators - Mercury emissions to air by province and territory*, Canada, 2010", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. Les indicateurs des \u00e9missions de substances toxiques atmosph\u00e9riques permettent le suivi des \u00e9missions atmosph\u00e9riques de substances toxiques li\u00e9es \u00e0 l'activit\u00e9 humaine au Canada. Ils contribuent \u00e0 informer les Canadiens sur les principaux polluants atmosph\u00e9riques r\u00e9pertori\u00e9s comme substances toxiques pour la sant\u00e9 humaine et l'environnement. Ces indicateurs aident aussi le gouvernement \u00e0 \u00e9tablir les priorit\u00e9s, \u00e0 \u00e9laborer des strat\u00e9gies et des politiques pour r\u00e9duire ou contenir la pollution atmosph\u00e9rique et \u00e0 v\u00e9rifier les progr\u00e8s accomplis dans ce domaine. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en&n=188FBF33-1#hg3,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=332DE20D-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=fr&n=188FBF33-1#hg3,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=332DE20D-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/CB98B13B-C61E-414B-851C-9A85D996044A/ate_chart3_hg_en.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/CB98B13B-C61E-414B-851C-9A85D996044A/ate_chart3_hg_fr.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-07-26", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-1", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Emission of Toxic Substances to Air indicators track emissions of toxic substances released to the air by human activity in Canada. These indicators help to inform Canadians about key air pollutants that have been listed as toxic to human health and the environment. The indicators also help the government to identify priorities and to develop and track progress on strategies and policies put in place to reduce or control air pollution. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.\n", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,air et climat,pollution de l'air,\u00e9missions atmosph\u00e9riques,substances toxiques,mercure,province,territoire,r\u00e9gionale,Hg"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Projet de G\u00e9oportail du MPO: Cartes et Services", "keywords": "GeoBrowser,maps,Geospatial Data Infrastructure,bathymetric Gridded Data,CHS,topography of the seafloor,Locate Hydrographic Surveys,Raster CD Collections BSB,raster image data,Digital Charts - Vector CD Collections S-57,Electronic Navigational Chart ENC. S-57,ECDIS,IMO Resolution A.817,Drifting Buoy Observations,surface and subsurface water temperature,air pressure,air temperature,wind speed,wind direction Web Browser Settings", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "a75a8f3f-f9e9-4e76-b57f-b08b4de2847d", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Marine maps", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Daily | Quotidien", "title": "DFO GeoPortal Project: Maps & Services", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Infrastructure maritime de donn\u00e9es g\u00e9ospatiales (IMDG) pour le Canada. Le projet du G\u00e9oportail du MPO fournit des services essentiels \u00e0 la base de l'infrastructure g\u00e9ospatiale ouverte du MPO, qui est une composante principale de l'IMDG. Le G\u00e9oportail du MPO comprend plusieurs outils et services pour satisfaire les besoins d'un large \u00e9ventail d'utilisateurs, autant internes qu'externes au MPO.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://geoportal.gc.ca/eng", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Cartes marines", "url_fra": "http://geoportal-geoportail.gc.ca/fra", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://geoportal-geoportail.gc.ca/eng", "notes": "Marine geospatial data infrastructure (MGDI) for Canada. The DFO GeoPortal Project is providing the initial services forming the DFO open geospatial infrastructure, which will be a key component of the evolving MDGI. The DFO GeoPortal is aiming to be an enabling agent to facilitate the inclusion of geographic and geo-referenced data and services in community portals and applications.", "owner_org": "dfo-mpo", "keywords_fra": "G\u00e9oconnexions,infrastructure maritime,donn\u00e9es g\u00e9ospatiales,IMDG,G\u00e9oportail,serveurs cartographiques,Open GIS Consortium,OGC,g\u00e9onavigateur,cartographie,donn\u00e9es g\u00e9ospatiales,donn\u00e9es bathym\u00e9triques carroy\u00e9es,topographie du fond marin,lev\u00e9s hydrographiques,cartes matricielles,BSB,cartes vectorielles,GEN  S-57,OHI,ECDIS,OMI,cartes marines,S\u00c9VCM,OMI A.817,bou\u00e9es d\u00e9rivantes,temp\u00e9rature de l'eau en surface,pression atmosph\u00e9rique,vitesse du vent,direction du vent"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Unit\u00e9 des syst\u00e8mes d'information g\u00e9ographique (SIG)", "keywords": "GIS,spatial data sets,mapping applications,spatial analysis,maps,atlas,MAPSTER", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "3e784360-ca20-407c-b9bd-9d468f257eb5", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "SIG", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Daily | Quotidien", "title": "Geographic Information Systems (GIS) Unit", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Ce site Web offre des informations sur les activit\u00e9s de l'unit\u00e9 SIG et permet de partager plus facilement les connaissances et les services SIG par le biais du Web. En particulier, l'acc\u00e8s aux cartes et aux donn\u00e9es de l'unit\u00e9 est rendu possible par l'interm\u00e9diaire d'applications cartographiques telles que MAPSTER.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.pac.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/gis-sig/index-eng.htm", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "GIS", "url_fra": "http://www.pac.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/gis-sig/index-fra.htm", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.pac.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/gis-sig/index-eng.htm", "notes": "This web site provides information on the GIS Unit's activities and facilitates sharing GIS knowledge and services over the web. In particular, access to the unit's MAPSTER web mapping application is available via this site.", "owner_org": "dfo-mpo", "keywords_fra": "SIG,donn\u00e9es spatiales,applications cartographiques,analyse spatiale,cartes,atlas,MAPSTER"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "SIG: Cartes et donn\u00e9es: application MAPSTER", "keywords": "GIS,application,fish,fish habitat,British Columbia,Yukon Territory,MAPSTER,fish species presence,species distribution,marine habitat,administrative boundaries,CHS Charts,Fisheries,commercial,economic,catch,effort,map,layers", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "502ceee9-205e-472e-a187-89872a04fd67", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "MAPSTER", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "GIS Maps & Data; MAPSTER application", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "MAPSTER v3 est une application de cartes Web bas\u00e9e sur Internet accessible au public. MAPSTER a pour but de permettre \u00e0 un groupe d'utilisateurs tr\u00e8s \u00e9parpill\u00e9 et de nature diverse d'acc\u00e9der facilement \u00e0 de l'information cartographique sur les poissons et leurs habitats. La liste des utilisateurs comprend : personnel de MPO, ONG, industrie, Premi\u00e8res nations, consultants et grand public. L'interface cartographique interactive de MAPSTER permet d'afficher et d'interroger plus de 700 couches de poisson et de leurs habitats couvrant la Colombie-Britannique, le territoire du Yukon et la r\u00e9gion canadienne au large des c\u00f4tes du Pacifique.\n\nLes couches cartographiques disponibles dans MAPSTER constituent des th\u00e8mes concernant les poissons et leurs habitats comme:\n\nBiote/\u00e9cologie - arri\u00e8re-pays et maritime\nInformation \u00e9conomique concernant les p\u00eaches\nInformation sur le programme de politique concernant le saumon sauvage\nLimites administratives continentales et maritimes et installations (p. ex. \u00e9closeries)\nPremi\u00e8res Nations\nEntit\u00e9s g\u00e9ographiques physiques continentales et maritimes.\nLes couches cartographiques peuvent \u00eatre visualis\u00e9es individuellement ou se combiner mutuellement pour 'b\u00e2tir' une vue g\u00e9ographique dans une r\u00e9gion d'int\u00e9r\u00eat. MAPSTER utilise Microsoft BING comme carte de base et moteur de recherche d'adresse.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.pac.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/gis-sig/tutorial-didacticiel/index-eng.htm", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.pac.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/gis-sig/tutorial-didacticiel/index-fra.htm", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "SHAPE", "url": "http://www.pac.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/gis-sig/maps-cartes-eng.htm", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "MAPSTER", "url_fra": "http://www.pac.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/gis-sig/maps-cartes-fra.htm", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.pac.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/gis-sig/maps-cartes-eng.htm", "notes": "MAPSTER v3 is an Internet-based web map application which is available to everyone. The purpose of MAPSTER is to provide simple access to fish and fish habitat map information for a widely dispersed and diverse group of users. Users include DFO staff, NGO's, Industry, First Nations, consultants and the general public. Over 700 fish and fish habitat layers covering British Columbia, the Yukon Territory, and the Canadian pacific offshore area can currently be displayed and queried through MAPSTER's interactive map interface. \nMap layers available in MAPSTER represent fish and fish habitat themes such as: \n.\tInland and marine biota / ecology \n.\tFisheries economic information \n.\tWild Salmon Policy program information \n.\tInland and marine administrative boundaries and facilities (e.g. hatcheries) \n.\tFirst Nations \n.\tInland and marine physical geographic features \nMap layers may be viewed individually or in combination with one another to 'build' a geographic view within an area of interest. MAPSTER uses Microsoft BING as its base map and address search engine.", "owner_org": "dfo-mpo", "keywords_fra": "SIG,Mapster,cartes,ressources halieutiques,habitats,esp\u00e8ces de poissons,limites administratives,cartes,SHC,couches cartographiques,cartographie,Colombie-Britannique,Yukon,p\u00eaches,commerciales,\u00e9conomique,prises,effort"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Programme de monitorage de la zone Atlantique (PMZA)", "keywords": "Hydrographic data,temperature,salinity,dissolved oxygen,fluorescence,chlorophyll a,nutrients,Climate Indices,oceanography,freshwater,ice,atmosphere,Plankton,Net collected,CPR collected,Sea Levels,Remote Sensing,Meteorological Data,stations,Atlantic,AZMP", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "9ae96713-4330-4ef1-9c1b-aa05759d0dfd", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Donn\u00e9es du programme de monitorage de la zone atlantique", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Daily | Quotidien", "title": "Atlantic Zone Monitoring Program (AZMP)", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le PMZA vise \u00e0 collecter et analyser l'information biologique, chimique et physique recueillie sur le terrain afin de (1) caract\u00e9riser et comprendre les causes de la variabilit\u00e9 oc\u00e9anique aux \u00e9chelles saisonni\u00e8res, interannuelles et d\u00e9cadales, (2)fournir les ensembles de donn\u00e9es pluridisciplinaires qui sont n\u00e9cessaires pour \u00e9tablir des relations entre les variables biologiques, chimiques et physiques et (3) fournir les donn\u00e9es pour le d\u00e9veloppement durable des activit\u00e9s oc\u00e9aniques. Le PMZA implique les r\u00e9gions du Golfe, du Qu\u00e9bec, des Maritimes et de Terre-Neuve du MPO. Environnement Canada) pour compl\u00e9menter les donn\u00e9es du PMZA.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://waves-vagues.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/waves-vagues/search-recherche/display-afficher/224076", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://waves-vagues.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/waves-vagues/search-recherche/display-afficher/232003", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/azmp-pmza/hydro/index-eng.html", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/azmp-pmza/climat/index-eng.htm", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/azmp-pmza/met/index-eng.asp", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/azmp-pmza/sl-pm/index-eng.asp", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "", "time_period_coverage_start": "1999-01-01", "data_series_name": "Atlantic Zone Monitoring Program Data", "url_fra": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/azmp-pmza/index-fra.html", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "1999-01-01", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/azmp-pmza/index-eng.html", "notes": "The AZMP has the aim of collecting and analyzing the biological, chemical, and physical field data that are necessary to (1) characterize and understand the causes of oceanic variability at the seasonal, inter-annual, and decadal scales, (2) provide multidisciplinary data sets that can be used to establish relationships among the biological, chemical, and physical variables, and (3) provide adequate data to support the sound development of ocean activities. AZMP involves the Gulf, Qu\u00e9bec, Maritimes, and Newfoundland regions of DFO. ", "owner_org": "dfo-mpo", "keywords_fra": "Oc\u00e9ans,eau,temp\u00e9rature,salinit\u00e9,oxyg\u00e8ne dissout,fluorescence,chlorophylle a,nutriments,Indices climatiques,oc\u00e9anographie,eau douce,glace,atmosph\u00e8re,Plancton,Donn\u00e9es de filet,Donn\u00e9es CPR,Niveaux d'eau,Donn\u00e9es m\u00e9t\u00e9orologiques,m\u00e9t\u00e9orologie,t\u00e9l\u00e9d\u00e9tection,stations,Atlantique,nitrate,nitrite,phosphate,silicate,PMZA"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Inventaire national des rejets de polluants (INRP) - Donn\u00e9es sur les rejets et transferts de polluants d\u00e9clar\u00e9es par les installations pour 1993", "keywords": "pollutant,pollution,emissions,environment,recycling,disposal,industry,chemical,substance,toxic,air pollution,water pollution,land,chemical spill,waste,underground injection,landfill,energy recovery,ozone,smog,particulate matter,emissions,volatile organic compound,nitrogen oxides,sulphur oxide,ammonia,facilities,environmental performance,business,release,sector", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "8fe00957-c78c-41d4-8ea7-720c9e70677b", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Ensembles de donn\u00e9es d\u00e9clar\u00e9es par les installations \u00e0 l'Inventaire national des rejets de polluants (INRP)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Annually | Annuel", "title": "National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) - Pollutant Release and Transfer Data Reported by Facilities for 1993", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "L'Inventaire national des rejets de polluants (INRP) est l'inventaire public du Canada sur les polluants rejet\u00e9s (dans l'atmosph\u00e8re, dans l'eau et dans le sol), \u00e9limin\u00e9s et recycl\u00e9s. Les donn\u00e9es sur les rejets et les transferts de polluants d\u00e9clar\u00e9s \u00e0 l'INRP par les installations comprennent\u00a0: des donn\u00e9es et des renseignements au sujet des polluants rejet\u00e9s, \u00e9limin\u00e9s et recycl\u00e9s d\u00e9clar\u00e9s pour l'ann\u00e9e 1993 par les installations canadiennes et publi\u00e9s par Environnement Canada pour le programme de d\u00e9claration obligatoire de l'INRP en vertu de la Loi canadienne sur la protection de l'environnement, 1999 [LCPE (1999)]. Ces polluants comprennent des substances toxiques telles que les principaux polluants contribuant au smog, \u00e0 la formation de pluies acides et/ou \u00e0 la pi\u00e8tre qualit\u00e9 de l'air, ainsi qu'un certains nombre de m\u00e9taux lourds s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9s et de polluants organiques persistants. Il y  a plusieurs facteurs \u00e0 consid\u00e9rer lors de l'analyse des donn\u00e9es de l'INRP et d'autres renseignements sont disponibles sur le site web de l'INRP. Les donn\u00e9es de l'INRP sont disponibles pour les ann\u00e9es 1993-2009 dans plusieurs formats : un outil de recherche en ligne, des bases de donn\u00e9es t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables, ainsi que des couches cartographiques. En plus de la base de donn\u00e9es pour toutes les ann\u00e9es (1993-2009), des bases de donn\u00e9es pour les ann\u00e9es individuelles sont aussi publi\u00e9es, ainsi qu'un tableaux d\u00e9crivant la structure de la base de donn\u00e9es.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=En&n=B5C1EAB8-1, http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/querysite/query_e.cfm", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=B5C1EAB8-1, http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/querysite/query_f.cfm", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/data/Canada_1993_mdb_2012-03-27.exe", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/pdb/websol/data/Canada_1993_mdb_2012-03-27.exe", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-12-20", "time_period_coverage_start": "1993-01-01", "data_series_name": "National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) Facility Data", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=4A577BB9-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "1993-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/inrp-npri/default.asp?lang=En&n=4A577BB9-1", "notes": "The National Pollutant Release Inventory (NPRI) is Canada's public inventory of pollutant releases (to air, water and land), disposals and transfers for recycling. The NPRI facility pollutant release and transfer data includes:  data and information on pollutant releases, disposals and transfers for recycling for the year 1993 were reported by facilities in Canada and published by Environment Canada for the NPRI mandatory reporting program under the authority of the Canadian Environmental Protection Act, 1999 (CEPA 1999).  (These pollutants include toxic substances such as the main pollutants contributing to smog, acid rain and/or poor air quality, a number of heavy metals and persistent organic pollutants.   There are important factors that should be considered prior to the use and interpretation of NPRI data and additional information is available on the NPRI web site.  NPRI data is available for the years 1993 - 2009 in a number of formats:  online query tools, downloadable databases, map layers.  In addition to the multi-year datasets, single year datasets are posted, along with corresponding database structure tables.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "polluant,pollution  \u00e9missions,environnement,recyclage,l'\u00e9limination,industrie,chimique,substance toxique,pollution de l'air,pollution de l'eau,la terre,d\u00e9versement de produits chimiques,des d\u00e9chets,injection souterraine,enfouissement,r\u00e9cup\u00e9ration d'\u00e9nergie,ozone,smog,particules,les \u00e9missions,compos\u00e9s organiques volatils,oxydes d'azote,oxydes de soufre,l'ammoniac,installations,performance environnementale,entreprises,rejets,carte,secteur"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "\u00c9missions d'oxydes de soufre (SOX) par installation au Canada - Application de cartographie interactive des ICDE", "keywords": "environmental indicators,emissions,air pollutants,sulphur oxides,facilities,facility emissions,indicator data,data download,interactive maps,mapping application", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "0dffba24-9649-443b-bb2b-0145cd6e9006", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Sulphur Oxides (SOx) Air Pollutant Emissions by Facility, Canada - CESI Interactive Mapping Application ", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "L'application de cartographie interactive de l'Initiative des indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) vous permet d'explorer rapidement les indicateurs environnementaux locaux et r\u00e9gionaux du Canada \u00e0 l'aide de multiples formats de cartes et de donn\u00e9es accessibles (HTML, CSV, KML/KMZ). Les cartes des indicateurs environnementaux peuvent \u00eatre configur\u00e9es pour n'importe quelle province, ville majeure ou r\u00e9gion de code postal du Canada. L'application de cartographie interactive affiche les donn\u00e9es des \u00e9missions d'oxydes de soufre par installation. ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://maps-cartes.ec.gc.ca/indicators-indicateurs/Default.aspx?id=6&Xmin=-15248559.4668634&Ymin=4878962.72110015&xmax=-5777687.01903939&ymax=11140696.5709012&lang=en", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "", "time_period_coverage_start": "2008-01-01", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2008-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "2010-12-14", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) interactive mapping application enables you to quickly explore Canada's local and regional environmental indicators using multiple accessible map and data formats (HTML, CSV, KML/KMZ). The environmental indicator maps can be configured to any province, major city or postal code region of Canada. The interactive mapping application displays sulphur oxides air pollutant emissions by facility.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,\u00e9missions,atmosph\u00e9riques polluantes,oxydes de soufre,installations,\u00e9missions par les installations,donn\u00e9es de l'indicateur,t\u00e9l\u00e9chargement de donn\u00e9es,cartes interactives,l'application de cartographie"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "L'indicateur sur les polybromodiph\u00e9nyl\u00e9thers (PBDE) dans les poissons et les s\u00e9diments - Concentrations de pentaBDE chez le touladi du lac Ontario, 1997 \u00e0 2010", "keywords": "environmental indicators,water,water quality,pressures on water quality,water pollution,fish,fish tissue,sediment,chemicals,PBDE,polybrominate diphenyl ethers,persistent organic pollutants,drainage regions,Lake Ontario,Federal Environmental Quality Guidelines", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "04685c2e-8bc0-409f-86bf-5e0be093e3a3", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Polybrominated Diphenyl Ethers (PBDEs) in Fish and Sediment Indicator - PentaBDE concentrations in Lake Trout from Lake Ontario, 1997 to 2010", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. Les indicateurs de polybromodiph\u00e9nyl\u00e9ther (PBDE) dans les poissons et les s\u00e9diments sont \u00e9tablis en d\u00e9terminant les r\u00e9gions de drainage o\u00f9 les concentrations sont en de\u00e7\u00e0 ou sup\u00e9rieures aux Recommandations f\u00e9d\u00e9rales pour la qualit\u00e9 de l'environnement (RFQE) pour les PBDE dans les poissons et les s\u00e9diments. Ces recommandations ont \u00e9t\u00e9 \u00e9labor\u00e9es dans le cadre du Plan de gestion des produits chimiques (PGPC) et sont utilis\u00e9es de diverses fa\u00e7ons. Dans ce rapport, elles servent \u00e0 \u00e9valuer l'importance des donn\u00e9es de surveillance. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en&n=0970C75C-1,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en&n=816059AD-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=fr&n=0970C75C-1,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=fr&n=816059AD-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/B78A711C-4B43-4FA6-B7FC-97A60F7B2335/PBDE_fish_LakeOntario_en.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/B78A711C-4B43-4FA6-B7FC-97A60F7B2335/PBDE_fish_LakeOntario_fr.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-10-04", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-1", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Polybrominate Diphenyl Ethers (PBDEs) in Fish and Sediment indicators are established by determining the drainage regions where concentrations are within or have exceeded the Federal Environmental Quality Guidelines (FEQGs) for PBDEs in fish and sediment. The FEQGs were developed under the Chemicals Management Plan (CMP) and are used in various ways. In this report they are used to evaluate the significance of monitoring data. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,eau,qualit\u00e9 de l'eau,pressions sur la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau,pollution d'eau,poissons,tissus des poissons,s\u00e9diments,chimiques,PBDE,polybromodiph\u00e9nyl\u00e9thers,polluants organiques persistants,r\u00e9gions de drainage,lac Ontario,Recommandations f\u00e9d\u00e9rales pour la qualit\u00e9 de l'environnement"}
