 de diverses fa\u00e7ons. Dans ce rapport, elles servent \u00e0 \u00e9valuer l'importance des donn\u00e9es de surveillance. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en&n=0970C75C-1,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en&n=816059AD-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=fr&n=0970C75C-1,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=fr&n=816059AD-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/B78A711C-4B43-4FA6-B7FC-97A60F7B2335/PBDE_fish_en.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/B78A711C-4B43-4FA6-B7FC-97A60F7B2335/PBDE_fish_fr.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-1", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Polybrominate Diphenyl Ethers (PBDEs) in Fish and Sediment indicators are established by determining the drainage regions where concentrations are within or have exceeded the Federal Environmental Quality Guidelines (FEQGs) for PBDEs in fish and sediment. The FEQGs were developed under the Chemicals Management Plan (CMP) and are used in various ways. In this report they are used to evaluate the significance of monitoring data. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.\n", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,eau,qualit\u00e9 de l'eau,pressions sur la qualit\u00e9 de l'eau,pollution d'eau,poissons,tissus des poissons,s\u00e9diments,chimiques,PBDE,polybromodiph\u00e9nyl\u00e9thers,polluants organiques persistants,r\u00e9gions de drainage,lac Ontario,Recommandations f\u00e9d\u00e9rales pour la qualit\u00e9 de l'environnement"}
