{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Argo: Donn\u00e9es sur les profileurs d\u00e9rivants canadiens", "keywords": "Argo,profiling float,oceans,temperature,salinity", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "2e652b23-4306-4d27-809a-7baf8448856f", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Donn\u00e9es canadiennes suivies", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Monthly | Mensuel", "title": "Argo: Canadian Tracked Data", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Environ 3000 profileurs d\u00e9rivants ont \u00e9t\u00e9 d\u00e9ploy\u00e9s \u00e0 l'\u00e9chelle du globe. Une fois en mer, le profileur descend \u00e0 une profondeur cible pr\u00e9d\u00e9termin\u00e9e de 2000 m\u00e8tres pour une p\u00e9riode pr\u00e9d\u00e9termin\u00e9e. Ensuite le profileur refait surface, enregistrant, durant son ascension, les valeurs de temp\u00e9rature et de salinit\u00e9 \u00e0 des niveaux pr\u00e9-\u00e9tablis . -- Les donn\u00e9es canadiennes suivies par Argo donne une description du programme Argo au Canada ainsi que des donn\u00e9es et informations \u00e0 propos des profileurs d\u00e9rivants canadiens. \n\n", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/argo/canada/data-donne-fra.html", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "", "time_period_coverage_start": "1995-01-01", "data_series_name": "Canadian Tracked Data", "url_fra": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/argo/index-fra.html", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2010-01-01", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.meds-sdmm.dfo-mpo.gc.ca/isdm-gdsi/argo/index-eng.html", "notes": "Approximately 3000 profiling floats were deployed around the world. Once at sea, the float sinks to a preprogrammed target depth of 2000 meters for a preprogrammed period of time. It then floats to the surface, taking temperature and salinity values during its ascent at set depths.  -- The Canadian Tracked Argo Data\ndescribes the Argo programme in Canada and provides data and information about Canadian floats. \n\n\n", "owner_org": "dfo-mpo", "keywords_fra": "Argo,profileur d\u00e9rivant,oc\u00e9an,temp\u00e9rature,salinit\u00e9"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Catalogue du portail donnees.gc.ca", "keywords": "dataset,metadata,catalogue,data.gc.ca", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "c4c5c7f1-bfa6-4ff6-b4a0-c164cb2060f7", "subject": "Information and Communications  Information et communication", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Data.gc.ca Portal Catalogue", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le catalogue du portail donnees.gc.ca est un ensemble de donn\u00e9es qui contient des m\u00e9tadonn\u00e9es cl\u00e9s pour les ensembles de donn\u00e9es g\u00e9n\u00e9raux disponibles sur le Portail de donn\u00e9es ouvertes du gouvernement du Canada.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/data_donnees/TBS/Open_Data_-_Donnees_ouvertes.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-03-09", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "2012-04-12", "url": "", "notes": "The Data.gc.ca portal catalogue is a downloadable dataset containing some key metadata for the general datasets available on the Government of Canada's Open Data portal.", "owner_org": "tbs-sct", "keywords_fra": "ensemble de donn\u00e9es,metadonn\u00e9es,catalogue,donn\u00e9es.gc.ca"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateurs de la quantit\u00e9 et disponibilit\u00e9 d'eau - Quantit\u00e9 d'eau dans les r\u00e9gions de drainage du Canada, 2001 \u00e0 2010", "keywords": "environmental indicators,water,water quantity,water levels,water flows,drainage regions,Water Survey of Canada,rivers,renewable freshwater", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "807cf591-31e4-4517-9f74-e93d3a6e9900", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Water Quantity and Availability Indicators - Water quantity in Canada's drainage regions, 2001 to 2010", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. L'indicateur sur la quantit\u00e9 de l'eau classe la quantit\u00e9 d'eau annuelle dans les 25 r\u00e9gions de drainage du Canada par cat\u00e9gorie (faible, normale ou \u00e9lev\u00e9e), de 2001 \u00e0 2010. La classification de la quantit\u00e9 d'eau est d\u00e9termin\u00e9e en comparant les niveaux ou les d\u00e9bits d'eau quotidiens aux valeurs normales enregistr\u00e9es de 1978 \u00e0 2007 \u00e0 chaque station de surveillance de la quantit\u00e9 d'eau dans une r\u00e9gion de drainage. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=D55F8316-1,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=BA7128D9-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=D55F8316-1,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=BA7128D9-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/DEC9C66E-5377-4B9B-86E4-0A4111F8B90D/WQ_Nat_EN.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/DEC9C66E-5377-4B9B-86E4-0A4111F8B90D/WQ_Nat_EN.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-12-18", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-1", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Water Quantity indicator classifies yearly water quantity for Canada's 25 drainage regions as high, normal or low for 2001-2010. Water quantity classifications are determined by comparing daily water levels or flows to daily normal values for 1978-2007 for each water quantity monitoring station in a drainage region. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,eau,quantit\u00e9 d'eau,niveaux d'eau,d\u00e9bit d'eau,r\u00e9gions de drainage,Relev\u00e9s hydrologiques du Canada,rivi\u00e8res,eau douce renouvelables"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateurs de la quantit\u00e9 et disponibilit\u00e9 d'eau - Menaces pour la disponibilit\u00e9 de l'eau au Canada, 2009", "keywords": "environmental indicators,water,water availability,water quantity,threat,water supply,freshwater,water withdrawn", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "92d15406-ad52-4aa0-87d6-8c627076e467", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Water Quantity and Availability Indicators - Threats to water availability in Canada, 2009", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "    Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. L'indicateur sur la disponibilit\u00e9 de l'eau compare la quantit\u00e9 d'eau douce pr\u00e9lev\u00e9e dans les rivi\u00e8res \u00e0 des fins d'utilisation humaine au volume d'eau des rivi\u00e8res canadiennes. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=1B1433B4-1,http://ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=F242AD28-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=1B1433B4-1,http://ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=F242AD28-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/FCFA75B2-21C5-4F49-BC35-7FC336F41E27/WAI_EN.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/FCFA75B2-21C5-4F49-BC35-7FC336F41E27/WAI_FR.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-12-18", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-1", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Water Availability indicator compares the amount of fresh water withdrawn from rivers for human use to the volume of water in Canadian rivers. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,eau,disponibilit\u00e9 de l'eau,quantit\u00e9 d'eau,menaces,r\u00e9serves d'eau,eau douce,approvisionnement en eau,eau est pr\u00e9lev\u00e9e"}
