{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Canada - R\u00e9sidents permanents selon les principaux pays d'origine", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "6415c2d6-0e5a-4bf0-868c-b2037b2f1a4f", "subject": "Persons  Personnes", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Canada - Permanent residents by source country", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Tableau. Le nombre total de personnes ayant obtenu le statut de r\u00e9sident permanent au Canada, par pays d'origine (derni\u00e8re r\u00e9sidence permanente). Pour des raisons de confidentialit\u00e9, un total combin\u00e9 est inscrit pour les pays repr\u00e9sent\u00e9s par moins de cinq r\u00e9sidents permanents.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000013-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-29", "time_period_coverage_start": "2011-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2012-09-30", "language": "", "date_modified": "2013-01-02", "url": "", "notes": "Table.  The total number of people granted permanent resident status in Canada, by country of origin (last permanent residence).  Due to privacy considerations, a combined total is provided for countries represented by fewer than 5 permanent residents.", "owner_org": "cic", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Inventaire des r\u00e9sidents permanents", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "b6f7c54e-ef4b-4ec1-8dde-7315e97d18eb", "subject": "Persons  Personnes", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Permanent Resident Inventory", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Tableaux. Cet ensemble de donn\u00e9es se compose de huit tableaux distincts accessibles par des onglets au bas de la feuille de calcul et fournit diverses statistiques li\u00e9es aux demandes de r\u00e9sidence permanente \u00e0 l'\u00e9tranger et au Bureau de r\u00e9ception centralis\u00e9e (BRC) \u00e0 Sydney (Nouvelle-\u00c9cosse) pour lesquelles aucune d\u00e9cision d\u00e9finitive n'a \u00e9t\u00e9 prise. Une distinction est faite entre les d\u00e9cisions de s\u00e9lection en cours et les d\u00e9cisions d\u00e9finitives en cours dans les r\u00e9sultats d'inventaire pour chaque tableau. ", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000023-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-29", "time_period_coverage_start": "2012-10-04", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2012-10-04", "language": "", "date_modified": "2013-01-02", "url": "", "notes": "Tables.  This data set consists of 8 separate tables accessible by tabs at the bottom of the spreadsheet and provides various statistics related to permanent resident applications overseas and at the Centralized Intake Office (CIO) in Sydney, Nova Scotia, for which no final decision has been reached.   A distinction is made between selection decisions in process and final decisions in process in the inventory figures for each table. ", "owner_org": "cic", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateurs de la quantit\u00e9 et disponibilit\u00e9 d'eau - Pourcentage de stations de surveillance dans chaque r\u00e9gion de drainage ayant enregistr\u00e9 une quantit\u00e9 faible, normale ou \u00e9lev\u00e9e avec un encart cartographique de l'\u00e9tat de la quantit\u00e9 d'eau de la majorit\u00e9 des stations dans chaque r\u00e9gion de drainage, Canada, 2010", "keywords": "environmental indicators,water,water quantity,water levels,water flows,drainage regions,Water Survey of Canada,rivers", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "596b501b-e267-4749-b878-085230cd902b", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Water Quantity and Availability Indicators - Percentage of monitoring stations in each drainage region with low, normal or high quantity with inset map of water quantity status of the majority of stations in each drainage region, Canada, 2010", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. L'indicateur sur la quantit\u00e9 de l'eau classe la quantit\u00e9 d'eau annuelle dans les 25 r\u00e9gions de drainage du Canada par cat\u00e9gorie (faible, normale ou \u00e9lev\u00e9e), de 2001 \u00e0 2010. La classification de la quantit\u00e9 d'eau est d\u00e9termin\u00e9e en comparant les niveaux ou les d\u00e9bits d'eau quotidiens aux valeurs normales enregistr\u00e9es de 1978 \u00e0 2007 \u00e0 chaque station de surveillance de la quantit\u00e9 d'eau dans une r\u00e9gion de drainage. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=9ECBCE1D-1,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=BA7128D9-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=9ECBCE1D-1,http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=BA7128D9-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/DEC9C66E-5377-4B9B-86E4-0A4111F8B90D/WQ_Reg_EN.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/DEC9C66E-5377-4B9B-86E4-0A4111F8B90D/WQ_Reg_FR.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-12-18", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-1", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Water Quantity indicator classifies yearly water quantity for Canada's 25 drainage regions as high, normal or low for 2001-2010. Water quantity classifications are determined by comparing daily water levels or flows to daily normal values for 1978-2007 for each water quantity monitoring station in a drainage region. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,eau,quantit\u00e9 d'eau,niveaux d'eau,d\u00e9bit d'eau,r\u00e9gions de drainage,Relev\u00e9s hydrologiques du Canada,rivi\u00e8res"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateurs de resources biologiques - \u00c9tat des principaux stocks de poissons, Canada, 2011", "keywords": "environmental indicators,nature,biological resources,status,major fish stocks,Fisheries and Oceans Canada,stock status zones,precautionary approach", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "faa19bf1-c722-4679-aec8-db5f76bdc28c", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Biological Resources Indicators - Status of major fish stocks, Canada, 2011", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. L'indicateur sur l'\u00e9tat des principaux stocks de poissons classe les stocks dans trois cat\u00e9gories : \u00ab zone saine \u00bb, \u00ab zone de prudence \u00bb et \u00ab zone critique \u00bb, telles qu'elles sont \u00e9nonc\u00e9es dans l'approche de pr\u00e9caution. Ceci fournit l'information essentielle n\u00e9cessaire pour \u00e9valuer les r\u00e9percussions des p\u00eaches ant\u00e9rieures et pour g\u00e9rer la pression de p\u00eache actuelle et future. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en&n=1BCD421B-1#fs1, http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en&n=9E631A63-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=fr&n=1BCD421B-1#fs1, http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=9E631A63-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/E556B1B6-F421-4BC6-8BD4-AA0E109E4BB4/status_EN.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/E556B1B6-F421-4BC6-8BD4-AA0E109E4BB4/status_FR.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-12-18", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-1", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Status of Major Fish Stocks indicator measures the status of major fish stocks by classifying stocks into \"healthy,\" \"cautious\" and \"critical\" categories, as outlined in the precautionary approach. This provides the fundamental piece of information required to evaluate the impacts of past fishing and to manage present and future fishing pressure. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,nature,ressources biologiques,\u00e9tat,principaux stocks de poissons,P\u00eaches et des Oc\u00e9ans,zones d'\u00e9tat des stocks,l'approche de pr\u00e9caution"}
