{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateurs de la quantit\u00e9 et disponibilit\u00e9 d'eau - Pr\u00e9l\u00e8vement d'eau par secteur au Canada, 2004 \u00e0 2009", "keywords": "environmental indicators,water,water quantity,water use,water withdrawal,water consumption,sector,water returned", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "2262f539-51af-4f3b-a188-1312c43a7a15", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Water Quantity and Availability Indicators - Water withdrawal by sector in Canada, 2004 to 2009 sector in Canada", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. L'indicateur sur le pr\u00e9l\u00e8vement et la consommation d'eau par secteur mesure le volume d'eau pr\u00e9lev\u00e9, retourn\u00e9 \u00e0 la source et consomm\u00e9 par les centrales thermiques d'\u00e9nergie \u00e9lectrique, les secteurs de l'industrie manufacturi\u00e8re, les r\u00e9seaux municipaux, l'agriculture, l'extraction mini\u00e8re et l'industrie p\u00e9troli\u00e8re et gazi\u00e8re de 2004 \u00e0 2009. L'indicateur fournit de l'information \u00e0 propos du volume d'eau utilis\u00e9 au Canada. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=5736C951-1, http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=572A87EB-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=5736C951-1, http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=572A87EB-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/E4F451B5-82D0-44FA-9930-5F4ED8923DB3/water_sector_EN.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/E4F451B5-82D0-44FA-9930-5F4ED8923DB3/water_sector_FR.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-12-18", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-1", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Water Withdrawal and Consumption by Sector indicator measures the volume of water withdrawn, returned and consumed by the thermal power generation, manufacturing, municipal, agriculture, mining, and oil and gas sectors for 2004 to 2009. The indicator provides information about the volume of water used in Canada. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,eau,quantit\u00e9 d'eau,utilisation de l'eau,eau pr\u00e9lev\u00e9,consommation d'eau,secteur,eau retourn\u00e9e \u00e0 la source"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Indicateurs des habitats prot\u00e9g\u00e9s - Superficie cumulative d'habitat prot\u00e9g\u00e9 pour les esp\u00e8ces en p\u00e9ril au Canada gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 des projets financ\u00e9s par le PIH, 2000 \u00e0 2011", "keywords": "environmental indicators,nature,protected habitats,habitat secured,species at risk,Habitat Stewardship Program,Committee on the Status of Endangered Wildlife in Canada,HSP,COSEWIC,Endangered,Threatened,Special Concern,stewardship activities,conservation", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "39873772-0c82-418a-839d-595331de57a4", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Protected Habitat Indicators - Cumulative species at risk habitat secured in Canada by HSP-funded projects, 2000 to 2011", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. L'indicateur sur l'habitat prot\u00e9g\u00e9 pour les esp\u00e8ces en p\u00e9ril pr\u00e9sente les progr\u00e8s accomplis vers la protection d'habitat par le PIH pour les esp\u00e8ces \u00e9valu\u00e9es comme \u00e9tant \u00ab en p\u00e9ril \u00bb (en voie de disparition, menac\u00e9e ou pr\u00e9occupante) par le Comit\u00e9 sur la situation des esp\u00e8ces en p\u00e9ril au Canada (COSEPAC). Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=CBA85E96-1, http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=en&n=DE93FF58-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=fr&n=CBA85E96-1, http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=DE93FF58-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/CA029643-788C-4E36-A407-5DD03FFC7650/HSP_Data_EN.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/CA029643-788C-4E36-A407-5DD03FFC7650/HSP_Data_FR.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-12-18", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-1", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Habitat Secured for Species at Risk indicator provides a view of progress in protecting habitat through the HSP for species assessed to be \"at risk\" (Endangered, Threatened or of Special Concern) by the Committee on the Status of Endangered Wildlife in Canada (COSEWIC). Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,nature,habitats prot\u00e9g\u00e9s,esp\u00e8ces en p\u00e9ril,Programme d'intendance de l'habitat,Comit\u00e9 sur la situation des esp\u00e8ces en p\u00e9ril au Canada,PIH,COSEPAC,en voie de disparition,menac\u00e9e,pr\u00e9occupante,activit\u00e9s d'intendance,conservation"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": " Indicateurs de la quantit\u00e9 et disponibilit\u00e9 d'eau - Quantit\u00e9 d'eau dans les stations de surveillance, Canada, 2010", "keywords": "environmental indicators,water,water quantity,water levels,water flows,drainage regions,Water Survey of Canada,rivers", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "74fe0af5-bb5c-44ee-8ab4-0567be56897c", "subject": "Nature and Environment  Nature et environnement", "data_series_name_fra": "Indicateurs canadiens de durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE)", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Water Quantity and Availability Indicators - Water quantity at monitoring stations, Canada, 2010", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le programme des Indicateurs canadiens de la durabilit\u00e9 de l'environnement (ICDE) rend compte de la performance du Canada \u00e0 l'\u00e9gard d'enjeux cl\u00e9s en mati\u00e8re de d\u00e9veloppement durable. L'indicateur sur la quantit\u00e9 de l'eau classe la quantit\u00e9 d'eau annuelle dans les 25 r\u00e9gions de drainage du Canada par cat\u00e9gorie (faible, normale ou \u00e9lev\u00e9e), de 2001 \u00e0 2010. La classification de la quantit\u00e9 d'eau est d\u00e9termin\u00e9e en comparant les niveaux ou les d\u00e9bits d'eau quotidiens aux valeurs normales enregistr\u00e9es de 1978 \u00e0 2007 \u00e0 chaque station de surveillance de la quantit\u00e9 d'eau dans une r\u00e9gion de drainage. Cette information est rendue disponible aux Canadiens sous plusieurs formats: cartes statiques et interactives, figures et graphiques, tableaux de donn\u00e9es HTML et CSV et rapports t\u00e9l\u00e9chargeables. Voir l'autre documentation pour les sources des donn\u00e9es et pour lire comment les donn\u00e9es sont collect\u00e9es et comment l'indicateur est calcul\u00e9.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://maps-cartes.ec.gc.ca/indicators-indicateurs/default.aspx?mapId=4&xMin=-17200268.28492363&yMin=4842529.641591634&xMax=-5498653.153107968&yMax=12669696.953842915&lang=en, http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=BA7128D9-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://maps-cartes.ec.gc.ca/indicators-indicateurs/default.aspx?mapId=4&xMin=-17200268.28492363&yMin=4842529.641591634&xMax=-5498653.153107968&yMax=12669696.953842915&lang=fr, http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=BA7128D9-1", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://maps-cartes.ec.gc.ca/indicators-indicateurs/TableView.aspx?ID=4&lang=en", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "http://maps-cartes.ec.gc.ca/indicators-indicateurs/TableView.aspx?ID=4&lang=fr", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "kml / kmz", "url": "http://maps-cartes.ec.gc.ca/indicators-indicateurs/kmz/CESI_Water_Quantity_n.kmz", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "kml / kmz", "url": "http://maps-cartes.ec.gc.ca/indicators-indicateurs/kmz/ICDE_Quantite_d'eau_n.kmz", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2012-12-18", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI)", "url_fra": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=Fr&n=A073189E-1", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://www.ec.gc.ca/indicateurs-indicators/default.asp?lang=En&n=A073189E-1", "notes": "The Canadian Environmental Sustainability Indicators (CESI) program provides data and information to track Canada's performance on key environmental sustainability issues. The Water Quantity indicator classifies yearly water quantity for Canada's 25 drainage regions as high, normal or low for 2001-2010. Water quantity classifications are determined by comparing daily water levels or flows to daily normal values for 1978-2007 for each water quantity monitoring station in a drainage region. Information is provided to Canadians in a number of formats including: static and interactive maps, charts and graphs, HTML and CSV data tables and downloadable reports. See supplementary documentation for data sources and details on how those data were collected and how the indicator was calculated.", "owner_org": "ec", "keywords_fra": "indicateurs environnementaux,indicateur environnemental,eau,quantit\u00e9 d'eau,niveaux d'eau,d\u00e9bit d'eau,r\u00e9gions de drainage,Relev\u00e9s hydrologiques du Canada,rivi\u00e8res"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Effectif de la fonction publique f\u00e9d\u00e9rale par minist\u00e8re", "keywords": "Core Public Administration,CPA,Federal Public Service,FPS,Employment Equity,Separate Agencies,Indeterminate employee,Term employee,Casual Employee,Student employee,Seasonal employee,Active status,Inactive status,Hires,Appointment,Promotion,Attrition rate,Retirement without penalty eligibility,Full time,Part time,Leave type,Occupational group,Bargaining Unit Designator Code,BUD Code,Financial Administration Act,FAA,Employment Equity Act,EAA,Public Service Employment Act,PSEA,Office of the Chief Human Resources Officer,OCHRO,Treasury Board Secretariat,TBS,Treasury,Board,Secretariat,Office,Chief,Human,Resources", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "a68c6586-8ab0-4e76-b54e-cbdbd6183c2a", "subject": "Government and Politics  Gouvernement et vie politique", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Unknown | Inconnu", "title": "Population of the Federal Public Service by Department", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Ces donn\u00e9es pr\u00e9sentent les chiffres de population par minist\u00e8re pour les organisations de la fonction publique f\u00e9d\u00e9rale (c.-\u00e0-d., tous les minist\u00e8res et organismes r\u00e9gis par les annexes I, IV et V de la Loi sur la gestion des finances publiques (LGFP)) pour la p\u00e9riode du 31 mars 2005 au 31 mars 2012.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.tbs-sct.gc.ca/res/stats/ssa-pop.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "att