{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Offres \u00e0 commandes et arrangements en mati\u00e8re d'approvisionnement", "keywords": "standing offers,supply arrangements,open data,pre-qualified suppliers,standing offer index,SOI,dataset,procurement,goods,services", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "f5c8a5a0-354d-455a-99ab-8276aa38032e", "subject": "Economics and Industry  \u00c9conomie et industrie", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Weekly | Hebdomadaire", "title": "Standing Offers and Supply Arrangements", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Les Offres \u00e0 commandes et arrangements en mati\u00e8re d'approvisionnement (OCAMA), anciennement appel\u00e9 les Donn\u00e9es sur les fournisseurs pr\u00e9qualifi\u00e9s (DFPQ), sont des donn\u00e9es ouvertes sur les offres \u00e0 commandes et les arrangements en mati\u00e8re d'approvisionnement qui sont actuellement en vigueur et d\u00e9tenus par des fournisseurs pr\u00e9qualifi\u00e9s de biens et de services\n\nMis \u00e0 jour chaque semaine, les donn\u00e9es d\u00e9terminent des entreprises qui d\u00e9tiennent des offres \u00e0 commandes (OC) et des arrangements en mati\u00e8re d'approvisionnement (AMA). Les OC et les AMA sont deux m\u00e9thodes utilis\u00e9es couramment par les minist\u00e8res et les organismes gouvernementaux pour l'achat de biens et de services.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://data.gc.ca/commonwebsol/fileuploads/8/5/6/856A22FE-CA6A-4CD9-BB0E-7E5CDAAA7F34/PQSD definitions.txt|PQSD definitions.txt", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Dictionaire de donn\u00e9es", "language": "fra; CAN", "format": "HTML", "url": "http://data.gc.ca/commonwebsol/fileuploads/8/3/5/835A46DD-97F0-4E66-AF45-C6D40925538E/PQSD definitions - fr.txt|PQSD definitions - fr.txt", "resource_type": "doc", "name": "Data Dictionary"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "https://buyandsell.gc.ca/sites/buyandsell.gc.ca/files/open-data/tpsgc-pwgsc_ocama-sosa.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}, {"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "CSV", "url": "https://buyandsell.gc.ca/sites/buyandsell.gc.ca/files/open-data/tpsgc-pwgsc_ocama-sosa_microsoft.csv", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2011-09-14", "time_period_coverage_start": "", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "http://achatsetventes.gc.ca", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "", "language": "", "date_modified": "", "url": "http://buyandsell.gc.ca", "notes": "Standing Offers and Supply Arrangements (SOSA), formerly known as Pre-Qualified Supplier Data (PQSD), is open data about active standing offers and supply arrangements for goods and/or services held by pre-qualified suppliers.", "owner_org": "pwgsc-tpsgc", "keywords_fra": "offres \u00e0 commandes,arrangements en mati\u00e8re d'approvisionnement,de donn\u00e9es ouvertes,fournisseurs pr\u00e9-qualifi\u00e9s,l'indice de l'offre \u00e0 commandes,le SOI donn\u00e9es,des achats,des biens,des services"}
