{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Canada - R\u00e9sidents permanents selon la province ou le territoire et la r\u00e9gion urbaine", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "eb668d4e-9835-46e4-86fe-f5184165d803", "subject": "Persons  Personnes", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Canada - Permanent residents by province or territory and urban area", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Tableau. Le nombre de personnes ayant obtenu le statut de r\u00e9sident permanent au Canada, avec des totaux par province ou territoire et par r\u00e9gion urbaine. Les r\u00e9sultats pour 65 r\u00e9gions urbaines distinctes sont fournis. Pour des raisons de confidentialit\u00e9, des totaux combin\u00e9s ont \u00e9t\u00e9 fournis pour les Territoires du Nord-Ouest et le Nunavut.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000012-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-29", "time_period_coverage_start": "2011-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2012-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "2013-04-02", "url": "", "notes": "Table.  The number of people granted permanent resident status in Canada, with totals by province or territory and by urban area.  Figures for 65 distinct urban areas are provided.  Due to privacy considerations, combined totals have been provided for the Northwest Territories and Nunavut.", "owner_org": "cic", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Cartes de r\u00e9sident permanent produites par la Cie canadienne des billets de banque (CCBB)", "keywords": "CBN Permanent resident permanent resident card", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "62ef7c0e-1e3c-4922-a308-09adb9f52f21", "subject": "Persons  Personnes", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Permanent Resident Cards Produced by Canadian Bank Note (CBN)", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Tableau. Le nombre de cartes de r\u00e9sident permanent (RP) produites par la Compagnie canadienne des billets de banque (CCBB, actuellement sous contrat pour produire les cartes RP), avec les totaux pour les cartes distribu\u00e9es aux bureaux de CIC par la CCBB (y compris les renouvellements), et les cartes envoy\u00e9es par la poste aux nouveaux r\u00e9sidents permanents (apr\u00e8s la LIPR) par la CCBB. Les comparaisons (variation en pourcentage) sont \u00e9galement fournies.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000025-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-29", "time_period_coverage_start": "2007-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2012-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "2013-04-02", "url": "", "notes": "Table. The number of permanent resident (PR) cards produced by Canadian Bank Note (CBN, the company currently contracted to produce PR cards), with totals for cards distributed to CIC offices by CBN (including renewals), and cards mailed to new (post IRPA) permanent residents by CBN.  Comparisons (percentage change) are also provided.", "owner_org": "cic", "keywords_fra": "CCBB R\u00e9sident permanent cartes de resident permanent"}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "10 principaux pays sources - Visas, permis et prorogations d\u00e9livr\u00e9s pour les r\u00e9sidents temporaires (en personnes)", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "db0ab81f-7932-43dd-a7b3-e67e00026e67", "subject": "Persons  Personnes", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Top 10 Source Countries - Visas, Permits and Extensions Issued for Temporary Residents (in Persons)", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Tableau. Le nombre de visas de r\u00e9sident temporaire canadien, de permis de s\u00e9jour temporaire et de prolongation d\u00e9livr\u00e9s, avec les totaux pour les dix principaux pays d'origine (pays de citoyennet\u00e9 du client) et un total combin\u00e9 de tous les autres pays. Les comparaisons (variation en pourcentage) sont \u00e9galement fournies.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000035-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-29", "time_period_coverage_start": "2007-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2012-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "2013-04-02", "url": "", "notes": "Table.  The number of Canadian temporary resident visas, permits and extensions issued, with totals for the top 10 source countries (client country of citizenship) and a combined total for all other countries.  Comparisons (percentage change) are also provided. ", "owner_org": "cic", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Point de service - Demandes re\u00e7ues en vue de la r\u00e9sidence temporaire (en personnes)", "keywords": "Foreign students Foreign workers Point of Service Study permit Work permit temporary resident visa", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "5573df02-7f1d-4a17-8fe0-1955ad8afad4", "subject": "Persons  Personnes", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Point of Service - Applications Received for Temporary Residents (in Persons)", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Tableau. Le nombre total de demandes de statut de r\u00e9sident temporaire canadien re\u00e7ues, selon la r\u00e9gion de r\u00e9ception : \u00e0 l'\u00e9tranger (quatre r\u00e9gions distinctes) ou au Canada (cinq r\u00e9gions distinctes et la Direction g\u00e9n\u00e9rale du traitement centralis\u00e9 [CTD-V]).", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000028-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-29", "time_period_coverage_start": "2007-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2012-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "2013-04-02", "url": "", "notes": "Table.  The total number of applications for Canadian temporary resident status received, by region of receipt: overseas (4 distinct regions) or in Canada (5 distinct regions and the Centralized Process Region (CPC-V)).  ", "owner_org": "cic", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Secteur d'activit\u00e9s - Demandes re\u00e7ues en vue de la r\u00e9sidence permanente (en personnes)", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "882e6d30-bfbc-4031-b691-d1e7f7c47bf2", "subject": "Persons  Personnes", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Business Line - Applications Received for Permanent Residents (in Persons)", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Tableau. Le nombre total de demandes re\u00e7ues pour le statut de r\u00e9sident permanent au Canada, par cat\u00e9gorie d'immigration : cat\u00e9gorie \u00e9conomique, regroupement familial, motifs d'ordre humanitaire et autres. Les comparaisons (variation en pourcentage) sont \u00e9galement fournies.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000003-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-29", "time_period_coverage_start": "2007-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2012-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "2013-01-02", "url": "", "notes": "Table.  The total number of applications received for permanent resident status in Canada, by immigration category:  economic class, family class, humanitarian class and other.  Comparisons (percentage change) are also provided.", "owner_org": "cic", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Demandeurs de la r\u00e9sidence permanente en attente d'une d\u00e9cision \u00e0 CIC", "keywords": "C50 Processing C50 Inventory Permanent resident Skilled workers Skilled workers Federal", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "734bbc68-d5a5-4331-b99a-0b7237a9785d", "subject": "Persons  Personnes", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Permanent Resident Applicants Awaiting a Decision", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Tableau. Le nombre total de personnes en attente d'une d\u00e9cision concernant les demandes de r\u00e9sidence permanente, par type de demande (demandes de travailleur qualifi\u00e9 [f\u00e9d\u00e9ral] re\u00e7ues avant ou apr\u00e8s le 27 f\u00e9vrier 2008 - date d'entr\u00e9e en vigueur du \u00ab Plan d'action pour acc\u00e9l\u00e9rer l'immigration \u00bb - et toutes les autres demandes, y compris la cat\u00e9gorie du regroupement familial, les r\u00e9fugi\u00e9s, le groupe vis\u00e9 par les circonstances d'ordre humanitaire, et d'autres dans la cat\u00e9gorie \u00e9conomique). Les comparaisons (variation en pourcentage) sont \u00e9galement fournies.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000024-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-29", "time_period_coverage_start": "2007-12-31", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2012-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "2013-04-02", "url": "", "notes": "Table.  The total number of people awaiting a decision concerning permanent resident applications, by type of application (federal skilled worker application received before or after February 27, 2008 - when the \"Action Plan for Faster Immigration\" took effect - and all other applications, including family class, refugees, humanitarian and compassionate, and others in the economic class).  Comparisons (percentage change) are also provided.", "owner_org": "cic", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Secteur d'activit\u00e9 - Demandes re\u00e7ues pour les r\u00e9sidents temporaires (en personnes)", "keywords": "Foreign students Foreign workers Study permit Work permit  temporary resident visa", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "63d69311-fd3a-4f8c-9915-4f6e4cf7c8b5", "subject": "Persons  Personnes", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Business Line - Applications Received for Temporary Residents (in Persons)", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Tableau. Le nombre total de demandes re\u00e7ues pour le statut de r\u00e9sident temporaire au Canada, selon le type : visiteurs, travailleurs \u00e9trangers temporaires et \u00e9tudiants. Les comparaisons (variation en pourcentage) sont \u00e9galement fournies.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000004-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-29", "time_period_coverage_start": "2007-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2012-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "2013-04-02", "url": "", "notes": "Table.  The total number of applications received for temporary resident status in Canada, by type:  visitors, temporary foreign workers and students.  Comparisons (percentage change) are also provided.", "owner_org": "cic", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Secteur d'activit\u00e9 - Visas, permis et prorogations d\u00e9livr\u00e9s pour les r\u00e9sidents temporaires (en personnes)", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "8a62d571-6b4b-42a6-8c26-a712ec43baeb", "subject": "Persons  Personnes", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Business Line - Visas, Permits and Extensions Issued for Temporary Residents (in Persons)", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Tableau. Le nombre total de visas, de prolongations et de permis canadiens d\u00e9livr\u00e9s pour les r\u00e9sidents temporaires, selon le type : visiteurs, travailleurs \u00e9trangers temporaires et \u00e9tudiants. Les comparaisons (variation en pourcentage) sont \u00e9galement fournies.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000006-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-29", "time_period_coverage_start": "2007-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2012-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "2013-04-02", "url": "", "notes": "Table.  The total number of Canadian visas, permits and extensions issued for temporary residents, by type:  visitors, temporary foreign workers and students.   Comparisons (percentage change) are also provided.", "owner_org": "cic", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Demandes de visa de r\u00e9sident permanent re\u00e7ues \u00e0 l'\u00e9tranger", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "5c003561-ce36-4881-a5a4-c30f9f456690", "subject": "Persons  Personnes", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Permanent Resident Visa Applications Received Abroad", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Tableaux et graphique. Cet ensemble de donn\u00e9es se compose de cinq tableaux interactifs distincts et d'un graphique, tous accessibles par les onglets au bas de la feuille de calcul. Les tableaux peuvent \u00eatre personnalis\u00e9s en utilisant certains ou la totalit\u00e9 des limiteurs suivants, selon l'affichage du tableau principal :\nDestination (telle que d\u00e9clar\u00e9e par le demandeur) : Toutes les destinations canadiennes, les destinations f\u00e9d\u00e9rales ou le Qu\u00e9bec.\nCat\u00e9gorie d'immigration : comprend les cat\u00e9gories \u00e9conomiques (travailleurs qualifi\u00e9s, entrepreneurs, travailleurs autonomes, investisseurs, gens d'affaires, candidats des provinces/territoires, aides familiaux r\u00e9sidants, et cat\u00e9gorie de l'exp\u00e9rience canadienne) et cat\u00e9gories non \u00e9conomiques (regroupement familial [y compris les conjoints/partenaires/enfants et les parents/grands-parents], les r\u00e9fugi\u00e9s ou leurs personnes \u00e0 charge [parrain\u00e9s par le gouvernement ou parrain\u00e9s par le secteur priv\u00e9] les personnes prot\u00e9g\u00e9es, et les \u00ab autres \u00bb).\nLangue : voir le tableau en anglais ou en fran\u00e7ais.\nPoint de service : le Bureau de r\u00e9ception centralis\u00e9e (BRC-Sydney) et les bureaux individuels \u00e0 l'\u00e9tranger dans les r\u00e9gions suivantes : Afrique et Moyen-Orient; Asie et Pacifique; et Europe; et Am\u00e9rique.\nVoir le tableau : afficher les donn\u00e9es en termes de nombre de personnes ou de cas.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000026-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-29", "time_period_coverage_start": "2007-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2012-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "2013-04-02", "url": "", "notes": "Tables and graph.  This data set consists of 5 separate, interactive tables and 1 graph, all accessible by the tabs at the bottom of the spreadsheet.  Tables may be customized using some or all of the following limiters, depending on the primary table view:\nDestination (as declared by the applicant):  All Canadian destinations, federal destinations, or Quebec.\nImmigration category:  includes economic classes (skilled workers, entrepreneurs, self-employed, investors, business, provincial/territorial nominees, live-in caregiver program, and the Canadian experience class) and non-economic classes (family class (including spouses/partners/children and parents/grandparents), refugees (government-sponsored or privately-sponsored refugees, and refugee dependants), protected persons, and \"others\").\nLanguage:  view the table in English or French.\nPoint of service:  the Centralized Intake Office (CIO-Sydney) and individual offices abroad in the following areas:  Africa and Middle East, Asia and Pacific, Europe, and the Americas.\nTable view:  view the data in terms of numbers of people or numbers of cases.", "owner_org": "cic", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Demandes trait\u00e9es \u00e0 l'\u00e9tranger et le temps de traitement", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "427337d0-7c36-4fed-8428-c6a63f8c19b3", "subject": "Persons  Personnes", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Permanent Resident Applications Processed Abroad and Processing Times", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Tableaux. Cet ensemble de donn\u00e9es se compose de trois tableaux interactifs distincts, accessibles par les onglets au bas de la feuille de calcul. Les tableaux peuvent \u00eatre personnalis\u00e9s en utilisant certains ou la totalit\u00e9 des limiteurs suivants, selon l'affichage du tableau principal :\nDestination : Qu\u00e9bec, f\u00e9d\u00e9ral, ou toutes les destinations.\nCat\u00e9gorie d'immigration : cat\u00e9gories \u00e9conomiques (travailleurs qualifi\u00e9s, gens d'affaires, candidats des provinces, aides familiaux r\u00e9sidants ou cat\u00e9gorie de l'exp\u00e9rience canadienne) et non \u00e9conomiques (cat\u00e9gorie du regroupement familial, r\u00e9fugi\u00e9s ou circonstances d'ordre humanitaire), y compris les sous-groupes.\nLangue : anglais ou fran\u00e7ais.\nEmplacement du bureau des visas : points de service \u00e0 l'\u00e9tranger dans les grandes r\u00e9gions suivantes : Afrique et Moyen-Orient; Asie et Pacifique; Europe; et Am\u00e9rique.\nAffichage du tableau : quelques statistiques peuvent \u00eatre consult\u00e9es selon le nombre de cas trait\u00e9s (y compris les cas approuv\u00e9s et refus\u00e9s, le taux d'approbation et le nombre de visas d\u00e9livr\u00e9s), les d\u00e9lais de traitement (en g\u00e9n\u00e9ral le pourcentage de cas trait\u00e9s dans un certain nombre de mois ou jours ), ou le nombre de personnes.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000001-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-29", "time_period_coverage_start": "2007-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2012-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "2013-04-02", "url": "", "notes": "Tables.  This data set consists of 3 separate, interactive tables accessible by the tabs at the bottom of the spreadsheet.  Tables may be customized using some or all of the following limiters, depending on the primary table view:\nDestination: Quebec, federal, or all destinations.\nImmigration category: economic classes (skilled workers, business, provincial nominees, live-in caregiver program, or Canadian experience class) and non-economic classes (family class, refugees, or humanitarian and compassionate), including subgroups.\nLanguage:  English or French.\nVisa office location:  points of service overseas in the following broad areas:  Africa and Middle East, Asia and Pacific, Europe, and the Americas.\nTable view:  some statistics may be viewed by the number of cases processed (including cases passed, cases refused, approval rate percentage and number of visas issued), by processing times (usually the percentage of cases processed within a certain number of months or days), or by number of persons.", "owner_org": "cic", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Sommaire pour les r\u00e9sidents permanents par mission", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "fd6f93ed-6249-42a4-ac30-5a1a7aa48389", "subject": "Persons  Personnes", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Permanent Resident Summary by Mission", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Tableaux. Cet ensemble de donn\u00e9es se compose de six tableaux interactifs distincts, accessibles par les onglets au bas de la feuille de calcul. Les tableaux peuvent \u00eatre personnalis\u00e9s en utilisant certains ou la totalit\u00e9 des limiteurs suivants, selon l'affichage du tableau principal :\nDestination (telle que d\u00e9clar\u00e9e par le demandeur) : Toutes les destinations canadiennes, les destinations f\u00e9d\u00e9rales, l'une des 13 provinces ou l'un des territoires individuels du Canada, ou destination inconnue/manquante/non valide.\nCat\u00e9gorie d'immigration : comprend les cat\u00e9gories \u00e9conomiques (travailleurs qualifi\u00e9s, gens d'affaires, candidats des provinces, aides familiaux r\u00e9sidants, cat\u00e9gorie de l'exp\u00e9rience canadienne, et sous-groupes connexes) et les cat\u00e9gories non \u00e9conomiques (regroupement familial, r\u00e9fugi\u00e9s, motifs d'ordre humanitaire, autres/manquant/non valide et sous-groupes connexes).\nLangue : voir le tableau en anglais ou en fran\u00e7ais.\nMission d'emplacement : diff\u00e9rents points de service dans les grandes r\u00e9gions suivantes : Afrique et Moyen-Orient; Asie et Pacifique; Europe; et Am\u00e9rique.\nR\u00e9sultat : nombre de demandes r\u00e9ussies/refus\u00e9es/retir\u00e9es, nombre de visas d\u00e9livr\u00e9s; taux d'approbation (%).\nVoir le tableau : afficher les donn\u00e9es en termes de nombre de personnes ou de cas.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000009-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-29", "time_period_coverage_start": "2002-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2012-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "2013-04-02", "url": "", "notes": "Tables.  This data set consists of 6 separate, interactive tables accessible by the tabs at the bottom of the spreadsheet.  Tables may be customized using some or all of the following limiters, depending on the primary table view:\nDestination (as declared by the applicant):  All Canadian destinations, federal destinations, any of the individual 13 provinces and territories of Canada, or unknown/missing/invalid.\nImmigration category:  includes economic classes (skilled workers, business, provincial nominees, live-in caregiver program, Canadian experience class, and related subgroups) and non-economic classes (family class, refugees, humanitarian and compassionate, others, missing or invalid, and related subgroups).\nLanguage:  view the table in English or French.\nMission location:  individual points of service in the following broad areas:  Africa and Middle East, Asia and Pacific, Europe, and the Americas.\nOutcome:  number of applications passed/refused/withdrawn; number of visas issued; approval rate (%).\nTable view:  view the data in terms of numbers of people or numbers of cases.", "owner_org": "cic", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Canada - R\u00e9sidents permanents selon la cat\u00e9gorie", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "6a26595e-3b66-4591-b795-87702ed5d58e", "subject": "Persons  Personnes", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Canada - Permanent residents by category", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Le nombre total de personnes ayant obtenu le statut de r\u00e9sident permanent, par cat\u00e9gorie d'immigration : regroupement familial, immigrants \u00e9conomiques, r\u00e9fugi\u00e9s, autres immigrants et cat\u00e9gorie non d\u00e9clar\u00e9e. Les totaux sont fournis pour les sous-groupes des trois premi\u00e8res cat\u00e9gories, avec des totaux distincts pour les demandeurs principaux et les conjoints et personnes \u00e0 charge dans la cat\u00e9gorie des immigrants \u00e9conomiques.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000011-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-29", "time_period_coverage_start": "2011-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2012-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "2013-04-02", "url": "", "notes": "The total number of people granted permanent resident status in Canada, by immigration category:  family class, economic immigrants, refugees, other immigrants and category not stated.  Totals are provided for subgroups of the first three categories, with separate totals provided for principal applicants and for spouses and dependants in the economic immigrant category.", "owner_org": "cic", "keywords_fra": ""}
{"validation_override": true, "portal_release_date": "", "data_series_issue_identification_fra": "", "catalog_type": "Data | Donn\u00e9es", "title_fra": "Canada - R\u00e9sidents permanents et temporaires", "keywords": "", "data_series_issue_identification": "", "ready_to_publish": "", "id": "17b4a2d0-86d1-491c-b733-429bd31492ee", "subject": "Persons  Personnes", "data_series_name_fra": "", "spatial_representation_type": "", "maintenance_and_update_frequency": "Quarterly | Trimestriel", "title": "Canada - Permanent and Temporary Residents", "author_email": "open-ouvert@tbs-sct.gc.ca", "geographic_region": "", "notes_fra": "Tableau. Le nombre total de personnes ayant obtenu le statut de r\u00e9sident permanent au Canada et le nombre total de personnes qui sont entr\u00e9es au Canada comme r\u00e9sidents temporaires pour chaque trimestre de 2009 et pour le premier trimestre de 2010, par cat\u00e9gorie d'immigration (r\u00e9sidents permanents) : regroupement familial, immigrants \u00e9conomiques, r\u00e9fugi\u00e9s, autres immigrants et cat\u00e9gorie non d\u00e9clar\u00e9e, et selon le statut annuel (la principale raison de la r\u00e9sidence temporaire) : travailleurs \u00e9trangers, \u00e9tudiants \u00e9trangers, groupe vis\u00e9 par les circonstances d'ordre humanitaire et autres.", "digital_object_identifier": "", "presentation_form": "", "spatial": "", "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "resources": [{"name_fra": "Ensemble de donn\u00e9es", "language": "eng; CAN | fra; CAN", "format": "other", "url": "http://www.cic.gc.ca/opendata-donneesouvertes/data/000010-eng.xls", "resource_type": "file", "name": "Dataset"}], "browse_graphic_url": "", "attribution": "", "topic_category": "", "attribution_fra": "", "endpoint_url_fra": "", "date_published": "2010-09-23", "time_period_coverage_start": "2007-01-01", "data_series_name": "", "url_fra": "", "endpoint_url": "", "time_period_coverage_end": "2012-12-31", "language": "", "date_modified": "2013-04-02", "url": "", "notes": "Table.  The total number of people granted permanent resident status in Canada and the total number of people who entered Canada as temporary residents for each quarter of 2009 and for the first quarter of 2010, by immigration category (permanent residents):   family class, economic immigrants, refugees, other immigrants and category not stated; and by yearly status (the primary reason for temporary residency):  foreign workers, foreign students, humanitarian population and other.", "owner_org": "cic", "keywords_fra": ""}
